sa cāsau gajaśca tamiva prekṣaṇīyaṃ darśanīyaṃ meghaṃ 
dadarśa |

gajaprekṣaṇīyamityatrevalopālluptopamā |

kecidāṣāḍhasya prathamadivasa ityatra pratyāsanne nabhasīti vakṣyamāṇanabhomāsapratyāsattyarthaṃ praśamadivasa iti pāṭhaṃ kalpayanti | 
tadasaṅgatam| prathamātireke kāraṇābhāvāt|
nabhomāsasya pratyāsattyarthamityuktamiti cenna|
pratyāsattimātrasya māsapratyāsattyaiva prathamadivasasyāpi
upapatteḥ| atyantapratyāsatterupayogābhāvenāvivakṣitatvāt|

vivakṣitatve vā svapakṣe 'pi prathamadivasātikrameṇa
meghadarśanakalpanāyāṃ pramāṇābhāvena tadasambhāvāt|

pratyutāsmatpakṣa eva kuśalasandeśasya
bhāvyanarthapratīkārārthasya purata evānumānamuktaṃ bhavati
ityupayogasiddhiḥ||

nanūnmattasya nāyam viveka iti cenna|

unmattasya nānarthasya pratīkārārthaṃ pravṛttirapīti sandeśa eva mā bhūt|

tathā ca kāvyārambha evāprasiddhiḥ syādityaho mūlacchedī pāṇḍityaprakarṣaḥ||

kathaṃ tarhi śāpānto me bhujagaśayanādutthite śā"rngapāṇau
ityādinā bhagavatprabodhāvadhikasya śāpasya
māsacatuṣṭayāvaśiṣṭasyoktiḥ , daśadivasādhikyāditi cet
svapakṣe 'pi kathaṃ sā viṃśatidivasairnyūnatvāditi
santoṣṭavyam|

tasmādīṣadvaiṣamyamavivakṣitamiti suṣṭhūktaṃ 
prathamadivase iti|| 2 ||

\sumativijaya

vyākhyā |

sa kāmī madanavihvalo yakṣas tasminrāmagirināmni parvate meghaṃ dadarśa dṛṣṭavān ||

kiṃ kṛtvā | katicidaṣṭau māsānnītvā gamayitvā |

kva | āṣāḍhasya prathamadivasa ekādaśīdine |

kathambhūto yakṣaḥ| abalāviprayukto dūrasthitastrīkaḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūto yakṣaḥ| kanakavalayabhraṃśariktaprakoṣṭhaḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ megham | āśliṣṭasānumāliṅgitaśikharam |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ megham | vaprakrīḍāpariṇatagajaprekṣaṇīyam |

iti anvayaḥ||

āṣādhetyāṣāḍhasya prathamadivase prāntadivase pūrṇimāyām
| prathameti a viṣṇuḥ pratham adivase tasmin adivase | ekādaśī
ityarthas |

prathamiti meghasya viśeṣaṇam | kathambhūtam megham prathamiti |
tata ekādaśīdina iti samādhānam ||

abaletyabalayā bharyayā viprayukto rahito 'balāviprayuktaḥ 
||

kanaketi kanakasya suvarṇasya valaye kaṅkaṇe kanakavalaye tayoḥ 
bhraṃśena paścātpatanena rikte śūnye prakoṣṭhe kalācike yasya sa
kanakavalayabhraṃśariktaprakoṣṭhaḥ| atha vā kanakavalayabhraṃśena
suvarṇakaṭakabhraṃśena riktaḥ śūnyaḥ prakoṣṭho bhujamadhyaḥ 
yasya sa kanakavalayabhraṃśariktaprakoṣṭhaḥ||

vapreti vapreṣu taṭeṣu yā krīḍā tasyai pariṇataḥ 
tiryagdattaprahāra īdṛśo yo gajo hastī tadvat
prekṣaṇīyo 'valokanīyo yaḥ sa taṃ 
vaprakrīḍāpariṇatagajaprekṣṇīyam ||

atra meghagajayoḥ sāmyatā | luptopamālaṅkāraḥ|| 2 ||

tasya sthitvā kathamapi puraḥ ketakādhānahetoḥ 

antarbāṣpaściramanucaro rājarājasya dadhyau|

meghāloke bhavati sukhino 'pyanyathāvritti cetaḥ 

kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini jane kiṃ puno dūrasaṃsthe|| 3 ||

kautuka/ketuka Da; kautuka° Ma; tasya āśleṣa° (Da);

VALL

tasya jīmūtasya puro 'grataḥ kathamapi sthitvā rājarājasya
vaiśravaṇasyānucaro bhṛtyo 'ntarbāṣpo 'srukaṇṭhaḥ kiṃ 
apyajñāyamānaṃ vastu ciraṃ dadhyāvacintayat|

kīdṛśasya | ketakādhānahetoḥ ketakākhyapuṣpajananakāraṇasya|
prāvṛṣi teṣāmudbhavāt|

atha jaladadarśanamātreṇa kasmādasyāntarbāṣpatvaṃ dhyānaṃ cetyāha |

sukhino 'pyaviyuktasyāpi meghāloke varṣāloke cetaḥ 
anyathāvṛtti saviparyayamanalpotkaṇṭhāsaṅkulam |

kiṃ punaḥ kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini priyatamākhye jane dūravartini
sati |

varṣāsamayamāgatamavalokya svasthā api yatrotkaṇṭhante
tatra virahiṇām kā kathetyarthaḥ|

kaṇṭhāśleṣa eva praṇayo 'rthitā vidyate yasya |

meghā ālokyante yasminniti varṣāḥ|

svarūpātpracyutāvasthamanyathāvṛtti || 3 ||?

\daksināvarta

tasya sthitvā kathamapi pura iti | svapravṛttiṃ priyāṃ prati
meghena hārayitukāmastadarthaṃ meghasya svāgatādikaraṇāya
kāmārto 'pi mahatā yatnena tasya puraḥ sthitvetyabhiprāyaḥ 
||

kautukādhānahetoriti pāṭhaḥ| kautukaṃ kāmaviṣayautsukyam |
kautukārpaṇahetorityarthaḥ| kautukaṃ viṣayābhāge hastasūtre kutūhale, kāme khyāte maṅgale ceti yādavaḥ|

ketukādhānahetoriti pāṭhaḥ| ketukānāṃ garbhādhānahetoriti
arthaḥ kila bhavet | idamatyantaślāghyaviśeṣaṇaṃ na syāditi
boddhavyam | kautukādhānahetoriti viśeṣaṇaṃ manorathasthitaṃ 
meghasvāgatādikāryaṃ vismṛtya sa paravaśo babhūvetyarthasya
kāraṇatvenoktam ||

antarbāṣpaḥ prabhutvādantaḥstambhitabāṣpaḥ| prabhutvaṃ 
rājarājasyānucara iti sūcitam ||

ciraṃ dadhyāviti sambandhaḥ| dadhyau cintayāmāsa | mohāt
viṣayaśūnyacittatayā dhyāyateḥ karmāprayogaḥ||

sukhinaḥ sukhahetumataḥ| sannihitapriyajanasyetyarthaḥ||

anyathāvṛttyutkaṇṭhāparavaśam ||

kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini jana iti | varṣāsamaye
meghagarjitaśravaṇabhayāt bhartṛkaṇṭhamāliṅgituṃ 
prārthayamāne priyajana ityarthaḥ|| ?

tasyāśleṣapraṇayini jana iti pāṭhaḥ| tasya yakṣasya |

dūrasaṃsthe dūrasthite || 3 ||

?which reading kaṇṭhśleṣa or tasyāśleṣa?

\mallinātha

tasyeti|

rājano yakṣāḥ| rājā prabhau nṛpe candre yakṣe
kṣatriyaśakrayoriti viśvaḥ| rājñāṃ rājā rājarājaḥ kuberaḥ 
| rājarājo dhanādhipa ityamaraḥ| rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ ṭac
iti ṭacpratyayaḥ|

tasya anucaro yakṣaḥ|

antarbāṣpo dhīrodāttatvādantaḥsthambhitāśruḥ san|

kautukādhānahetorabhilāṣotpādakāraṇasya| kautukaṃ cābhilāṣe
syādutsave narmaharśayoriti viśvaḥ||

tasya meghasya puro 'gre kathamapi garīyasā prayatnenetyarthaḥ 
||

jñānahetuvivakṣāyāmapyādi kathamavyayam|?

kathamādi tathāpyantaṃ yatnagauravabāḍhayorityujjvalaḥ|

sthitvā ciraṃ dadhyau cintayāmāsa| dhyai cintāyāmiti dhātoḥ 
liṭ|

manovikāropaśamanaparyantamiti śeṣaḥ||

vikārahetumāha meghāloka iti|

meghāloke meghadarśane sati sukhino 'pi priyādijanasaṅgatasyāpi
cetaścittamanyathābhūtā vṛttirvyāpāro yasya tat
anyathāvṛtti bhavati |

vikṛtimāpadyata ityarthaḥ||

kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini kaṇṭhāliṅganarthini jane||

dūre saṃsthā sthitiryasya tasmin dūrasaṃsthe sati kiṃ punaḥ|
virahiṇaḥ kimuta vaktavyamityarthaḥ| virahiṇāṃ 
meghasandarśanamuddīpanaṃ bhavatīti bhāvaḥ||

arthāntaranyāso 'laṅkāraḥ| taduktaṃ daṇḍinā

jñeyaḥ so 'rthāntaranyāso vastu prastutya kiñcana|

tatsādhanasamarthasya nyāso yo 'nyasya vastunaḥ|| iti || 3 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

rājarājasya dhanadadevasyānucaraḥ sevako yakṣaściraṃ 
cirakālaṃ dadhyau cintāyukto 'bhūt |

kiṃ kṛtvā | kathamapi mahatā kaṣṭena virahavedanādaurbalyena tasya
meghasya puro 'gre sthitvā ||

kathambhūtasya tasya | ketakādhānahetoḥ||

kathambhūto 'nucaraḥ| antarbāṣpaḥ saśokatvādgadgadasvaraḥ||

yato yasmātkāraṇātsukhino 'pi sastrīkasyāpi cetaḥ 
hṛdayaṃ meghāloke meghadarśane 'nyathāvṛtti viparītaṃ bhavati
atyantarāgamadbhavati tadā kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini jane snehayukte
strīlakṣaṇe dūrasaṃsthe sati kiṃ punarbhaṇyate |

ityanvayaḥ||

dadhyāviti | dhyai cintāyāṃ dhātoḥ parokṣe [liṭ] dadhyāviti
rūpam ||

ketaketi | ketakānāṃ ketakīkusumānāmādhānaṃ niṣpattiḥ 
ketakādhānaṃ tasya hetuḥ ketakādhānahetustasya ketukādhānahetoḥ 
| varṣāṛtau hi kila ketakī puṣpatīti bhāvaḥ||

antariti | antarmadhye hṛdaye bāṣpānyaśrūṇi yasya saḥ 
antarbāṣpaḥ|| megheti | meghasyāloke darśanaṃ meghālokaḥ 
tasminmeghāloke || 3 ||

pratyāsanne nabhasi dayitājīvitālambanārthī

jīmūtena svakuśalamayīṃ hārayiṣyanpravṛttim|

sa pratyagraiḥ kuṭajakusumaiḥ kalpitārghāya tasmai

prītaḥ prītipramukhavacanaṃ svāgataṃ vyājahāra|| 4 ||

nabhasi (Da); manasi Da,(Ma); °arthām Da, °artham Su;

VALL

tato 'sau guhyakastasmai meghāya svāgataṃ vyājahāra | śobhanaṃ 
āgatam te 'stvityabravīt|

prītipramukhānṇi snehapūrvakāṇi vacanāni yatra svāgate tadyathā|
bhadra svastho 'si| kuśalaṃ te sarvatra| viśramyatām|
pavitrīkriyatāmidaṃ sthānamiti|

kīdṛśo 'sau| jīmūtena meghena svakuśalayayīmātmaśreyorūpāṃ 
pravṛttiṃ vārttāṃ hārayiṣyannāyayiṣyan| yato 'sau
dayitāyā jīvatālambanaṃ prāṇasandhāraṇamarthayate|
bhartṛkalyāṇādhigamāddhi priyatamānāṃ samāśvaso jāyate|

kīdṛśāya tasmai| sarasaiḥ kuṭajakusumaiḥ kalpitārghāya
vihitapūjāya|

ata evāsau prītaḥ|

āṣāḍhasya praśamadivasa iti ya evārtha uktaḥ sa eva
pratyāsanne nabhasītyanūditaḥ| nabhāḥ śrāvaṇaḥ| yadi vā
jaladanicitatvātpratyāsanne nikaṭavartinīva nabhasi gagana iti
vyākhyeyamiti kecit|

gagana eva jīmūto vārttāṃ nayati| sa hi prītiṃ kurvan
nāyayati|

prītyā hārayiṣyanniti ṇijutpattiḥ|

tataḥ ḷṭ śeṣe ceti cakārātkriyārthāyāmupapade ḷṭ|

pravṛttiṃ hārayituṃ svāgataṃ vyājahāretyarthaḥ|

jīmūteneti | hṛkroranyatarasyām iti pakṣe yathāprāptaṃ 
kartṛtvam|

tasmā iti| kriyayā yamabhipraiti sa sampradānam iti
sampradānavacanam|| 4 ||

\daksināvarta

pratyāsanna iti |

pratyāsanne prakṛtisthe manasi cetasi dhyānavyākulite hṛdaye punaḥ 
pratiṣṭhite satītyarthas |

pratyāsanne nabhasīti pāṭhe nabhaḥśabdaḥ śrāvaṇamāsavacanaḥ 
| nabhaḥ khaṃ śrāvaṇo nabhā ityamarasiṃhavacanāt | tadā
prastutamāṣāḍhaṃ vihāya vilambanamayuktamiti mantavyam | kiṃ
ca śrāvaṇamāse māsānanyāngamaya caturo locane mīlayitvā
iti vacanaṃ syādayuktamiti {107} ||

anye tvāhuḥ| nabhaḥśabdo varṣartuvācako varṣāsamaye
samāgate dayitājīvitālambanārthāṃ svapravṛttiṃ jīmūtena
hārayiṣyanniti varṣāsamayātprāgeva tasya cinteti | tat
apyasaṅgatam | ityautsukyādaparigaṇayanguhyakastam yayāca 
iti tātkālikakāryacintānirdeśāt ||

dayitājīvatālambanārthām dayitājīvitaprayojanām ||

jīmūtena | prakṛtasya tacchabdaṃ vinā nāmna upadānaṃ 
vākyāntaravyavadhānādityanusandheyam ||

pravṛttim vṛttāntam ||

kuṭajakusumaiḥ| kuṭajo girimalliketi halāyudhaḥ|
kuṭajakusumagrahaṇaṃ vārṣakatvātkṛtamityanusandheyam ||

kalpitārghā iti pāṭhas | kalpitapūjāvidhaye | 
mūlye pūjāvidhāvargha ityamaraḥ| 
prītipramukhavacanaṃ pūjyānāṃ prītivacane
pradhānavacanaṃ svāgataṃ śobhanamāgatamāgamanam | anena
svāgataśabdo vivakṣitaḥ|| 4 ||

\mallinātha

atha samāhitāntaḥkaraṇaḥ sankiṃ kṛtavānityata āha
pratyāsanna iti ||

sa yakṣaḥ| yaściraṃ dadhyau sa ityarthaḥ|

nabhasi śrāvaṇe| nabhaḥ khaṃ śrāvaṇo nabhā ityamaraḥ||

pratyāsanne āṣāḍhasyānantaraṃ saṃnikṛṣṭe| prāpte satīti
arthaḥ|

dayitājīvitālambanārthī san varṣākālasya virahaduḥkhajanakatvāt
utpannānarthapratīkārādanarthotpattipratibandha eva varam|

iti nyāyena prageva priyāprāṇadhāraṇopāyaṃ cikīrṣuriti
arthaḥ|

jīvanasyodakasya mūtaḥ paṭabandho vastrabandho jīmūtaḥ|
pṛṣodarāditvātsādhuḥ| mūtaḥ syātpaṭabandhe 'pi iti rudraḥ 
|

tena jīmūtena jaladhareṇa prayojyena svakuśalamayīṃ 
svakṣemapradhānām pravṛttiṃ vārttām| vārttā pravṛttirvṛttānta ityamaraḥ|

hārayiṣyan prāpayiṣyan| ḷṭ śeṣe ca iti cakārāt
kriyārthakriyopapadādḷṭpratyayaḥ|

jīvanārthaṃ karma jīvanapradenaiva kartavyamiti bhāvaḥ|

hṛkroranyatarasyām iti karmasañjñāyā vikalpātpakṣe kartari
tṛtīyā||

pratyagrairabhinavaiḥ kuṭajakusumairgirimallikābhiḥ| kuṭajaḥ 
girimallikā iti halāyudhaḥ||

kalpitārghāya kalpito 'nuṣṭhito 'rghaḥ pūjāvidhiryasya
tasmai||

mūlye pūjāvidhāvargha ityamaraḥ||

tasmai jīmūtāya| kriyāgrahaṇamapi kartavyam iti sampradānatvāt
caturthī|

prītipramukhāni prītipūrvakāṇi vacanāni yasminkarmaṇi tat
prītipramukhavacanaṃ yathā tathā|

śobhanamāgataṃ svāgataṃ svāgatavacanaṃ prītaḥ san vyājahāra|

kuśalāgamanaṃ papracchetyarthaḥ|

nāthena tvatra pratyāsanne manasi iti sādhīyānpāṭhaḥ kalpitaḥ 
|

pratyāsanne prakṛtimāpanne satītyarthaḥ|

yastu tenaiva pūrvapāṭhavirodhaḥ pradarśitaḥ so 'smābhiḥ 
āṣāḍhasya prathamadivase ityetatpāṭhavikalpasamādhānenaiva
parihṛtaḥ|| 4 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

kiṃ kṛtavānasamāhitāntaḥkaraṇaḥ sansa yakṣas ||

tasmai meghāya svāgataṃ susvāgamanavārttāṃ vyajahārāpṛcchat |

kimbhūto yakṣaḥ| prītaḥ santuṣṭo matkāryaṃ setsyatīti
hetoḥ||

kathambhūtāya tasmai | pratyagrairnūtanaiḥ kuṭajakusumaiḥ 
kuṭajavṛkṣotpannapuṣpaiḥ kalpitārghāya racitapūjāya ||

sa yakṣaḥ kiṃ kāriṣyan | 
jīmūtena meghena pārśvataḥ svakīyakalyāṇarūpām pravṛttiṃ vārttām hārayiṣyanprāpayiṣyan
||

kimartham | dayitājīvatālambanārtham nijabhāryāyāḥ 
jīvitavyarakṣaṇārtham ||

kva sati | nabhasi śrāvaṇe māse pratyāsanne samīpasthe sati |

kathambhūtaṃ svāgatam| prītipramukhavacanaṃ prītyā manoharaṃ vacanam | 
ityanvayaḥ||

kalpiteti kalpito racitaḥ puṣpādiḍhaukanarūpo 'rgho yena
tasmai kalpitārghāya ||

nabhaḥ śrāvaṇe māsa iti haimaḥ|

dayitāyāḥ svabhāryāyā jīvitaṃ tadevālambanaṃ sa eva
arthaḥ prayojanaṃ yatra taddayitājīvitālambanārtham || 4 ||

dhūmajyotiḥsalilamarutāṃ saṃnipātaḥ kva meghaḥ 

sandeśārthāḥ kva paṭukaranaiḥ prāṇibhiḥ prāpaṇīyāḥ|

ityautsukyādaparigaṇayanguhyakastaṃ yayāce

kāmārtā hi praṇayakṛpaṇāścetanācetaneṣu  || 5 ||

°arthas Da; sandeśāś ca (Da);  prakṛti° Ma,Su;

VALL

nanvacetanasya meghasya dūtyaṃ kathamityāha ||

guhyakaḥ puṇyajano .autsukyādutkaṇṭhāvaśādityevaṃ 
aparigaṇayannavimṛśaṃstaṃ meghaṃ yayāce prārthayata |

kimityāha | kva meghaḥ kva sandeśārthā vārttāvastūni|

meghastāvaddhūmajyotiḥsalilamarutāṃ samudāyaḥ|
dhūmādimayānyacetanāni hyabhrāṇi|

sandeśārthāḥ paṭukaraṇaiścaturendriyaiḥ prāṇibhirmānavaiḥ 
prāpaṇīyā netuṃ śakyāḥ| na tu nirbuddhibhiḥ|

kathaṃ tarhyetadasau na vimṛṣṭavānityāha|

yasmādye kāmārtā madanavāgurāpīḍitāste cetanācetaneṣu siṃhapādapādiṣu praṇayakṛpaṇāḥ prārthanādīnā bhavanti|

na hi te viṣayamaviṣayaṃ vā vivektuṃ samarthā iti bhaṅgyā
kaviḥ svadoṣaṃ nirasyati|| 5 ||

\daksināvarta

sandeśaharaṇākhyasya vastunaścaitanyaśūnyena meghena duṣkaratvaṃ 
āśaṅkya pariharati dhūmeti ||

sannipātaḥ samudāyaḥ|

sandeśārthaḥ sandeśa evārthaḥ sandeśārtha iti
karmadhārayaḥ| sandeśāśceti kecit paṭhanti |

paṭukaraṇaiḥ paṭvindriyaiḥ| khamakṣamindriyaṃ srotaḥ|
hṛṣīkaṃ karaṇaṃ matamiti halāyudhaḥ|

autsukyādiṣṭārthodyuktatvāt | iṣṭārthodyukta utsuka iti
amaraḥ|

ityaparigaṇayannitisambandhaḥ|

guhyako nidhiṃ gūhata iti guhyakas | yakṣāṇāṃ 
vaiśravaṇanidhigūhanātkriyānāmadheyamidam | atha vā
yakṣaguhyakaśabdau dhanade 'pi vartete | atho yakṣaguhyakau | dhanada 
apīti yādavaḥ| tasmādvaiśravaṇavācakena guhyakaśabdena
tadbhṛtyānāṃ yakṣāṇāṃ vyapadeśasya yuktatvāduktaṃ guhyakaḥ 
iti | tasmādyakṣaguhyakayorbhede satyapi yakṣaścakra iti
apekṣya guhyakaśabdasya virodho na bhavatītyanusandheyam |

yayāca iti vakṣyamāṇāpekṣayā | praṇayakṛpaṇā yācñāyāṃ kṣudrāḥ| kṣudratvaṃ ca dṛṣṭāparityāgaḥ|

cetanācetaneṣviyaṃ hi viṣayasaptamī | acetaneṣvapīti vaktavye
cetanācetanagrahaṇaṃ dhūmajyotiḥsalilamarutāmityādinā
prastutasyācetanasya tadananataraṃ kva paṭukaraṇairiti
upakṣiptasya cetanasya cānuguṇena kṛtamityanusandheyam || 5 ||

\mallinātha

nanu cetanāsādhyamarthaṃ kathamacetanena kārayituṃ pravṛttaḥ 
ityapekṣāyāṃ kaviḥ samādhatte dhūmeti||

dhūmaśca jyotiśca salilaṃ ca marudvāyuśca teṣāṃ 
saṃnipāto meghaḥ kva | acetanatvātsandeśānarhaḥ||

paṭukaraṇaiḥ samarthendriyaiḥ| karaṇaṃ sādhakatamaṃ 
kṣetragātrendriyeṣvapītyamaraḥ|

prāṇibhiścetanaiḥ| prāṇī tu cetano janmītyamaraḥ|

prāpaṇīyāḥ prāpayitavyāḥ|

sandiśyanta iti sandeśāste evārthāḥ kva|

ityevamautsukyādiṣṭārthodyuktatvāt| iṣṭārthodyuktaṃ 
utsuka ityamaraḥ||

aparigaṇayan avicārayanguhyako yakṣastaṃ meghaṃ yayāce
yācitavān|

yācṛ yācñāyām|

tathā hi kāmārtā madanāturāścetanāścācetanāśca teṣu viṣaye prakṛtikṛpaṇāḥ svabhāvadīnāḥ| 
kāmāndhānāṃ yuktāyuktavivekaśūnyatvādacetanayācñā na virudhyata ityarthaḥ 
||

atra meghasandeśayorvirūpayorghaṭanādviṣamālaṅkāraḥ| tat
uktam

viruddhakāryasyotpattiryatrānarthasya vā bhavet|

virūpaghaṭanā cāsau viṣamālaṅkṛtistridhā|| iti|

sā cārthāntaranyāsānuprāṇitā tatsamarthakatvenaiva caturthapāde tasyopanyāsāt|| 5 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

guhyako yakṣas taṃ meghaṃ yayāce prāthayāmāsa ||

guhyakaḥ kiṃ kurvan | iti vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇautsukyāt
utkaṇṭhākulatvādaparigaṇayannavicārayan ||

kathamityāha | meghaḥ kva, sandeśārthāḥ kva sandeśavacanāni
kva | kvaśabdo mahadantare ||

kathambhūto meghaḥ| dhūmajyotiḥsalilamarutāṃ sannipāto dhūmavahnijalavāyūnāṃ samūhaḥ| 
megha eteṣāṃ dhūmādīnāmekībhāvāt ||

kathambhūtāḥ sandeśārthāḥ| prāṇibhirmanuṣyaiḥ 
prāpaṇīyāḥ prāpayituṃ śakyāḥ|

kathambhūtaiḥ prāṇibhiḥ| paṭukaraṇaiḥ sarvendriyayuktaiḥ|

hi yasmāt kāraṇāt kāmārtāḥ kāmapīḍitā janāścetanācetaneṣu prakṛtikṛpaṇāḥ prakṛtyā svabhāvena kṛpaṇā vikalāḥ prakṛtikṛpaṇā bhavanti |
cetanācetanasvabhāvaparijñānavikalā bhavanti |

ityanvayaḥ||

dhūmeti dhūmaśca jyotiśca salilaṃ ca marucca
dhūmajyotiḥsalilamarutasteṣāṃ dhūmajyotisalilamarutām | jyotiḥ 
agniḥ|

paṭviti paṭūni sāmarthyayuktāni karaṇānīndriyāṇi yeṣāṃ te
taiḥ paṭukaraṇaiḥ|

kāmeti kāmenārtāḥ pīḍitāḥ kāmārtāḥ| madanapīḍitāḥ 
janā na vadanti sacetanasyāgre kathyamānamasti| atha vā
cetanāsyāgre kathyamānamastīti bhāvaḥ|| 5 ||

jātaṃ vaṃśe bhuvanavidite puṣkarāvartakānāṃ 

jānāmi tvāṃ prakṛtipuruṣaṃ kāmarūpaṃ maghonaḥ|

tenārthitvaṃ tvayi vidhivaśāddūrabandhurgato 'haṃ 

yācñā vandhyā varamadhiguṇe nādhame labdhakāmā|| 6 ||

puṣkalā° Da; moghā Da,Su;

VALL

tāmeva yācñāṃ cāṭupūrvikāmāha ||

yatastvāmahamevaṃvidhaṃ vedāto 'ham prārthitvaṃ prāptaḥ 
|

kīdṛśam | puṣkarāvartakānāṃ pralayameghānāṃ vaṃśe kule
jātamiti kulīnatvoktiḥ|

tathā maghona indrasya prakṛtipuruṣamamātyapuruṣamiti
prabhāvakathanam| prakṛtiṣu hyamātyāḥ pradhānabhūtāḥ|
indrasya ca meghā eva priyakarāḥ| 
prakṛtiṣu prakṛtiścāsāviti vā puruṣaḥ prakṛtipuruṣaḥ|

svāmyamātyau ca rāṣṭraṃ ca kośo durgaṃ balaṃ suhṛt |

sapta prakṛtayo hyetāḥ saptāṅgaṃ rājyamucyate|| {Manu 9.294}

kāmarūpaṃ manojñaṃ svecchārūpaṃ vā| bahurūpatvānmeghānām|

tadeva vakṣyati| puṣpameghīkṛtātmeti |

ata eva vidhivaśādahaṃ dūrabandhurasaṃnihitadārastvayi
arthitvaṃ gato yācñākāraḥ sampannas|

yadyevaṃ guṇayukto 'haṃ tarhi kimityetāvatā mayyarthanā
ityāha|

yasmādadhiguṇe kulādiguṇotkṛṣṭe puruṣe yācñā vandhyā
niṣphalā varaṃ bhadram | alajjāvahatvāt |

na tvadhame nikṛṣṭe labdhakāmā prāpteṣṭārthāpīti|

bhinnaliṅgatve 'pi sāmānyopakramātsāmānādhikaraṇyam| yathā

varaṃ kūpaśatādvāpītyādau|| 6 ||

\daksināvarta

idānīṃ stutipūrvāṃ yācñāṃ karoti jātamiti ||

kūṭasthāḥ kecana meghāḥ puṣkalāvartakāḥ|

prakṛtipuruṣamamātyādiprakṛtivargasthaṃ puruṣam |

kāmarūpamicchādhīnavigrahaṃ | idaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ 
durgādigamanārthaṃ | vakṣyati tenodīcīṃ diśamanusareḥ 
tiryagāyāmaśobhīti {57} | gatvā sadyaḥ kalabhatanutāmiti ca
{78} |

tenābhijātyaprabhutvaparijñānena |

arthitvamabhyarthanām |

vidhivaśāddūrabandhurdūrasthabhāryaḥ| badhnātīti bandhuḥ 
iti vyutpat[t]yā bandhuśabdo bhāvabandhinyāṃ bhāryāyāṃ vartate
| bandhuśabdaparyāyeṇa suhṛtpadena bhāryāpi gṛhyate |

punaḥ [putraḥ?] priyāṇāmadhiko bhāryāpi suhṛdāṃ varā |

giriṇāmadhiko merurdevānāṃ madhusūdanaḥ|| iti |

moghā vyarthā nirarthakā |

varamīṣatpriyam | variṣṭhāśrayaṇe tu vara iti vaktavyam | atra
amarasiṃho devādvṛte varaḥ śreṣṭhe triṣu klībe manākpriya 
iti {3.3.174} | alābhādapriyā ca bhavatīti abhiprāyeṇa
manākpriyamityuktam |

adhame yācñā labdhakāmāpi na varamityanvayaḥ|| 6 ||

\mallinātha

jātamiti||

he megha tvāṃ bhuvaneṣu vidite bhuvanavidite | niṣṭheti
bhūtārthe ktaḥ| matibuddhītyādinā vartamānārthatve tu ktasya ca
vartamāna iti bhuvanaśabdasya ṣaṣṭhyantatāniyamātsamāso na
syāt|

ktena ca pūjāyāmiti niṣedhāt| {p3.2.102/3.2.188/2.3.67/2.2.12}

puṣkarāścāvartakāśca kecinmeghānāṃ śreṣṭhāsteṣāṃ 
vaṃśe jātam| mahākulaprasūtamityarthaḥ||

kāmarūpam icchādhīnavigraham| durgādisañcārakṣamamityarthaḥ|

maghona indrasya prakṛtipuruṣaṃ pradhānapuru'ṃ jānāmi|

tena mahākulaprasūtatvādiguṇayogitvena hetunā vidhivaśāddaivāyattatvāt|

vidhirvidhāne daive cetyamaraḥ|

vaśamāyatte| vaśamicchāprabhutvayoriti viśvaḥ|

dūre bhanduryasya sa dūrabhandurviyuktabhāryo 'haṃ tvayi
arthitvaṃ gataḥ|

nanu yācakasya yācñāyāṃ yācyaguṇotkarṣaḥ kutropayujyata iti
āśaṅkya daivādyācñābhaḍage 'pi lāghavadoṣābhāva eva
upayoga ityāha yācñeti|

adhiguṇe adhikaguṇe puṃsi viṣaye yācñā moghā niṣphalāpi
varamīṣatpriyam | dāturguṇāḍhyatvātpriyatvaṃ 
yācñavaiphalyādīṣatpriyatvamiti bhāvaḥ|

adhame nirguṇe yācñā labdhakāmāpi saphalāpi na varam|
īṣatpriyamapi na bhavatītyarthaḥ| devādvṛte varaḥ 
śreṣṭhe triṣu klībaṃ manākpriya ityamaraḥ||

arthāntaranyāsānuprāṇitaḥ preyolaṅkāraḥ| taduktam daṇḍinā

preyaḥ priyatarākhyānam iti||

etadādye pādatraye caturthapādasthenārthāntaranyāsenopajīvitamiti suvyaktametat|| 6 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhā |

he megha puṣkarāvartakānāṃ meghānāṃ vaṃśe jātamutpannaṃ 
tvāṃ jānāmi |

kathambhūte vaṃśe | bhuvanavidite tribhuvanaprasiddhe ||

kathambhūtaṃ tvam | maghona indrasya prakṛtipuruṣaṃ pradhānajanam
||

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ tvām | kāmarūpaṃ svecchācāriṇam
svecchārūpaṃ vā |

he megha tena kāreṇa vidhivaśātkarmavaśatastvayi viṣaye
arthitvaṃ yācakatvamahaṃ gataḥ prāpto 'ham |

kathambhūto 'ham | dūrabandhurdūrasthitasvabhāryākaḥ|

yataḥ kāraṇāt adhiguṇe guṇādhika uccapuruṣe yacñā prārthanā
moghā niṣphalāpi varaṃ śreṣṭhā | adhame nīcajane yācñā
prārthanā labdhakāmā saphalā na varaṃ na śreṣṭhā|

ityanvayaḥ||

varaṃ sāmānyavivakṣāyāṃ napuṃsakanirdeśaḥ|

arthino bhāvo 'rthitvam |

dūrabandhuriti dūre bandhurbhāryālakṣaṇaḥ svajano yasya sa
dūrabandhuḥ|| 6 ||

santaptānāṃ tvamasi śaraṇaṃ tatpayoda priyāyāḥ 

sandeśaṃ me hara dhanapatikrodhaviśleṣitasya|

gantavyā te vasatiralakā nāma yakṣeśvarāṇāṃ 

bāhyodyānasthitaharaśiraścandrakādhautaharmyā|| 7 ||

VALL

na ca tavāsmadarthanānaṅgīkaraṇaṃ yuktamityāha ||

he payoda santaptānāmambudānena tvam yadā śaraṇaṃ bhavasi tat
mamāpi virahasantaptasya sandeśaṃ vārtāṃ priyāyāḥ sakāśaṃ 
hara naya prāpaya |

dhanapatikrodhavi"leṣitasyeti santaptatvapratipādanam |

kva mayā gantavyamityāha |

guhyakādhipānāṃ vasatiralakā nāma purī te gantavyā yātavyā |

na ca sā durjñānetyāha|

bāhyodyāne kailāsopavane| bāhyaṃ ca tadudyānaṃ ca|

tatra sthitas yas harastasya śiraścandrikayā dhautāni harmyāṇi
yatra dine 'pi vikṣālitasaudhā|

ta iti kṛtyānāṃ kartari vā {p2.3.71} ||7||

\daksināvarta

kā vā bhavato yācñā ityapekṣāyāmāha santaptānāmiti ||
ātapasantaptānāṃ kāmasantaptānām ca |

nanu kāmasantaptānāṃ meghālokanaṃ virodhi | uktaṃ ca
kaṇṭhāśleṣapraṇayini jane kiṃ punardūrasaṃstha iti | tat
kathaṃ kāmasantaptānāmityarthas gṛhyate | ucyate meghaḥ khalu
proṣitapriyatamapreraṇayā tānproṣitānpriyatamābhiḥ saṅgamayya
teṣāṃ mithunānāṃ santāpaṃ harati | tasmāt santaptānāṃ tvam asi
śaraṇamityuktam | vakṣyati yo vṛndāni tvarayatīti |

me sandeśaṃ priyāyās haretyanvayaḥ|

kutra sthitā sā priyā tatsthānasya nāma kiṃ lakṣaṇaṃ ceti
apekṣāyāmāha gantavyeti |

alakā nāma nāmaśabdaḥ prasiddhau |

yakṣeśvarāṇāṃ yaksamukhyānām |
bāhyodyānasthitaharaśiraścandrikādhautaharmyetyanena
lakṣaṇamuktam |

atra kecitkailāsālāyavartinaḥ parameśvarasyālakodyāne
caitrarathe 'vasthānamayuktamiti manyamānā evaṃ vyācakṣate
kailāsotsaṅgavartinyā alakāyā bahirniḥsaraṇapradeśaḥ 
udyānaśabdena vivakṣitaḥ| syādudyānaṃ niḥsarane vanabhede
prayojana iti amarasiṃhavacanāditi || 7 ||

\mallinātha

santaptānāmiti||

he payoda tvam santaptānāmātapena vā pravāsaviraheṇa vā
sañjvaritānām | santāpaḥ sañjvaraḥ samāvityamaraḥ||

śaraṇaṃ payodānenātapakhinnānāṃ proṣitānāṃ 
svasthānaprareṇayā ca rakṣakas asi | śaraṇam gṛharakṣitroriti
amaraḥ|

tattasmātkāraṇāddhanapateḥ kuberasya krodhena viśleṣitasya
priyāyā viyojitasya me mama sandeśaṃ vārtāṃ priyāyā hara|
priyāṃ prati nayetyarthaḥ| sambandhasāmānye ṣaṣṭhī |
sandeśaharaṇenāvayoḥ santāpaṃ nudetyarthaḥ||

kutra sthāne sā sthitā tatsthānasya vā kiṃ vyāvartakaṃ tatrāha
gantavyeti |

bahirbhavaṃ bāhyam| bahirdevapañcajanebhyaśca iti yañ| bāhya 
udyāne sthitasya harasya śirasi yā candrikā tayā dhautāni nirmalāni
harmyāṇi dhanikabhavanāni yasyāṃ sā tathoktā| harmyādi
dhaninām vāsa ityamaraḥ| anena vyāvartakamuktam||

alakā nāma alaketi prasiddhā yakṣeśvarāṇāṃ vasatiḥ sthānaṃ 
te tava gantavyā| tvayā gantavyetyarthaḥ| 
kṛtyānāṃ kartari veti ṣaṣṭhī ||7||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

he payoda megha santaptānāṃ grīṣmoṣṇataptānāṃ janānāṃ tvaṃ 
śaraṇamasi | tatkāraṇānme mama sandeśaṃ samācārarūpaṃ 
priyāyāḥ (me mama) bhāryāyā hara prāpaya |

kathambhūtasya me (mama) | dhanapatikrodhaviśleṣitasya dhanadakopena
pṛthakkṛtasya |

he megha te tava yakṣeśvarāṇām vasatirnivāsasthānamalakā nāma
gantavyāsti| atha vā te tvayālakā gantavyā | saptamyarthe
tṛtīyā kṛdyogāt |

kāsau | vasatirnivāsaḥ|

keṣām | yakṣeśvarāṇām |

kathambhūtālakā | bāhyodyānasthitaharaścandrikādhautaharmyā |

iti anvayaḥ||

dhanapa[ti]iti | dhanapatikrodhena viśleṣito viyojitastasya
dhanapatikrodhaviśleṣitasya |

bāhyodyāneti | bāhyodyānasthitaharo mahādevastacchirasiyā
candrikā candrajyotsnā tayā dhautāni dhavalīkṛtāni harmyāni
gṛhāṇi yasyāḥ sā bāhyodyānasthitaharaśiraścandrikādhautaharmyā
|

yakṣeśvarāṇāmiti | bahuvacanaṃ gurāvekaśceti bahuvacanam ||
7 ||

tvāmārūḍhaṃ pavanapadavīmudgṛhītālakāntāḥ 

prekṣiṣyante pathikavanitāḥ pratyayādāśvasantyas|

kaḥ saṃnaddhe virahavidhurāṃ tvayyupekśeta jāyāṃ 

na syādanyo 'pyahamiva jano yaḥ parādhīnavṛttiḥ|| 8 ||

āśvasantyas (Da); āśvasatyas Da,Ma; ayam iva Da;

VALL

vātamārgaṃ khamudgataṃ bhavantaṃ pānthāṅganā virahiṇyaḥ 
alakānutkṣipya drakṣyanti |

yataḥ pratyayānniścayotpādanādāśvasantyaḥ|

ayaṃ jīmūta uditaḥ| atrāvaśyamasmatprāṇeśvaraiḥ 
āgantavyamiti|

taddarśanamātre kasmādāśā kṛtetyāha |

tvayi saṃnaddhe kṛtodyoge sati viyogākulāṃ preyasīṃ ka upekṣeta
virahayet |

yadyanyo 'pi janastādṛśas na syāt| kīdṛśaḥ| mādṛśaḥ 
parādhīnavṛttiḥ|

atha vā ko 'nyo jano jāyāmupekṣetetyatra sambandhaḥ|

svādhīnā hi kāntābhiḥ saha ramamāṇāḥ prāvṛṣaṃ 
ativāhayanti |

sannaddhādayaḥ śabdā evamādāvaupacārikāḥ|| 8 ||

\daksināvarta

yadi bhavān matkārye sannahyati tanna kevalaṃ mamaiva
āśvāsakamanyasyāpi janasyetyabhiprāyeṇāha tvām
ārūḍhamiti ||

pavanapadavīmākāśam |

udgṛhītālakāntāḥ priyavirahātkapolalambitvādalakānāṃ 
udgrahaṇamuktam |

pratyayātpriyāgamanaviśvāsāt |

āśvasatya iti numāgamarahitaḥ pāṭhaḥ| atra kecitkṣamūṣ
sahana ityasmāddhātoḥ ṣidbhidādipāṭhena {p3.3.104} ṣitkārye
siddhe kṣamūṛiti ṣitvaṃ gaṇakāryasyānityatvajñāpakaṃ 
bhavatyata eva na viśvasetpūravavirodhitasyetyatra śapaḥ 
luṅna bhavati tathā bhaṭṭikāvye 'pi āśvaseyurniśācarā iti
| tasmādāśvasantya iti numāgamasahitaḥ pāṭha iti vyācakṣate
| tanna | anyathāpi rūpasiddheḥ| atra gaṇakāryasyānityatvaṃ 
apekṣyaiva rūpasiddhirbhavati tatra eva tadāśrayaṇasya
yuktavādityalaṃ vistareṇa ||

sannaddhe proṣitanivartanodyukte |

virahavidhurāṃ virahakliṣṭāṃ virahakṛcchragatāmityarthaḥ|
vidhuraḥ patnyapete syātkliṣṭaviśliṣṭayorapīti yādavaḥ||

anyo 'pi mamāsadṛśo 'pi pṛthagjano 'pītyarthaḥ| anyaḥ 
tu bhinnāsadṛśoriti yādavaḥ| ayamiva jana ityahamiveti
arthaḥ| ahaṃ parādhīnavṛttiryathā bhavāmi tathā pṛthagjanaḥ 
api parādhīnavṛttirna syātsa kastvayi sannaddhe jāyāṃ 
upekṣetetyarthaḥ|| 8 ||

\mallinātha

madarthaṃ prasthitasya te pathikāṅganājanāśvāsanam ānuṣaṅgikaṃ 
phalamityāha tvamiti ||

pavanapadavīmākāśamārūḍhaṃ tvāṃ | panthānāṃ gacchanti te
pathikās | pathaḥ ṣkan iti ṣkanpratyayaḥ| teṣāṃ vanitāḥ 
proṣitabhartṛkāḥ|

pratyayātpriyāgamanaviśvāsāt| pratyayaḥ 
adhīnaśapathajñānaviśvāsahetuṣvityamaraḥ|

āśvasatyo viśvasitāḥ| śvasidhātoḥ śatrantādugitaśca iti
ṅip||

tathodgṛhītālakāntā dṛṣṭaprasārārthamunnamayya
dhṛtālakāgrāḥ satyaḥ prekṣiṣyante| atyutkaṇṭhatayā drakṣyanti
ityarthaḥ||

madāgamanena pathikāḥ kathamāgamiṣyantītyatrāha tathā hi|

tvayi saṃnaddhe vyāpṛte sati viraheṇa vidhurāṃ vivaśāṃ jāyāṃ 
ka upekseta | na ko 'pītyarthaḥ|

anyo 'pi madvyatirikto 'pi yo jano 'hamiva parādhīnavṛttiḥ 
parāyatajīvanako na syāt | svatantrastu na ko 'pyupekṣeteti
bhāvaḥ||

atrārthāntaranyāso 'laṅkāraḥ|

taduktam kāryakāraṇasāmānyaviśeṣaṇaṃ parasparam |

samarthanaṃ yatra so 'rthāntaranyāsa udāhṛtaḥ|| iti lakṣaṇāt
||8||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyasya ||

he megha tvāṃ pathikavanitāḥ pathikastriyaḥ prekṣiyante ||

kathambhūtaṃ tvām | pavanapadavīmākāśam pratyārūḍhaṃ 
caḍhitam |

kathambhūtāḥ pathikavanitāḥ| udgṛhītālakāntāḥ 
ūrdhvīkṛtakeśaparyantāḥ|

pathikavanitāḥ kiṃ kurvantyaḥ| pratyayānniścayādāśvasantyaḥ 
svasthībhavantyaḥ| meghāgame 'vaśyaṃ bhartāsamāgamiṣyatīti
bhāvaḥ|

he megha jano virahavidhurāṃ virahapīḍitāṃ jāyāṃ bhāryāṃ 
ka upekṣeta ko muñcet |

kva sati | tvayi meghe sannaddhe sati vidyudgarjitādijāte sati |

he megha yo 'nyo 'pi jano 'hamiva parādhīnavṛttirna syāt
daivaparavaśo na bhavati | ityanvayaḥ||

vyatirekālaṅkāraḥ|

udgṛhīteti | udgṛhītā ūrdhvaṃ nītā alakānāṃ keśānāṃ 
antā agrā yābhistās udgṛhītālakāntāḥ| virahiṇīnāṃ 
keśe granthanābhāvādato 'granthitakeśānāntā iti bhāvaḥ|

parādhīnā parāyattā vṛttirājīvikā yasya sa parādhīnavṛttiḥ 
| dhanadāyatta iti bhāvaḥ||

pathikānāṃ vanitāḥ striyaḥ pathikavanitāḥ pathikabhāryā iti
arthaḥ| pratyayo viśvāsaśapathajñānaniścayādiṣviti
anekārthaḥ|| 8 ||

āpṛcchasva priyasakhamamuṃ tuṅgamāliṅgya śailaṃ 

vandyaiḥ puṃsāṃ raghupatipadairaṅkitaṃ mekhalāsu|

kāle kāle bhavati bhavatā yasya saṃyogametya

snehavyaktiściravirahajaṃ muñcato bāṣpamuṣṇam || 9 || 12 Ma;
13 Su;

bhavatas tasya Ma; bhavato yasya Su;

VALL

idānīṃ prāyeṇopadeśamāha ||

amum śailaṃ citrakūṭamāliṅgyāpṛcchasva sotkaṇṭhaṃ 
jyokkuru|

yataḥ priyasakhamiṣṭamitram| meghānāṃ hyadrayaḥ suhṛdaḥ|
tatasteṣāmudayāt| sakhā ca gamanakāle jyokkriyate||

kīdṛśamamum| tuṅgamunnatam|

tathā sarvajanapūjyai rāmapadai rāmapādairmekhalāsu
nitambabhāgeṣvaṅkitaṃ mudritamiti pāvanatvoktiḥ||

sakhidharmamāha|

yasyādreḥ kāle kāle sarvasminsamāgamasamaye tvayā saha
saṃyogametya ciravirahajamuṣṇam bāṣpamūṣmānaṃ tyajataḥ 
snehavyaktirbhavati| yaḥ snihyatītyarthaḥ||

parvatā hi jaladavṛṣṭyā snigdhā bhavanti bāṣpaṃ ca muñcanti|

etadeva suhṛtvaṃ yaccireṇa sakhyau dṛṣṭe bāṣpasnehau jāyete|

āpṛcchasvetyāṅi nupracchyorityātmanepadam| {vārtt 1.3.21}
priyaścāsau ceti priyasakhaḥ| rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ ṭac
{p5.4.91} |

saṃyogametyeti bāṣpamokṣāpekṣam paurvakālyaṃ 
snehakriyāpekṣaṃ vā || 9 ||

\daksināvarta

āpṛcchasveti ||

āpṛcchasva sabhājayasva saṃmānayetyarthaḥ| āṅi
nupracchayorupasa"khyānamityātmanepadam | {vārtt1.3.21}
ānandanasabhājane | āpracchanamityamaraḥ|

atra gacchāmīti praśnavacanena pūjanaṃ vivakṣitam | na kevalaṃ 
bhavataḥ sakhyādevāsya parvatasya sabhājanaṃ kāryaṃ 
viśiṣṭapuruṣaparigrahāccetyāha vandhyaiḥ puṃsāmiti |

aṅkitaṃ kṛtasañcāram | mekhalāsu sānuṣu |

asya mayā saha sakhyamastīti kuto 'vagamyata ityaprekṣāyāṃ 
āha kāla kāla iti | prativarṣāsamayaṃ suhṛtsaṅgamakālaśca
vivakṣitaḥ| snehavyaktiḥ premāviṣkaraṇam |

bāṣpamuṣmāṇam aśrujalaṃ ca | bāṣpo 'śruṇyambudhūme ca
iti yādavas | uṣṇam ciravirahajatvāduṣṇamityarthaḥ|

bhavatā saṃyogametya ciravirahajamuṣṇaṃ bāṣpaṃ muñcataḥ 
yasya snehavyaktirbhavatītyanvayaḥ|

atra kaścitsuhṛddūrāt[a]agataṃ suhṛdaṃ dṛṣṭvā
ciravirahoṣṇaṃ bāṣpamunmucya sauhṛdamāviṣkarotītyarthaḥ 
khaṇḍaśleṣālaṅkareṇa pratīyata ityanusandheyam || 12 || -9-

\mallinātha

āpṛcchasveti ||

priyaṃ sakhāyaṃ priyasakham |rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ ṭajiti ṭac
samasāntaḥ| tuṅgam unnataṃ puṃsāṃ vandyairnarārādhanīyaiḥ 
raghupatipadai rāmapādanyāsairmekhalāsu kaṭakeṣu| atha
mekhalā | śroṇisthāne 'drikuṭake kaṭibandhe bhabandhana iti
yādavas |

aṅkitaṃ cihnitaṃ | itthaṃ sakhitvānmahattvātpavitratvācca
sambhāvanārham |

amuṃ śailaṃ citrakūṭādrimālin"gya apṛcchasva sādho yāmīti
āmantraṇena sabhājaya | āmantraṇasabhājane | āpracchanamiti
amaras | āṅi nupracchyorupasaṅkhyānamityātmanepadam
{vārtt1.3.21} | sakhitvaṃ nirvāhayati kāla? iti |

kāle kāle pratiprāvṛtkālam suhṛitsamāgamanakālaśca
kālaśabdenocyate vīpsāyāṃ dviruktirbhavataḥ saṃyogaṃ 
samparkam etya ciravirahajamuṣṇam bāṣpamuṣmānaṃ netrajalaṃ ca
| bāṣpo netrajaloṣmanoriti viśvaḥ| muñcatastasya śailasya
snehavyaktiḥ premāvirbhāvo bhavati | snigdhānāṃ hi
ciravirahasaṅgatānāṃ bāṣpapāto bhavatīti bhāvaḥ|| 12 || -9-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

he megha amuṃ śailaṃ rāmagiriparvatamāliṅgyāśliṣya militvā
tvamāpṛcchasva muktvālāpaya | he megha kāle kāle varṣākāle
snehavyaktirbhavati premaprakaṭatā bhavati |

kiṃ kṛtvā | bhavatastava yasya parvatasya saṃyogaṃ saṅgamanaṃ 
etya prāpya |

bhavataḥ kiṃ kurvataḥ| ciravirahajaṃ cirakālaviyogasambhavaṃ 
uṣṇaṃ bāṣpamaśru muñcataḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ śailaṃ | priyasakhaṃ vallabhamitram |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ śailam | tuṅgamuccaistaram |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ śailam | raghupatipadairaṅkitaṃ 
śrīrāmacandracaraṇaiścihnitam |

kāsu | mekhalāsu nimnapradeśeṣu |

kathambhūtai raghupatipadaiḥ| puṃsām vandyaiḥ| kṛtyānāṃ 
kartari ṣaṣṭhī | pumbhiḥ stutyaiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

kāle kāla iti vīpsāyāṃ dvitvam | snehasya cirantanatāmātraṃ 
sūcitaṃ kāle kāla iti kathanāt |

sneheti snehasya premṇo vyaktiḥ prakaṭatā viśeṣo vā
snehavyaktiḥ| cireti ciravirahājjātaṃ ciravirahajam |

anyo 'pi yathā virahaduḥkhaduḥkhitaḥ san vallabhaṃ prāpya
uṣṇamaśru muñcati tathā megho 'pīti bhāvaḥ|

svabhāvoktiralaṅkāraḥ|| 13 || -9-

mandaṃ mandaṃ nudati pavanaścānukūlo yathā tvāṃ 

vāmaścāyaṃ nadati madhuraṃ cātakastoyagṛdhnuḥ|

garbhādhānasthiraparicayā nūnamābaddhamālāḥ 

seviṣyante nayanasubhagaṃ khe bhavantaṃ balākāḥ|| 10 || 9 Da,Su;

te sugandhas Ma; te sagarvas Su;

°kṣamaparicayās Da, °kṣaṇaparicayās Ma, °kṣaṇaparicayāt Su;
°subhagās Da;

VALL

na ca tvamekākī bhaviṣyasīti śubhanimittakathanātsadhayan
āha||

yathedaṃ śubhamīkṣyate tathā niścitaṃ netrasundaraṃ tvāṃ 
ākāśe balākāḥ seviṣyante śrayiṣyante|

kimityāha | hitas vātas yathā tvāṃ mandaṃ mandaṃ prerayati
yathā cāyaṃ cātako mayūro madhuraṃ kūjati|

vāmas vāmapārśvasthas valguvādī vā|

toyagṛdhnurjalamabhilāṣukaḥ|

vārṣikaliṅgadarśanādbalākā apyāyāsyantīti
prāvṛḍḍharmo 'yam|

kīdṛśyastāḥ| garbhādhānena sthiraḥ paricayo yāsāṃ tāḥ|

meghagarjitena hi tāḥ sagarbhā bhaviṣyantīti vārttā|

ābaddhamālā racitapaṅkayaḥ|

mandaṃ mandamityādhikye dvitvam || 10 ||

\daksināvarta

anayā nimittagatyā matpriyādarśananātprāgeva bhavataḥ 
priyajanasaṅgamo bhaviṣyatīti abhiprāyeṇāha mandaṃ mandaṃ 
nudatīti ||

mandapavanānukūlyamatra nimittam | tathā mahāyātrāyāṃ 
varāhamihiraḥ 

protkṣiptānalapāṇsupatravihagacchatradhvajāpannakṛt

durgandhaḥ karidānaśoṣajananaḥ sampṛktaloṣṭodgamaḥ|

yaturvāyurabhīṣṭadaḥ śubhakaro yātrānugo 'lpodyamaḥ 

prahlādī surabhiḥ pradakṣiṇagatiḥ sāraśca siddhipradaḥ|| iti

uktaṃ ca

pavanasyānukūlyatvātprārthanāsiddhisśaṃsinas iti {raghu1.42} |

pavanaścetyatra cakāreṇa nimittāntaraṃ cākatakānukūlyaṃ 
samuccīyate |

yathāśabdaḥ sādṛśye sādṛśyaṃ nimittaphalayorānurūpyam |
yathā sādṛśyayogyatvavīpsāsvarthānatikrama iti yādavaḥ| atha
vā yathāśabdo yasmādarthe | pramāṇaṃ tu mṛgyam |

yathā tvām anukulaḥ pavano mandaṃ mandaṃ nudati tathā
balākāsaṅgamo bhaviṣyatītyarthaḥ|

vāmo vāmapārśvasthaḥ| cakārasyārthaḥ pūrvoktarīktyā
boddhavyaḥ| nadati svanaṃ karoti | madhuraṃ sukhaśravam | sagandhaḥ 
sagandho bandhuriṣyata iti halāyudhaḥ|

pitṛpai?tāmahānamātyānkurvīta dṛṣṭāpadānatvāt| te hi
enam apacarantamapi na tyajanti sagandhatvāditi kauṭilyena
bandhuviṣaye sagandhaśabdaḥ prayuktaḥ| atrāpi yathaśabdaḥ 
anuṣañjanīyaḥ| vāmāpārśvasthasya cātakasya ninadas yātrāyāṃ 
nimittamityatra yogayātrāyāṃ varāhamihiraḥ 

cucundarī sūkarikā śivā ca śyāmāgalīpiṅgalikānyapuṣṭāḥ|

vāmāḥ praśastā gṛhagolikāśca puṃsañjñitā ye ca
patatriṇaśca ||

iti | anena cātakasyāpi puṃśabdenopādānaṃ kṛtamiti
anusandheyaṃ | tathā mahāyatrāyāṃ sa eva varāhamihiraḥ 
kālaviśeṣamāśritya cātakasvaraṃ niṣedhati

na tu bhādrapade grāhyāḥ sūkarāḥ śvavṛkādayaḥ|

śaradyabjādagokrauñcāḥ śrāvaṇe hasticātakau || iti |

kālaviśeṣaniṣedhādaniṣiddhe kāle cātakasvarasya nimittatvaṃ 
pratīyate | garbhādhānakṣamaparicayādgarbhaśabdaḥ 
kukṣisthāyijantuvācakaḥ|

garbho 'pavarake 'nne 'gnausute panasakaṇṭake | kukṣau
kukṣisthajantau ceti yādavaḥ| kṣamaśabdaḥ śaktavācakaḥ|
kṣitikṣāntyaḥ kṣamāyukte kṣamaṃ śakte hite triṣvityamaraḥ|
garbhādhānaśaktaḥ paricayo garbhādhānakṣamaparicayastasmāt
hetoḥ| meghasaṅgatyā balākā garbhaṃ dhārayantīti prasiddham |

meghābhikāmā parisampatantī sammohitā bhāti valākapaṅktiḥ| iti
liṅgadarśanaṃ cāsti {rām4.28.26} |

nūnamiti niścaye | nūnaṃ tarke 'tha niścaya ityamaraḥ|

ābaddhamālā ābaddhapaṅktaya ābaddhapuṣpasraja iti ca
dhvanyate | nayanasubhagā idaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ ca balākāsu
meghapriyāsamādhiliṅgam | khe vyomni | anena viviktasthānaṃ ca
dhvanyate || 9 || -10-

\mallinātha

nimittānyapi te śubhāni dṛśyanta ityāha mandaṃ mandamiti ||

anukūlaḥ pavano vāyustvāṃ mandaṃ mandam | atimandamiti
arthaḥ| atra kathañcidvīpsāyāmeva dviruktirnirvāhyā |
prakāre guṇavacanasyetyetadāśrayaṇe tu karmadhārayavadbhāve
subluki mandamandamiti syāt | tadevāha vāmano mandamandaṃ 
ityatra prakārārthaṃ dvirbhāva iti |

yathā sadṛśam | bhāviphalānurūpamityarthaḥ| yathā
sādṛśyayogyatvavīpsāsvārthānatikrama iti yādavaḥ|

nudati prerayati | ayaṃ sagandhaḥ sagarvaḥ sambandhīti kecit |
gandho gandhaka āmode leśe sambandhagarvayorityubhayatrāpi
viśvaḥ|

te tava vāmo vāmabhāgasthaḥ| vāmastu vakre ramye syātsavye
vāmagate 'pi ceti śabdārṇave |

cātakaḥ pakṣiviśeṣaśca madhuraṃ śrāvyaṃ nadati vyāharati |
idaṃ nimittadvayaṃ vartate | vartiṣyate cāparaṃ nimittamityāha
garbheti | garbhaḥ kukṣistho jantuḥ| garbhopakārake hyagnau
sukhe panasakaṇṭaka kukṣau kukṣisthajantau ca iti yādavas | tasya
ādhānamutpādanaṃ tadeva kṣaṇa utsavaḥ| sukhahetutvāditi
bhāvaḥ|

nirvyāpārasthitau kālaviśeṣotsavayoḥ kṣaṇa ityamaraḥ|

tasminparicayādabhyāsāddhetoḥ khe vyomni |

ābaddhamālā garbhādhānasukhārthaṃ tvatsamīpe baddhapaṅktayaḥ 
ityarthaḥ| uktaṃ ca karṇodaye garbhaṃ balākā dadhata 
abhrayogānnāke nibaddhāvalayaḥ samantāditi |

balākā balākāṅganā nayanasubhagaṃ dṛṣṭapriyaṃ bhavantaṃ 
nūnaṃ satyaṃ seviṣyante |

anukūlamārutacātakaśabditabalākādarśanānāṃ śubhasucakatvaṃ 
śakunaśāstre dṛṣṭaṃ tadvistarabhayānnālekhi || 10 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

he megha pavano vāto mandaṃ mandaṃ śanaiḥ śanairyathā tvām
nudati prerayati tathāyaṃ ca cātakaḥ papīhaste tava madhuraṃ 
iṣṭavacanaṃ vāmo dakṣiṇastho nadati bravīti |

kathambhūtaḥ pavanaḥ| anukūlas pṛṣṭhānugāmī |

kathambhūtaścātakaḥ| sagarvaḥ saharṣo jalalabhāt |

he jalada nūnaṃ niścitaṃ kha ākāśe bhavantaṃ tvāṃ balākā vakastriyaḥ seviṣyante |

kathambhūtaṃ bhavantam | nayanasubhagaṃ netrasukhadam |

kasmāt | garbhādhānakṣaṇaparicayāt garbhagrahaṇāvasarāt |

ityanvayaḥ||

atra kāvye dvau cakārau samakālaṃ dyotayataḥ|

balāketi balena yauvanena garveṇākanti vakraṃ gacchantīti
balākāḥ| aka kauṭilye dhātorayaṃ śabdaḥ| {dh1.829}

garbheti garbhādhāne garbhagrahaṇāvasare kṣaṇaṃ kṣaṇamātraṃ 
paricayaḥ saṅgamo yasya sastasmādgarbhādhānakṣaṇaparicāyāt
| varṣartau hi prativatsaraṃ garbhādhānotsavo meghāgama eva
tāsa[am] balākapatnīnāṃ bhavatīti ciraparicayāt | garbhādhānaṃ 
hi nārīṇāṃ mahotsavaḥ|| 9 || -10-

tāṃ cāvaśyaṃ divasagaṇanātatparām ekapatnīm

avyāpannām avihatagatirdrakṣyasi bhrātṛjāyām |

āśābandhaḥ kusumasadṛśaṃ prāyaśo hyaṅganānāṃ

sadyaḥpātapraṇayi hṛdaya.ṃ viprayoge ruṇaddhi || 11 || 9 Ma; 10
Da,Su;

°sadṛśam prāyaśas hi (Da); °sadṛśaprāṇam apy Da; °pāti Ma,Su;

VALL

na ca tava nirarthakas kleśas bhaviṣyatītyāha ||

tām bhrātṛjāyāṃ mitrabhāryāṃ niścitamavyāpannāmamṛtāṃ 
īkṣyase |

kīdṛśīm | divasagaṇanātatparām | kiyānkālo gataḥ| kiyān
śeṣa ityavadhigaṇanāparāyaṇām |

yata ekapatnīṃ pativratām | ekaḥ patiryasyāḥ sā tām |

evaṃvidhāṃ cetkathaṃ tarhyavyāpannāmityāha|

yasmānnārīṇāṃ priyavirahe hṛdayamāśābandhaḥ prāyeṇa
ruṇaddhyavalambate | yataḥ kusumasadṛśam |

ata eva sadyaḥpātapraṇayi tatkṣaṇavināśonmukham | evaṃvidhaṃ 
apyāśayā dhāryate | nūnamasmākaṃ punaḥ priyeṇa saṃyogaḥ 
bhāvīti |

āśābandha āśābandha iva |

yathāśābandho jālakārakṛtatantunikāraḥ kusumamapi śuṣkaṃ vāteritaṃ rundhe |

caśabdaḥ pūrvavākyāpekṣayā samuccaye | evamanyatra |

praṇayaḥ prītirunmukhatā |

ekapatnīmiti nityaṃ sapatnyādiśviti ṅībnakarau |{p.4.1.35}

bhrātṛjāyāśabde ṛto vidyāyonisambandhebhya ityalugabhāvaḥ 
cintyaḥ|| 11 || {p.6.3.23}

\daksināvarta

tāṃ cāvaśyamiti ||

divasagaṇanātatparāmanena madvirahe sā na vipannā syāt
virahāvadherniyatatvādityuktam | sā kāmaṃ jīvatu | tasyāḥ 
śīlaṃ yadi khaṇḍitam syāttava prārthanā vyarthā bhaviṣyati
ityāśaṅkhyāhaikapatnīm | ekāsapatnīkā patnī
yajñasaṃyogārhā vetyekapatnīti karmadhārayaḥ|
asapatnīkatvātpatnītvācca tasyāḥ śīlakhaṇḍanaṃ na bhavati
ityabhiprāyaḥ| tasmādavyāpannām |

avihatagatistvamavighnagatiḥ|

bhrātṛjāyāmanena parastrīdarśananiṣedhastavātra na syāt
tvadbhrātṛjāyātvādityuktam |

prakṛtyā sukumārahṛdayāḥ khalu striyaḥ| tataḥ kathametāvantaṃ 
kālaṃ divasagaṇanāṃ kṛtvā jīvatītyāśaṅkhyāhāśā
ityādi | āśābandhaḥ priyatamaścet jīvati kālāntare
tatsamāgamo bhaviṣyatītyabhilāṣaḥ| āśābandhaśabdena
nigalasamādhirvivakṣitaḥ|

ruṇaddhīti nigalakāryasya vakṣyamāṇatvāt |

kusumasadṛśaprāṇaṃ kusumasadṛśabalam | prāṇas vāyau bale puṃsi
bhūmyasuvācaka itikeśavasvāmī | kusumasadṛśaṃ prāyaśas hi
aṅganānāmiti kecit paṭhanti | sadyaḥpātapraṇayīti pāṭhaḥ|
virahasamaye sadyaḥpātaprārthanāśīlam || 10 || -11-

\mallinātha

na ca tasyā nāśādvrataskhalanādvā nirarthastvatprayāsaḥ 
ityāha

tāṃ ceti ||

he megha divasānāmavaśiṣṭadinānāṃ gaṇanāyāṃ saṅkhyāne
tatparāmāsaktām | tatpare prasitāsaktāvityamaraḥ|

ata evāvyāpannāmamṛtām | śāpāvasāne
madāgamanapratyāśāyā jīvantītyarthaḥ|

ekaḥ patiryasyāḥ saikapatnī tām | pativratāmityarthaḥ|
nityaṃ sapatnyādiṣviti ṅīp nakāraśca |

bhrāturjāyāṃ bhrātṛjāyāṃ | bhrātṛvanniḥśaṅkaṃ 
darśanīyāmityāśayaḥ|

tāṃ matpriyām |

avihatagatiravicchinnagatiḥ san | avaśyaṃ drakṣyasi ca
