pratibadhnāti | arthāntaranyāsa || 9 || -11-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

he megha ca punaravaśyaṃ niścitaṃ tāṃ bhrātṛjāyāṃ bhrātuḥ 
patnīṃ tvaṃ drakṣyasyavalokayiṣyasi |

kathambhūtāṃ tām | divasagaṇanātatparāṃ dinagaṇane sāvadhānam |

punaḥ kathambhūtāṃ tām | ekapatnīṃ satīm |

punaḥ kathambhūtāṃ tām | avyāpannāṃ jīvantīm |

kathambhūtastvam | avihatagatiraskhalitagatirvāyuvaśāt |

hi yasmāt kāraṇādaṅganānāṃ striṇāṃ hṛdayaṃ manaḥ 
prāyaśo bāhulyena runaddhi dhārayati virahavaśānmaraṇatas |

kaḥ| āśābandhaḥ|

kva sati | viprayoge sati bharturvirahe sati |

kathambhūtamaṅganānāṃ hṛdayam | kusumasadṛśaṃ puṣpatulyaṃ 
puṣpavatsukumāram |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ hṛdayam | sadyaḥpāti sadyaḥpātanaśīlam |

punaḥ kathambhūtam | praṇayi snehayuktam |

ityanvayaḥ||

divaseti | divasagaṇane tatparā divasagaṇanātatparā tāṃ 
divasagaṇanātatparām |

eketi | eko mallakṣaṇa eva patiryasyāḥ saikapatnī |
antarvatpativatornugīgamaśceti pāṇiniḥ| {p4.1.32}

avyeti | na vyāpannāvyāpannā tāmavyāpannām |

avīti | avihatā vāyuvaśādaskhalitā gatiryasya saḥ 
avihatagatiḥ|

dṛśiḥ prekṣaṇe | dhātoraṣṭamalakāre syapi drakṣyasīti
kriyeti? |

bhrātriti | bhrāturjāyā bhrātṛjāyā tāṃ bhrātṛjāyām ||
