viśakiśalaya° Su;

VALL

tattvadīyaṃ dhvanitamākarṇya tava rājahaṃsā anucarāḥ 
kailāsādriparyantaṃ bhaviṣyanti |

yato mānasotkā mānasonmanasaḥ| prāvṛṣi hi te śaraṇārthaṃ 
tatra yānti |

kiṃ tadgarjitamityāha |

yanmahīmavanimucchilindhrāmudbhūtaśilindrākhyakusumām
vidhātuṃ prabhavati śaknoti | tāni hi meghagarjitena jāyante |

ata eva tadavandhyaṃ saphalam |

śravaṇasubhagaṃ karṇasukhakārīti cātupadam |

kīdṛśā haṃsāḥ| bisānāṃ kisalayāni teṣāṃ chedaḥ 
khaṇḍaḥ sa eva pātheyamadhvabhojanaṃ vidyate yeṣām te tathā
uktāḥ|

bisakisalayacchedairvā pātheyavanta iti vigrahaḥ|

ā kailāsādityavyayībhāvo vibhāṣitaḥ|| 12 || !

\daksināvarta 11

mārge tava sahāyāḥ sambhaviṣyantītyāha kartumiti ||

cakāraḥ sahāyā ityanena sambadhyate |

utsilindhrāmutgatakandalikām | ata evāvandhyām | anena padena
garjitasya vārṣikatvamuktamityanusandheyam |

śravaṇasubhagaṃ rājahaṃsānāṃ śravaṇasubhagamityarthaḥ|

paruṣaṃ meghagarjitamiti prasiddham | vakṣyati ca yasyāstoye
kṛtavasataya itiyādikam | tasmātkathaṃ haṃsānāṃ 
śravaṇasubhagamityuktam | satyam |

