tasya haṃsanivāsayogyatvamasti | nityaprasannatvāt
deśāntarataṭākādivatkāluṣyaṃ na bhavatītyudīcyā
upadiśantītyanusandheyam |

mānasotkā mānasotsukā idaṃ ca priyamānasatvaliṅgam |

anena padena loke pravatsyataḥ puruṣasya sahāyāhvānasamādhiḥ 
