bisakisalayacchedapātheyavantaḥ| pātheyaṃ pathi sādhu bhojyaṃ vastu
| pathyatithivasatisvapaterḍhaññiti ḍhañpratyayaḥ|
bisakisalayacchedapātheyā ityukte 'pi vivakṣitasiddhiryadyapi
bhavati tathāpi spaṣṭārthaṃ matuppratyayaḥ kṛta iti
anusandheyam |

nabhasyanena sahāyavadbhireva gantavyaḥ śūnyaḥ panthāḥ 
sūcitaḥ| rājahaṃsā lohitacañcucaraṇā haṃsāḥ|
rājahaṃsāstu te cañcucaraṇairlohitaiḥ sitā ityamaraḥ|| 11
