\mallinātha

samprati sahāyasampattiścāstītyāha kartumiti ||

yadgarjitaṃ kartṛ mahīmucchilindhrāmudbhūtakandalikām |
kandalyāṃ ca śilīndhrā syāditi śabdārṇave | ata eva
avandhyāṃ saphalāṃ kartuṃ prabhavati śaknoti | śilīndhrāṇāṃ 
bhāvisasyasampattisūcakatvāditi bhāvaḥ| taduktaṃ nimittanidāne
kālābhrayogāduditāḥ śilīndhrāḥ sampannasasyāṃ kathayanti
dhātrīmiti |

tacchrotrasukhaṃ | lokasyeti śeṣaḥ| te tava garjitaṃ śrutvā
mānasotsukā mānase sarasyunmanasaḥ| utsukā iti yāvat | utkaḥ 
unmanā iti nipātātsādhu | kālāntare mānasasya himaduṣṭatvāt
himasya ca haṃsānāṃ rogahetutvādanyatra gatā haṃsāḥ punaḥ 
varṣāsu mānasameva gacchantīti prasiddhaḥ|

bisakisalayānāṃ mṛṇālāgrāṇāṃ chedaiḥ śakalaiḥ|

pātheyavantaḥ pathi sādhu pātheyaṃ pathi bhojanam |
pathyatithivasatisvapaterḍhaṅ | tadvantaḥ|
mṛṇālāgraśakalasambandhavanta ityarthaḥ|

rājahaṃsā haṃsaviśeṣāḥ| rājahaṃsāstu cañcucaraṇairlohitaiḥ sitā ityamaraḥ|

nabhasi vyomni bhavatastavā kailāsātkailāsaparyantam |
padadvayaṃ caitat | sahāyāḥ sayātrāḥ| sahāyastu sayātraḥ 
syāditi śabdarṇave | sampatsyante bhaviṣyante || 11 || -12-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

bhavatastavā kailāsātkailāsam parvataṃ yāvadrājahaṃsāḥ sahāyāḥ sakhāyaḥ sampatsyante bhaviṣyante |

kva | nabhasyākāśe śrāvaṇe vā |

kiṃ kṛtvā | tatte tava garjitaṃ garjāravaṃ śrutvā |

kathambhūtā rājahaṃsāḥ| viśakiśalayacchedapātheyavantaḥ 
padminītantukhaṇḍaśambalayuktāḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ garjitam | śravaṇasubhagaṃ karṇasukhadam | ca punaḥ 
yadgarjitaṃ mahīṃ pṛthvīmucchilandhrātapatrāmevaṃvidhāṃ 
kartuṃ prabhavati samartham bhavati |

ityanvayaḥ||

viśeti viśāni kamalanālāni kiśalayāni kumpalāni teṣāṃ 
chedāḥ khaṇḍāni tadeva pātheyaṃ śambalaṃ vidyate yeṣāṃ te
viśakiśalayacchedapātheyantaḥ|

ucchilam[dhra]iti udūrdhvaṃ śilandhrāṇi bhūmisphoṭakāni
chatrakāni tānyevātapatrāni chatrāni yasyāṃ sā
ucchilandhrātapatrā tām ucchilandhrātapatrām || 12 ||

\mūla
mārgaṃ tāvacchṛṇu kathayatastvatprayāṇānukūlaṃ 

sandeśaṃ me tadanu jalada śroṣyasi śrotrapeyam |

khinnaḥ khinnaḥ śikhariṣu padaṃ nyasya gantāsi yatra

kṣīṇaḥ kṣīṇas parilaghu payaḥ srotasāṃ copayujya|| 13 || 11
Su;

mattas Da; °anurūpam Ma,Su,Da; śrāvyabandham Da; upabhujya Ma,Su,Da;

VALL

he jalada mama gadato 'dhvānaṃ tāvadbhavadgamanahitaṃ karṇaya|

tadanantaraṃ śrotrapeyaṃ karṇānandanaṃ sandeśaṃ śroṣyasi
niśamayiṣyasi|

kīdṛsaṃ mārgamityānukūlyamāha khinnaḥ khinna iti|

śrāntaḥ saṃstvaṃ yatra mārge 'driṣu padaṃ nyasya kramaṃ 
nikṣipya gantāsi yāsyasi kṣīṇaprāyaśca nadīnāmaguru toyaṃ 
upayujya pītvā śīghraṃ yāsyasi| pānaviśrāmau hi pathi sutarāṃ 
upayujyete |

tadanutaduparītyādayaḥ pūrvakaviprayogadarśanātsadhavaḥ|
avyayena hi ṣaṣṭhīsamāso niṣidhyate |

śtotrapeyamiti kṛtyairadhikārthavacane|

khinnaḥ khinna ityādāvādhikye dvitvamiti karmadhārayavattvāt
subluṅna bhavati | ādhikye ca dvitvamāmreḍitamiti mahatyā saṃjñayā jñāpitam|

gantāsīti luṭ |

parilaghviti kriyāviśeṣaṇam|| 13 ||

\daksināvarta

mārgamiti ||

mārgaṃ mattaḥ śṛṇu kathayata iti pāṭhaḥ| matta iti pañcamī
| mārgaṃ tāvatkathayata iti pāṭhe kathayata ityastha [asya?]
viśeṣyapadaṃ nāstītyanusandheyam |

sandeśaṃ śyāmāsvaṅgamityādinā vakṣyamānam |

śrāvyabandhamavaśyaṃ śrotavyaracanam | śṛṇoteroravaśyaka 
iti ṇyatpratyayaḥ|

khinnaḥ khinno yadā yadā khinnastadā tadā śikhariṣu padaṃ 
nyasya gamiṣyasītyarthaḥ| khedaśca śārīraḥ|

yatra yasminmarge |

kṣīṇaḥ kṣīṇa ityasamastam | kṣayaścābhyantaraḥ 
vivakṣitaḥ| parilaghu gauravarahitam | srotasāṃ parvatodbhūtānāṃ 
iti śeṣaḥ| parilaghugrahanaṃ srotograhanaṃ ca pāniyasya
pathyatvāya | atra vāhaṭe

upalāsphālanākṣepavicchedaiḥ kheditodakāḥ|

himavanmalayodbhūtāḥ pathyāḥ| iti || 13 || Ma!

\mallinātha

mārgamiti | he jalada tāvadidānīṃ kathayataḥ| matta iti
śeṣaḥ| tvatprayāṇasyānurūpamanukulaṃ mārgam adhvānam |
mārgo mṛgapade māsi saumyarkṣe 'nveṣaṇe 'dhvanīti yādavaḥ|
śṛṇu |

tadanu mārgaśravaṇānantaraṃ śrotrābhyāṃ peyaṃ pānārham |
atitṛṣṇayā śrotavyamityarthaḥ| peyagrahaṇātsandeśasya
amṛtasāmyaṃ gamyate |

me sandeśaṃ vācikam | sandeśavāgvācikaṃ syādityamaraḥ|
śroṣyasi | yatra mārge khinnaḥ khinno 'bhīkṣṇaṃ kṣīṇabalaḥ 
san | nityavīpsayoriti nityārthe dvirbhāvaḥ| {p8.1.4}

śikhariṣu parvateṣu padaṃ nyasya nikṣipya | punarbalalābhārthaṃ 
kvacidviśramyetyarthaḥ|

kṣīṇaḥ kṣīṇo 'bhīkṣṇam kṛśāṅgaḥ san | atrāpi
kṛdantatvātpūrvavaddviruktiḥ| srotasāṃ parilaghu
gurutvadoṣarahitam | upalāsphālanakheditatvātpathyamityarthaḥ|
tathā vāgbaṭa upalāsphālanakṣepavicchedaiḥ kheditodakāḥ|

himavanmalayodbhūtāḥ pathyā nadyo bhavantyamūriti | Da!

payaḥ pānīyamupabhujya śarīrapoṣaṇārthamabhyavahṛtya ca
gantāsi gamiṣyasi | gamerluṭ|| 13 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā |

he jalada megha tāvatprathamaṃ yatra yasminmārge tvam gantāsi
yātāsi taṃ mārgaṃ śṛṇvākarṇaya |

kiṃ kurvataḥ| me mama kathayato vadataḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ mārgam | tvatprayāṇānurūpaṃ bhavadgamanayogyam |

he jalada tadanu paścānme mama sandeśaṃ samācāraṃ śroṣyasi |

kathambhūtam sandeśam | śrotrapeyaṃ śravaṇasukhadam |

kiṃ kṛtvā | khinnaḥ khinnaḥ sañchikhariṣu parvateṣu padaṃ 
caraṇaṃ nyasya sthāpya |

ca punaḥ kiṃ kṛtvā | kṣīṇaḥ kṣīṇastṛṣitaḥ san
tucchajalatvācchoṣitāṅgaḥ sañchrotasāṃ nadīnāṃ payaḥ 
pānīyamupabhujya pītvā |

kathambhūtaṃ payaḥ| parilaghu nirmalatvāllāghavopetam |

ityanvayaḥ||

śleṣasvabhāvoktiralaṅkāro 'tra |

tvatprayeti | tvatprayāṇāya tava prasthānāyānurūpaṃ yogyaṃ 
tvatprayāṇānurūpam |

jalaṃ dadātīti jaladastasya sambodhane he jalada (iti sambodhanam)
