ārdavānīravataḥ| sarasaniculādityatra niculapadena
niculābhidhānaḥ kaścana kavirvivakṣito yasya sūktiḥ subhāṣite
śrūyate

saṃsargajā doṣaguṇā bhavantītyetanmṛṣā yena
jalāśrayo 'pi |

sthitvānukūlaṃ niculaścalantamātmānamārakṣati sindhuvegāt
| iti |

anayā niculopavarṇanayā tasya kaverniculābhidhānatvamāsīditi
anusandheyam |

sa tu niculakavirāsthānagataḥ kālidāsasya sūktīḥ sambhāvayati |
tasmātsarasapadena taṃ kaviṃ stauti | khamutpatānena
svakāvyasyocchritasthānavijṛmbhaṇaṃ ca vivakṣitam |

ayamabhiprāyaḥ kimanyairasūyubhirāsthānagato rasikaḥ sa
nicula eva tavocchrāyaṃ karotīti durjanabhiṣaṇabhītaṃ 
meghasandeśābhidhānaṃ svaprabandhaṃ meghacchadmanā samāśvāsayati
|

tava kāvyaṃ ke nāma dūṣayantītyapekṣāṃ hṛdi kṛtvāha
diṅnāgānāṃ diggajānām | anena diṅnāgācāryaśca vivakṣitaḥ|
pathyanena vijṛmbhaṇāvakāśa utpatanamārgaśca vivakṣitaḥ|
pariharanvarjayan sthūlahastalepānutpatantaṃ meghamālokya
sajātīyabhrameṇa sthūlahastāvatāḍanāni sambhāvitāni | anena
prabandhadūṣaṇasamaye sthūlahastābhinayāśca vivakṣitāḥ|

ayamabhiprāyo diṅnāga iti ko 'pyācāryaḥ 
kālidāsaprabandhānanyatrokto 'yamartha iti
sthūlahastābhinayairdūṣayati | tamācāryaṃ svaprabandhasya
apūrvārthābhidhāyitvamāśritya meghopadeśavyājena kaviḥ 
upālabhata iti || 14 ||

