\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he jaladāsmātsthānādrāmagirināmnaḥ parvatāttvamutpata
ūrdhvaṃ gaccha |

kaṃ prati | khamākāśaṃ prati |

kathambhūtātsthānāt | sarasaniculāt sarasavetasavṛkṣānvitāt |

kathambhūtastvam | udaṅmukha uttarābhimukhas |

punaḥ kathambhūtastvam | mugdhasiddhāṅganābhiḥ 
vidyādharastrībhiścakitacakitaṃ yathā syāttatheti
vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa dṛṣṭotsāho dṛṣṭotpatanodyamaḥ|

itīti kiñciditi vitarke | kimadreḥ parvatasya śṛṅgaṃ śikharaṃ prati pavano vātas harati kampayatīti |

kathambhūtābhirmugdhasiddhāṅganābhiḥ| unmukhībhiḥ 
ūrdhvokṛtānanābhiḥ|

tvam kiṃ kurvan | pathi mārge dignāgānām diśāṃ (diggajānām)
gajānāṃ pariharaṃstyajan |

kān | sthūlahastāvalepān puṣṭaśuṇḍādaṇḍasparśān |

ityanvayaḥ||

mugdheti | mugdhā yāḥ siddhāṅganāḥ siddhastriyaḥ 
mugdhasiddhāṅganāstābhirmugdhasiddhāṅganābhirdevavadhūbhiḥ 
|

saraseti | sarasā niculā vetasā vetasavṛkṣā yatra sa
tasmāt sarasaniculāt |

patḷ patane dhātoḥ pateti āśiṣīti kriyotpūrvaḥ|

digiti | diśāṃ gajā diggajāsteṣāṃ dignāgānām | te hi
diggajāstvām pratigajabhrāntyā prahariṣyantīti kāraṇāt |

sandehālaṅkāraḥ|| 14 ||

ratnacchāyāvyatikara iva prekṣyametatpurastāt

valmīkāgrātprabhavati dhanuṣkhaṇḍamākhaṇḍalasya|

yena śyāmaṃ vapuratitarāṃ kāntimāpatsyate te

barheṇeva sphuritarucinā gopaveśasya viṣṇoḥ||15||

dhanuḥkhaṇḍam Ma,Su; varheṇa Su; °veṣasya Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

etatpurastādagre valmīkāgrātpipīlakotkhātamṛtkūṭaprāntāt
ākhaṇḍalasyendrasya dhanuṣkhaṇḍaṃ cāpaikadeśaḥ prabhavati
utpadyate|

sarpagarbhaṃ valmīkamitisuracāpasya prāvṛṣi prabhava iti
āgamaḥ|

kīdṛśaṃ tat|

anekavarṇatvādratnacchāyāvyatikara iva
bahuvidhamaṇikāntisamparkavatprekṣaṇīyaṃ ramyam|

yena ca tava kṛṣṇaṃ śarīramatitarāṃ kāntimāpatsyate|

yathā vallavarūpasya hareḥ prasaratkāntinā piñchena vapuḥ kāntiṃ 
āptavat| gopā hi prāyeṇa śavaravanmayūrapiñchadhāriṇas|

prasaṅgācca varṣāvarṇanamapi kavinā kriyata iti mārgopadeśa 
api nāsya ślokasyānavasaraḥ|

vyatikaro miśrībhāvaḥ|

dhanuṣkhaṇḍa iti nityaṃ samāsa iti ṣatvam||15||

\daksināvarta

ratneti ||

ratnacchāyāvyatikara iti pāṭhaḥ| valmīkāgrātprabhavati
tadantagatasarpaśiroratnacchāyāvyatikara iva prekṣaṇīyaṃ 
dhanuḥkhaṇḍaṃ valmīkāgrātprabhavatītyarthaḥ|
valmīkāgrādindradhanuṣaḥ prādurbhāva uktaḥ saṃhitāyām

jalamadhye 'nāvṛṣṭirbhuvi sasyavadhastarūtthite vyādhiḥ|

valmīke śastrabhayaṃ niśi sacivavadhāya dhanuraindram | iti |

anenārthenāpi nimittaṃ sūcitam | tathāha mahāyātrāyām

cāpamaindramanulomamakhaṇḍaṃ projjvaladbahalamāyataṃ 
iṣṭam | iti |

|| 15 ||

\mallinātha

ratneti ||

ratnacchāyānāṃ padmarāgādimaṇiprabhāṇāṃ vyatikaro miśraṇaṃ 
iva prekṣyaṃ darśanīyam |

ākhaṇḍalasyendrasyaitaddhanuḥkhaṇḍam | etaditi hastena
nirdeśo vivakṣitaḥ|

purastādagre valmīkāgrādvāmalūravivarāt | vāmalūraśca
nākuśca valmīkaṃ punnapuṃsakamityamaraḥ| prabhavati
āvirbhavati |

yena dhanuḥkhaṇḍena te tava śyāmaṃ vapuḥ| sphuritarucinā
ujjavalakāntinā barheṇa picchena | picchabarhe napuṃsaka ityamaraḥ 
| gopaveṣasya viṣṇorgopālasya kṛṣṇasya śyāmaṃ vapuriva
atitarāṃ kāntiṃ śobhāmāpatsyata prāpsyate || 15 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he jalada purastātpūrvasyāṃ diśyetaddṛśyamānaṃ 
ākhaṇḍalasya dhanuḥkhaṇḍamindrasya cāpaṃ prabhavati
prakaṭībhavati |

kasmāt | valmīkāgrātpipīlakādikṛtamṛttakāsañcayo valmīkaḥ 
tasmāt |

kathambhūtaṃ dhanuḥkhaṇḍam | ratnacchāyāvyatikara iva prekṣyaṃ 
ratnaprabhāsamūha ivāvalokanīyam |

etaditi kim | asampūrṇatvāt |

yenendradhanuṣaḥ khaṇḍena te tava [śyāmaṃ ] vapuḥ śarīraṃ 
atitarāmatiśayenāpatsyate |

kāṃ prati | kāntiṃ śobhāṃ prati |

kena kasyeva | varheṇa mayūrapicchena viṣṇoḥ kṛṣṇasyeva |

kathambhūtasya viṣṇoḥ| gopaveśasya gopālaveṣadhāriṇaḥ|

kathambhūtena varheṇa | sphuritarucinollasitatejasā
pañcavarṇadyotinā yathā varheṇa kṛṣṇastathā
indradhanuḥkhaṇḍena tvaṃ meghaḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

pūrvasyāṃ diśi purastāditi |

valmīko mṛttakāsañcayastasyāgraṃ tasmādvalmīkagrāt |

ratneti | ratnānāṃ chāyā śobhā ratnacchāyā tasya vyatikaraḥ 
samūho ratnacchāyāvyatikaraḥ|

kṛṣṇasya gopālaveṣadhāritvānmayūrapicchadharitvamuktam kila |
gopālā hi prāyaśas mayūrapicchairābharaṇāni kurvantīti |

atropamālaṅkāraḥ|| 15 ||

tvayyāyattaṃ kṛṣiphalamiti bhrūvilāsānabhijñaiḥ 

prītisnigdhairjanapadavadhūlocanaiḥ pīyamānaḥ|

sadyaḥsīrotkaṣaṇasurabhi kṣetramāruhya mālaṃ 

kiñcitpaścātpravalaya gatiṃ bhūya evottareṇa || 16 ||

bhrūvikāra° Ma,Su; vraja laghugatis Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

mālamuḍḍāraṃ kṣetraṃ kiñcinmanāgāruhya paścāt
anantaramuttareṇottarasyāṃ diśi bhūyo bahutaraṃ gatiṃ 
pravalaya vyāvartaya|

mālaṃ hi dakṣiṇāśāsthaṃ tena cottarāśā gantavyeti
gatipravalanam|

mālārohaṇaṃ vṛṣṭyā vadhūprītyartham | mālena hi taduparibhavaṃ 
ākāśaṃ lakṣyate |

kīdṛśastvam | vṛṣṭidānāttvayyāyattaṃ kṛṣiphalamiti
ato hetorjanapadavadhūlocanaiḥ pīyamānaḥ sābhilāṣaṃ 
dṛśyamānaḥ|

kīdṛśaiḥ| grāmyatvādbhrūvilāsānabhijñais | ata eva
prītivaśātsnigdhairarūkṣaiḥ|

kīdṛśaṃ mālam | sadyastatkṣaṇaṃ sīreṇa halena yad
utkaṣaṇaṃ vilekhanaṃ tena surabhi sugandhi |

halotkṛṣṭā hi bhūrjaladajalakaṇavyatikarātsurabhirbhavati|

pravalanaṃ sphiraṇam|

uttareṇetyenavantaḥ||16||

\daksināvarta

tvayyāyattamiti ||

atredamanusandheyaṃ rāmagireruttarataḥ keciddevamātṛkāḥ 
janapadāḥ santi | tatratyāḥ striyaḥ pāmaryaḥ| tasmāttāsāṃ 
strīṇāṃ bhrūvilāsānabhijñatvamuktam |

sadyaḥsīrotkaṣaṇasurabhīdamārohaṇakriyāviśeṣaṇam |
varṣānantaraṃ halotkarṣaṇasurabhigandhamityarthaḥ|

mālaṃ parvataprāyamunnatasthalam | tathotpalamālāyām

meghamanmathayormāro māraṃ maraṇamiṣyate |

mālā puṣpādibandhe syānmālamunnatabhūtalam || iti |

mālayogānmālava iti prasiddho deśaḥ|

āruhyetyanenāpi tasyonnatatvaṃ pratīyate |

laghugatirmālakṣetre vṛṣṭivisarjanāllaghugatirityarthas |
mālena paścādgamanaṃ taduttareṇa gamanaṃ cāmrakūṭākhye
parvate viśrāntyarthamuktamityavaseyam || 16 ||

\mallinātha

tvayīti ||

kṛṣerhalakarmaṇaḥ phalaṃ sasyam tvayi | adhikaraṇavivakṣāyāṃ 
saptamī | āyattamadhīnam | adhīne nighna āyatta ityamaraḥ|

itihetoḥ| prītyā snigdhaiḥ| akritrimapremādrairityarthaḥ|
bhrūvikārāṇāṃ bhruvilāsānāmanabhijñaiḥ| pāmaratvāditi
śeṣaḥ| janapadavadhūnāṃ pallavīyoṣitāṃ locanaiḥ pīyamānaḥ 
sādaraṃ vīkṣyamāṇaḥ san |

mālaṃ mālākhyaṃ kṣetraṃ śailaprāyamunnatasthalam | mālaṃ 
unnatasthalamityutpalamālāyāṃ | Da!

sadyastatkālameva sīrairhalairutkaṣaṇena karṣaṇena surabhi
ghrāṇatarpaṇam yathā tathāruhya | tatrābhivṛṣṭyeti
arthaḥ| surabhighrāṇatarpaṇa ityamaraḥ| Da!

kiñcitpaścāllaghugatistatra nirvṛṣṭatvātkṣipragamanaḥ 
san | laghu kṣiprataraṃ drutamityamaraḥ|

bhūyaḥ punarapyuttareṇaivottaramārgeṇaiva vraja gaccha |
trṭīyāvidhāne prakrṭyādibhya upasaṅkhyānamiti trṭīyā |

yathā kaścidbahuvallabhaḥ patiḥ kutracitkṣetre kalatre gūḍhaṃ vihṛtya | 
kṣetraṃ śarīre kedāre siddhasthānakalatrayoriti viśvaḥ| 
