dākṣiṇyabhaṅgabhayānnīcamārgeṇa nirgatya punaḥ sarvādhyakṣaṃ saṃcaratitadvaditi dhvaniḥ|| 16 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bhuyaḥ punarapyuttareṇaivottarasyāṃ diśyeva vraja gaccha |

kiṃ kṛtvā | paścātpūrvasyāṃ diśi mālaṃ mālākhyaṃ deśam
kiñcitstokamāruhyoparisthitvā | tasminkṣaṇe varṣaṇaṃ 
kṛtvetyarthaḥ| kathambhūtaṃ mālam |
sadyaḥsīrotkaṣaṇasurabhi tatkālahalakarṣaṇasugandhi |

kathambhūtastvam | laghugatiḥ śīghragatis |

punaḥ kathambhūtastvam | janapadavadhūlocanaiḥ pīyamānaḥ 
sādaramavalokyamānaḥ|

kathambhūtairjanapadavadhūlocanaiḥ| bhrūvikārānabhijñaiḥ 
grāmyatvādbhrūvilāsācaturaiḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūtairjanapadavadhūlocanaiḥ| kṛṣiphalaṃ tvayi
āyattaṃ karṣaṇaniṣpattistvatāyatteti hetoḥ prītisnigdhaiḥ 
snehārūkṣaiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ|

sadyastatkālaṃ sīreṇa halena yadutkaṣaṇaṃ kheṭanaṃ tena
surabhīṇi sugandhāni kṣetrāṇi yasmiṃstat
sadyaḥsīrotkaṣa'nasurabhi |

mālamiti 
mālaṃ deśe vane 'pyuktaṃ mālaṃ grāmāntarāṭavī |
mālaṃ mālavadeśe ca vasaterūrdhvabhūmikā||
