iti vacanāt |


svabhāvoktiralaṅkāraḥ|| 16 ||

tvāmāsārapraśamitavanopaplavaṃ sādhu mūrdhnā

vakṣyatyadhvaśramaparigataṃ sānumānāmrakūṭas |

na kṣudro 'pi prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā saṃśrayāya

prāpte mitre bhavati vimukhaḥ kiṃ punaryastathoccaiḥ|| 17 ||

uccas Da;

VALL

adhvaśrameṇa parigataṃ vyāptaṃ bhavantaṃ sānumānadriḥ 
āmrakūṭo mūrdhnā śriṅgena sādhu samyagvakṣyati
dhārayiṣyati|

yata āsāreṇa praśamitavanopaplavastvam | tvayā hyasya
vegavarṣeṇa davāgnirnirvāpitas |

kimityetāvatā śirasā vahanamityāha na kṣudro 'pītyādi
|

saṃśrayāya vāsārthaṃ suhṛdyāyāte sati kṣudro 'pi durjanaḥ 
api vimukho na bhavati|

kiṃ punaryastathā tena prakāreṇoccairunnataḥ|

kutaḥ| prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā | ādāvetena me mahadupakṛtam|

idānīmetasyāhaṃ pratyupakaromīti pūrvopakārapratyālocanayā
na parāṅmukhībhāvaḥ|

kṣudraḥ khalo hrasvaśca|

uccaiḥ prāṃśurmahāmanāśca|

vakṣyatīti vaheḥ rūpam|

sānumānparvataḥ|

tathetyanenoccaistvasya prasiddhamāha ||17||

\daksināvarta

tāmeva viśrāntamāha tvāmāsāreti ||

anena prathamopakāraḥ sūcitaḥ| āsāro dhārāsampātaḥ|

mūrdhnā śikhareṇa śirasāpīti dhvanyate |

vakṣyati vaheridaṃ rūpam |

adhvaśramaparigatamadhvaśrameṇa parikṣīnagamanamiti vyācakṣate
| madvahane kiṃ kāraṇamityāśaṅkyāha na kṣudro 'pīti |

saṃśrayāya nivāsāya |

tathocca iti hṛdayasthitatadvaibhavānusandhānena tathāśabdaḥ 
prayuktaḥ|

kṣudro 'pi svasmin saṃśrayāya mitre prāpte
prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā vimukho na bhavati | tathoccaḥ kiṃ 
punarityarthaḥ|| 17 ||

\mallinātha

tvamiti ||

āmrāścūtāḥ kūṭeṣu śikhareṣu yasya sa āmrakuṭo nāma
sanumānparvataḥ| āmraścūto rasālo 'sāviti kūṭo 'strī
śikharaṃ śṛṅgamityamaraḥ|

āsāro dhārāvṛṣṭiḥ| dhārāsampāta āsāra ityamaraḥ|

tena praśamito vanopaplavo dāvāgniryena tam | kṛtopakāramiti
arthaḥ| adhvaśrameṇa parigataṃ vyāptaṃ tvām sādhu samyak
mūrdhnā vakṣyati voḍhā | vaheḥ ḷṭ |

tathā hi kṣudraḥ kṛpaṇo 'pi | kṣudro daridre kṛpaṇe nṛśaṃsa iti yādavaḥ|

saṃśrayāya saṃśrayaṇāya mitre suhṛdi | atha mitraṃ sakhā suhṛt
ityamaraḥ| prāpta āgate sati | prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā
pūrvopakāraparyālocanayā vimukho na bhavati | yastathā tena
prakareṇoccairunnataḥ sa āmrakūṭaḥ kiṃ punaḥ| vimukho na
bhavatikimu vaktavyamityarthaḥ| etena prathamāvasathe
saukhyalābhātte kāryasiddhirastītisūcitaṃ | taduktaṃ 
nimittanidāne

prathamāvasathe yasya saukhyaṃ tasyākhile 'dhvani |

śivaṃ bhavati yātrāyāmanyathā tvaśubhaṃ dhruvam || iti || 17
||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he jaladāmrakūṭanāmā parvatastvām sādhu yathā syāttathā
mūrdhnā mastakena kṛtvā vakṣyati dhārayiṣyate |

kathambhūta āmrakūṭas | sānumāñchikharayuktaḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ tvām | āsārapraśamitavanopaplavam |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ tvām | adhvaśramaparigataṃ 
dūrīkṛtamārgaśramam |

yataḥ kāraṇātkṣudro 'pi nīco 'pi mitre prāpte sati mitra 
āgate sati saṃśrayāyāśrayāya prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā
prathamopakārakaraṇena vimukhaḥ parāmukho na bhavati | tathā tena
prakāreṇa ya āmrakūṭaparvatasadṛśaḥ punaruccairguṇajñātā
bhavati tasya kiṃ kathyate |

ityanvayaḥ||

āsāretyāsāreṇa vegavarṣeṇa praśamitaḥ spheṭitaḥ 
vanopaplavo dāvāgnijvālanalakṣaṇo vanaṣaṇḍopadravo yena saḥ 
āsārapraśamitavanopaplavastamāsārapraśamitavanopaplavam |

adhvaśrametyadhvaśrameṇa mārgasya khedena parigataḥ sahitaḥ 
adhvaśramaparigatastamadhvapariśramagatam |

prathametiprathamaṃ ca tatsukṛtaṃ ca prathamasukṛtaṃ tasya
apekṣā dākṣiṇyaṃ prathamasukṛtāpekṣā tayā
prathamasukṛtāpekṣayā | anumānārthāntaranyāsaḥ|| 17 ||

adhvaklāntaṃ pratimukhagataṃ sānumānāmrakūṭaḥ 

tuṅgena tvāṃ jalada śirasā vakṣyati ślāghamānaḥ|

āsāreṇa tvamapi śamayestasya naidāghamagniṃ 

satkārārdraḥ phalati na cireṇopakāro mahatsu || 17a || omits
Da,Ma; 18 Su;

sadbhāvārdras Ma; dhārayiṣyatyavaśyam Su; mentioned by Ma in 19

VALL

etadanukārī kvacidayamapi śloko vidyate ||

tvāṃ pathi śrāntaṃ sammukhāgatamāmrakūṭākhyaḥ sānumān
uccena śirasā ślāghayā vakṣyati |

tvamapi tasya vegavarṣeṇa dāvānalaṃ nirvāpayeḥ| yasmāt
mahāpuruṣeṣu satkārārdraḥ pūjārdra upakārī yo vidhīyate
so 'cireṇa phaliṣyati |

atra mahattvaṃ meghasya pūrvatra tu parvatasya | sarvonnato 'pi
jaladharo 'tra viśrāmyatītyadreḥ ślāghātra || 17a ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he jalada sānumān śikharayukta āmrakūṭaḥ parvatastvāṃ 
avaśyam niścayena śirasā mastakena dhārayiṣyati |

kathambhūtaṃ tvām | adhvaklāntaṃ mārgakhinnam |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ tvām | pratimukhagataṃ sanmukhīgatam |

kathambhūtena śirasā | tuṅgena atyuccena |

he tvamapi tasyāmrakūṭanāmnaḥ parvatasyāgniṃ vahniṃ 
śamayeḥ śāntim prāpnuyāḥ|

kena | āsāreṇa vegavadvṛṣṭyā |

kathambhūtamagnim | naidāghaṃ grīṣmakālinam |

yataḥ (yasmāddhetoḥ ) mahatsu guṇagariṣṭheṣu viṣaye yo 'sau
upakāraḥ sa cireṇa dūreṇa na phalati kiṃ tu tatkālameva phalati |

kathambhūta upakāras | sadbhāvārdraḥ samyaksneharasasahitaḥ|

ityanvayaḥ|

jaleti | jalaṃ dadātīti jaladastasya sambodhane he jalada |

adhveti| adhvanaḥ klānto 'dhvaklāntastamadhvaklāntam |

āsāreti vegavānvarṣa ityabhidhānacintāmaṇiḥ|

nidāghe grīṣme bhavo naidāgham |

sadbhāveti sadbhāvena bhavyābhiprāyeṇārdraḥ sarāgaḥ 
sadbhāvārdraḥ|

arthāntaranyāsālaṅkāraḥ|| 18 || -17a-

channopāntaḥ pariṇataphaladyotibhiḥ kānanāmraiḥ 

tvayyārūḍhe śikharamacalaḥ snigdhaveṇīsavarṇe|

nūnaṃ yāsyatyamaramithunaprekṣaṇīyāmavasthāṃ 

madhye śyāmaḥ stana iva bhuvaḥ śeṣavistārapāṇḍuḥ||18|| 19 Su

sarpa° Da;

VALL

tvayi śṛṅgamudgate satyāmrakūṭo 'calo niścitaṃ 
surayugalālokanīyāṃ ramyāṃ daśāmāpatsyate|

yataḥ pariṇataphaladyotibhiḥ pakvāmraśobhibhirvanāmravṛkṣaiḥ 
channopāntaśchāditaparyantaḥ|

tvamapi snigdhaveṇīsavarṇe 'rūkṣakeśakalāpakālaḥ|

ataśca kṛṣṇacūcukaḥ samastapītaśca mahīkuca ivetyupamā
|

ata eva devadvandvadarśanam || 18 ||

\daksināvarta

channeti ||

channopāntaśchāditaparyantaḥ|

pariṇataphaladyotibhiḥ pariṇataphalapāṇḍuvarṇojjvalaiḥ|
pāṇḍuvarṇatvaṃ ca hariṇasamānavarṇatvam na tu śvaityam |
āmraphalānāmanekavarṇatvāt |

anekavarṇaṃ pavanāvadhūtam bhūmau patatyāmraphalaṃ vipakvaṃ 

iti śrīrāmāyaṇavacanadarśanāt {4.28.19}| anena varṣāsu
kānanāmrāḥ phalantīti sūcitam |

sarpaveṇīsavarṇe | veṇī keśabandhaḥ| sarpasya veṇī sarpasya
veṣṭanam | varṇataḥ saṃsthānataśca sarpaveṇīsamāna iti
arthaḥ 

nīlālake meghacaye mecake stanacūcuke |

maṇḍale kṛṣṇasarpānāṃ sarpaveṇī nigadyate | {divākara}

śeṣavistārapāṇḍurmadhyādanyatra hariṇavarṇaḥ| hariṇaḥ 
pāṇḍuraḥ pāṇḍurityamaraḥ|| 18 ||

\mallinātha

channeti ||

he megha pariṇataiḥ paripakvaiḥ phalairdyotanta iti tathoktaiḥ 
| āṣāḍhe vanacūtāḥ phalanti pacyante ca meghavāteneti
āśayaḥ|

kānanāmrairvanacūtaiśchannopānta āvṛtapārśvo 'calaḥ 
āmrakūṭādriḥ snigdhaveṇīsavarṇe masṛṇakeśabandhacchāye |
śyāmavarṇa ityarthaḥ| veṇī keśabandhe jalasrutāviti
yādavaḥ|

tvayi śikharaṃ śṛṅgamārūḍhe sati | yasya ca bhāvena
bhāvalakṣaṇamiti saptamī | madhye syāmaḥ śeṣe madhyādanyatra
vistāre paritaḥ pāṇḍurhariṇaḥ| hariṇaḥ pāṇḍuraḥ pāṇḍuḥ 
ityamaraḥ|

bhuvaḥ stana iva | amaramithunānāṃ khecarāṇāmiti bhāvaḥ|
prekṣaṇīyāṃ darśanīyāmavasthām nūnaṃ yāsyati |

mithunagrahaṇam kāmināmeva stanatvenotprekṣā sambhavatīti
kṛtam | yathā pariśrāntaḥ kaścitkāmī kāminīnāṃ kucakalaśe
viśrāntaḥ sansvapiti tadvadbhavānapi bhuvo nāyikāyāḥ 
stana iti dhvaniḥ|| 18 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he jalada sa āmrakūṭānāmā acalaḥ parvato nūnaṃ niścayena
amaramithunaprekṣaṇīyāmavasthāṃ devadevīyugmaramanīyāṃ daśām
yāsyati dhārayiṣyati |

kva sati | śikharaṃ parvatasya śṛiṅgaṃ tvayyārūḍhe sati
āśrite sati |

kathambhūto 'calaḥ| kānanāmraiśchannopāntaḥ 
vanasthāmravṛkṣairācchāditaparyantaḥ|

kathambhūtaḥ kānanāmraiḥ| pariṇataphaladyotibhiḥ 
paripakvaphalaśobhamānaiḥ|

kathambhūta tvayi | snigdhaveṇīsavarṇe kāntimadveṇīdaṇḍasamāne
|

utprekṣyate | sa āmrakūṭanāmā parvataḥ kasyāḥ ka iva |
bhuvo bhūmyāḥ stana iva cūcaka iva | [cūcam?]
[cūcakapradeśe?]

kathambhūtaḥ stanaḥ| madhye śyāmaścūcapradeśe kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūtaḥ stanaḥ| śeṣavistārapāṇḍuścūcakaṃ 
tyaktvā sarvato gauraḥ|

ityanvayaḥ|

pariṇateti | pariṇatāni paripakvāni yāni phalāni
pariṇataphalāni tairdyotibhiḥ pariṇatadyotibhiḥ|

snigdheti | snigdhā kāntimatī veṇī snigdhaveṇī tasyāḥ 
savarṇaḥ sadṛśaḥ śyāmaḥ snigdhaveṇīsavarṇas tasmin
snigdhaveṇisavarṇe |

śeṣeti | śeṣe 'parabhāge stanasya vistāra sarvataḥ pāṇḍuḥ 
śeṣavistārapāṇḍuḥ|

atrāmrakūṭaparvatasya stanopamānaṃ cūcakasya meghopamānam |

mukhyopamālaṅkāraḥ|| 19 || -18-

sthitvā tasminvanacaravadhūbhuktakuñje muhūrtaṃ 

toyotsargadrutataragatistatparaṃ vartma tīrṇaḥ|

revāṃ drakṣyasyupalaviṣame vindhyapāde viśīrṇāṃ 

bhakticchedairiva viracitāṃ bhūtimaṅge gajasya || 19 || 20 Su

toyotsargāt ° Su;

VALL

aśvamukhādīnāṃ vanecarāṇāṃ kāntābhiḥ sevitagahane tatra
adraukṣaṇaṃ sthitvā tadanantaraṃ vartma mārgamavatīrṇastvaṃ 
revāṃ narmadāmālokayiṣyasi|

kīdṛśīm | upalaviṣame vindhyādreḥ pāde 'dhobhāge viśīrṇāṃ 
vikṣiptām |

ataśca bhakticchedairvicchittavibhāgairdattāṃ gajavapuṣi
bhūtiṃ sudhāmivetyupamā |

toyotsargeṇa jalatyāgena drutatarā caturā gatiryasyeti
vartmataraṇe kāraṇam |

vanacaraśabde na saptamyā alugbāhulakāt ||19||

\daksināvarta

sthitveti ||

kuñjaṃ latādipihitodaraṃ parvatagṛham | anena
vanacaravadhūsambhogaṃ ca drakṣyasītyuktam |

muhūrtamanena vanacaravadhūparibhogadarśanāttava kālavilambaḥ 
mā bhūditi vivakṣitam |

toyotsargadrutataragatirāsārapraśamitadavopaplavamityatra uktaḥ 
toyotsargo 'tra vivakṣitaḥ|

tatparaṃ śailātparam | tīrṇo 'tikrāntaḥ|
vanacaramithunaparibhogānatidarśanāttava viṣādo mā bhūt | ??
sambhogalolupaṃ mithunāntaraṃ drakṣyasīti abhiprāyeṇāha
revāṃ drakṣyasīti | revāṃ narmadāṃ | vindhyapāde
vindhyaparyantaparvate | vindhyapāde viśīrṇāmityanena
kāmātiśayātpriyatamapāde kasyāścit patanaṃ dhvanyate |

bhakticchedaiśchedākārabhaktibhirbahuvidhābhirbhaktirekhābhiḥ|
viracitāmarpitām | bhūtiṃ bhasitam | uktaṃ ca

bhaktibhirbahuvidhābhirarpitā

bhāti bhūtiriva mattahastinaḥ| iti || 19 || {kum8.69}

\mallinātha

sthitveti ||

he megha | vane caranti te vanacarāḥ| tatpuruṣe kṛti bahulamiti
bahulagrahaṇāllugbhavati | teṣām vadhūbhirbhuktāḥ kuñjāḥ 
latāgṛhā yatra tasmin | nikuñjakuñjo vā klībe
latādipihitodara ityamaraḥ| tatra te nayanavinodo 'stīti
arthaḥ|

tasminnāmrakūṭe muhūrtamalpakālaṃ na tu ciram svakāryavirodhāt
iti bhāvaḥ| muhūrtamalpakāle syāddhaṭikādvitaye 'pi ceti
śabdārṇave | ? sthitvā viśramya |

toyotsargeṇa tvāmāsāretyuktavarṣaṇena drutataragatiḥ 
lāghavāddhetoratikṣipragamanaḥ saṃstasmādāmrakūṭātparaṃ 
anantaraṃ tatparaṃ vartma mārgaṃ tīrṇo 'tikrāntaḥ|

upalaiḥ pāṣāṇairviṣame vindhyasyādreḥ pāde pratyantaparvate |
pādāḥ pratyantaparvatā ityamaraḥ| viśīrṇāṃ samantataḥ 
visṛmarām | etena kasyāścit kāmukyāḥ priyatamacaraṇapāto 'pi
dhvanyate |

revāṃ narmadām | revā tu narmadā somodbhavā mekalakanyaketi
amaraḥ| gajasyāṅge śarīre bhaktayo racanā rekhā iti yāvat
| bhaktirniṣevaṇe bhāge racanāyāmiti śabdārṇave | tāsāṃ 
chedairbhaṅgibhirbhābhirviracitāṃ bhūtiṃ śṛṅgāramiva
bhasitamiva vā | bhūtirmātaṅgaśṛṅgāre jātau bhasmani sampadi
iti viśvaḥ| drakṣyasi |

ayamapi mahā.ṃste nayanakautukalābha iti bhāvaḥ|

ślokayormadhye kvacitprakṣipto 'yam dṛśyate

adhvaklāntaṃ pratimukhagataṃ sānumānāmrakūṭaḥ 

tuṅgena tvāṃ jalada śirasā vakṣyati ślāghamānaḥ|

āsāreṇa tvamapi śamayestasya naidāghamagniṃ 

sadbhāvārdraḥ phalati na cireṇopakāro mahatsu || 19 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha revāṃ narmadānāmnīṃ nadīṃ tvamavalokayiṣyasi |

kiṃ kṛtvā | tasminnāmrakūṭe parvate muhūrtamātram sthitvā vṛṣṭiṃ kṛtvā |

kathambhūtastvam | tatparaṃ tasmādāmrakūṭaparvatātparaṃ 
parabhāgavartīdṛ.śaṃ yadvartma mārgaṃ tīrṇo laṅghitaḥ 
san |

kathambhūte tasmin | vanacaravadhūbhuktakuñje |

punaḥ kathambhūtam | drutataragatiḥ śīghragatiḥ|

kasmāt | toyotsargājjalasya varṣanāt |

kathambhūtāṃ revām | vindhyapāde vindhyācalaparvatamūle
viśīrṇāṃ vistṛtām |

kathambhūte vindhyapāde | upalaviṣame pāṣanairdurlaṅghye |

utprekṣate revāṃ kāmiva | gajasyāṅge viracitāṃ kṛtāṃ 
bhūtiṃ rakṣāmiva |

kaiḥ| bhakticchedairnānāprakāraiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ|

vaneti vanacarāṇāṃ kinnarabhillānāṃ vadhūbhiḥ strībhiḥ 
surataprasaṅgasamaye bhuktāni sevitāni kuñjāni gahvarāni vā
latācchāditasthānāni yasmin sa tasminvanacaravadhūbhuktakuñje |
etena sambhogasthānamuktam |

toyeti toyasyodakasyotsargaḥ patanaṃ vā varṣaṇaṃ 
toyotsargastasmāttoyotsargāt | udakatyāgāttvaritagatam |

druteti drutatarā śīghratarā gatiryasya sa drutataragatiḥ|

tatparamiti tasmādāmrakūṭaparvatātparamantaram |

upaletiśilābhirviṣamo durlaṅghya upalaviṣamastasmin
upalaviṣame |

vindhyeti vindhyasya prasiddhaśikhariṇaḥ pāde vindhyapāde |
pratyantaparvata ityarthaḥ|

atropamālaṅkāraḥ|| 20 || -19-

tasyāstiktairvanagajamadairvāsitaṃ vāntavṛṣṭiḥ 

jambūṣaṇḍapratihatarayaṃ toyamadāya gaccheḥ|

antaḥsāraṃ ghana tulayituṃ nānilaḥ śakṣyati tvāṃ 

riktaḥ sarvo bhavati hi laghuḥ pūrṇatā gauravāya || 20 || 21 Su

°kuñja° Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

tasyā revāyā jalamādāya gṛhītvā tvaṃ yāyāḥ| yataḥ 
vāntavṛṣṭirutsṛṣṭatoyaḥ|

kīdṛśaṃ jalam | tiktaiḥ kaṭukairvanagajamadairvāsitaṃ 
surabhīkṛtam|

vindhyo hi gajavāsaḥ|

tathā tīrajena jambūṣaṇḍena jambūvanena pratihatarayaṃ 
jaḍīkṛtavegamiti sugrahatvoktiḥ| revā hi vegagāminī| anena
guṇamāha|

he ghanāmbhaḥpānādantaḥsāraṃ paripūrṇaṃ santaṃ mārutaḥ 
tvāṃ tulayituṃ paricchettuṃ na prabhaviṣyati |

yasmātsarva eva kaścidriktaḥ śūnyo 'rtharahito laghuḥ 
bhavatyavamānāspadatvaṃ yāti | pūrṇatā tu gauravāya bhavati|

āḍhyo hi sarveṇādriyate |

tena tava jalena gurutve sati nānilātparibhavaprāptiḥ|| 20 ||

\daksināvarta

tasyā iti ||

tasyāstiktaistiktaśabdena surabhigandhaśca tiktarasaśca
vivakṣitaḥ|

kaṭutiktakaṣāyāstu saurabhye parikīrtitā iti haladhāraḥ|

vanagajamadairvindhyāṭavīgajamadairvāsitamanena
gandhasaṅkāro rūṣitatvaṃ ca vivakṣitam |

vāntavṛṣṭiranena varṣotsargaśchardiśca |

jambūkuñjapratihatarayamanena laghutvaṃ ca kaṣāyabhāvanā ca |
antaḥsāramanenābhyantarasthajalatvamabhyantarabalatvaṃ ca
vivakṣitam | ghanānena meghaśca sthiraśarīraśca |

anilo 'nena bāhyaḥ śarīravāyuśca |

rikto 'nena kṛśaśca kṛtavamanaśuddhiśca vivakṣitaḥ|

pūrṇatānena toyapātena peyādikrameṇa cāpyāyanam |

ayamatra samādhiḥ kṛtavamanaśuddhiḥ puruṣas
śeṣadoṣopaśoṣaṇārthaṃ tiktakaṣāyavāsitaṃ laghujalaṃ pibati |
paścāt balavato 'sya vāyurapi na kupyatīti | atra vāhaṭaḥ 

kaṣāyāścāhimāstasya viśuddhau śleṣmaṇas hitāḥ|

kimu tiktāḥ kaṣāyā vā ye nisargātkaphāpahāḥ|| iti |

svaranāde 'pi

kṛtaśuddheḥ kramātpītapeyādeḥ pathyabhojinaḥ|

vātādibhirna bādhā syādindriyairiva yoginaḥ|| iti || 20 ||

\mallinātha

tasyā iti ||

he megha vāntavṛṣṭirudgīrṇavarṣaḥ san | kṛtavamanaśca
vyajyate |

tiktaiḥ sugandhibhistiktarasavadbhiśca | tikto rase sugandhau ca
iti viśvaḥ| vanagajamadairvāsitaṃ surabhitaṃ bhāvitaṃ ca |
himavadvindhyamalayā gajānāṃ prabhavā iti vindhyasya
gajaprabhavatvāditi bhāvaḥ| jambūkuñjaiḥ pratihatarayaṃ 
pratibaddhavegam | sukhapeyamityarthaḥ| anena laghutvaṃ 
kaṣāyabhāvanā ca vyajyate |

tasyā revāyāstoyamādāya gacchervraja |

he ghana meghāntaḥ sāram balaṃ yasya taṃ tvāmanilaḥ 
ākāśavāyuḥ| śarīrasthaśca gamyate | tulayituṃ na śakṣyati
śakto na bhaviṣyati |

tathā hi rikto 'ntaḥsāraśūnyaḥ sarvo 'pi laghurbhavati |
prakampyo bhavatītyarthaḥ|

pūrṇatā sāravattā gauravāya aprakampyatvāya bhavatītyarthaḥ|

ayamatra dhvanirādau vamanaśodhitasya puṃsaḥ paścācchleṣmaśoṣoṇāya laghutiktakaṣāyāmbupānāllabdhabalasya vātaprakampo na bhavatīti |
tathāha vāgbhaṭaḥ 

kaṣāyāścāhimāstasya viśuddhau śleṣmaṇas hitāḥ|

kimu tiktakaṣāyā vā ye nisargātkaphāpahāḥ||

kṛtaśuddheḥ kramāt pītapeyādeḥ pathyabhojinaḥ|

vātādibhirna bādhā syādindriyairiva yoginaḥ|| iti || 20 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he meghāgratastvaṃ gacchervrajes |

kiṃ kṛtvā | tasyā narmadānāmnīnadyāstoyaṃ jalamādāya
gṛhītvā |

kathambhūtastvam | vāntavṛṣṭirāmrakūṭanāmni parvate
kṛtavṛṣṭiḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ toyam | vanagajamadairvāsitaṃ vanotpannakarimadaiḥ surabhitam |

kathambhūtairvanagajamadaiḥ| tiktaistīkṣṇaiḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ toyam | jambūkuñjapratihatarayaṃ 
jambūtarugahanaskhalitavegam |

he ghana meghānilo vāyustvāṃ tulayituṃ parābhavaṃ kartuṃ na
śakṣyati na samartho bhaviṣyati |

kathambhūtaṃ tvām | antassāraṃ madhyabhāge jalam |

riktakoṣṭhatve hi nirmale śarīre marudvāyuḥ parābhavati |

kaviramumevārthaṃ dṛḍhayati |

hi yato rikto vibhavavarjitaḥ sarvo jano laghuranādaraṇīyaḥ 
bhavati |

pūrṇatā samṛddhatā gauravāyādarārthaṃ bhavati |

ityanvayaḥ||

vaneti vanānāṃ gajā vanagajāsteṣāṃ madā vanagajamadāḥ 
tairvanagajamadaiḥ|

jambviti jambūkuñjena pratihato rayo vego yasya tat
jambūkuñjapratihatarayam |

anta ityanto madhye sāram jalamantassāram | nyāye ca nīre ca
ghane ca sāramityanekārthaḥ sāraśabdena jalam |

gaureti gurorbhāvo gauravaṃ tasmai gauravāya |

atrārthāntaranyāso 'laṅkāraḥ|| 21 || -20-

nīpaṃ dṛṣṭvā haritakapiśaṃ kesarairardharūḍhaiḥ 

āvirbhūtaprathamamukulāḥ kandalīścānukaccham|

dagdhāraṇyeṣvadhikasurabhiṃ gandhamāghrāya corvyāḥ 

sāraṅgāste jalalavamucaḥ sūcayiṣyanti mārgam || 21 || 22 Su

dagdhāraṇyeṣu (Da),(Ma); jagdhvāraṇyeṣu Da,Ma;

VALL

jalalavamucastoyakaṇavarṣiṇastava sāraṅgā mayūrā mārgaṃ 
sūcayiṣyanti cihnairūhiṣyante| nūnamanena pathāsmatsuhṛit
jīmūta āyāta iti| tairhi meghāttoyakaṇāḥ pātavyā iti
tadanusaraṇam|

svādādihṛtacittatvādvrajaṃścāsau tairna lakṣita iti
mārgonnayanam|

kiṃ kṛtvā sūcayiṣyantīti cihnānyāha |

ardhaṃ rūḍhaiḥ sāmipakvaiḥ kesarairharitakapiśaṃ nīlapiṅgaṃ 
nīpakusumaṃ dṛṣṭvā | taddhi varṣāsu navajalapātaṃ vinā na
jāyate|

tathāvirbhūtaprathamamukulā utpannādyakorakāḥ kandalītāḥ 
anukacchaṃ tīrasamīpe dṛṣṭvā| tā hi varṣāsu phullanti|

tathā dagdhāraṇyeṣu nidāghapluṣṭakānaneṣvadhikasurabhiṃ 
gandhaṃ pṛthivyā āghrāya śiṅghitvā | jalakaṇapātāddhi tatra
saugandhyāvirbhāvaḥ|

jalalavamuca iti meghaviśeṣaṇaṃ na tu jasantam || 21 ||

\daksināvarta

nīpamiti ||

nīpaḥ kadambaḥ| sa ca dvividho jalakadambaḥ sthalakadambaśceti
| jalakadambastaruprāyaḥ| sthalakadambaḥ prādeśamātraprarūḍhaḥ 
oṣadhiviśeṣaḥ| atra sthalakadambo vivakṣitaḥ| tasya varṣāsu
eva prādurbhāvāt | ata eva kadambasya prāvṛṣeṇyasañjñā |
kadambaḥ pulakī śrīmānprāvṛṣenyo halipriya iti yādavaḥ|

nīpaṃ haritakapiśaṃ haritaḥ pālāśavarṇaḥ kapiśaḥ svarṇābhaḥ 
| ardharūḍhairekadeśaprarūḍhais | anena tasya navaprādurbhāvaḥ 
sūcitaḥ| āvirbhūtaprathamamukulā anenāpi
kandalīmukulaprādurbhāvasya navatvamuktam |

anukacchamanujalaprāyadeśam | jalaprāyamanūpaṃ syātpuṃsi
kacchastathāvidhirityamaraḥ|

jagdhveti pāthaḥ| jagdhvā bhakṣayitvā | ada bhakṣaṇa iti
asmāddhātoḥ ktvāpratyaye kṛte 'do jagdhirlyapti kitīti
jagdhyādeśaḥ| {p2.4.36}

nanūrvīgandhasya vakṣyamāṇatvāddagdhāraṇyeṣviti pāṭhaḥ 
eva yukta iti | tanna | dāhamantareṇāpi vasudhāgandhasya
sambhavāt | uttaratra vakṣyati ca tvaṃ 
niḥṣyandocchvasitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyeti | araṇyeṣu
sarvaśeṣamidam | adhikasurabhiṃ svabhāvata evorvyāḥ 
gandhavat[t]vāpekṣayādhikaśabdaḥ prayuktaḥ|

sāraṅgā hariṇāḥ| 
cātake hariṇe puṃsi saraṅgaḥ śabalastriṣvitisimhaḥ|

jalalavamuco 'nena nīpakandalīvasudhāgandhānāmutpādakatvaṃ 
uktam | nirmanuṣyeṣvaraṇyeṣu hariṇāstava
abhinavavṛṣṭipātodbhūtaṃ nīpaṃ dṛṣṭvā tathānukacchaṃ 
kandalīśca jagdhvorvyā adhikasurabhiṃ gandhamāghrāya
tvadgamanamārgaṃ tvadāgamanotsukebhyaḥ pathikebhyaḥ sūcayiṣyanti
ityarthaḥ|

ye punaḥ sāraṅgaśabdena cātakahariṇagajā vivakṣitā iti
vyācakṣate teṣāṃ tu matamupekṣaṇīyaṃ sāraṅgaśabdasya
gajavācitvādarśanāt | sāraṅgaḥ śabalo varṇaścātakaḥ 
ṣaṭpado mṛga iti yādavaḥ| kiṃ ca ekasyaiva śabdasya
yugapadanekārthatvasya bhinnakriyāsamanvayasya ca kliṣṭatvāt
kandalīścetyatra samuccayānupapatteścetyalaṃ 
atiprasaṅgena || 21 ||

\mallinātha

nīpamiti ||

sāraṅgā mataṅgajāḥ kuraṅgā bhṛṅgā vā |
sāraṅgaścātake bhṛṅge kuraṅge ca mataṅgaja iti viśvaḥ|

ardharūḍhairekadeśodgataiḥ kesaraiḥ kiñjalkairharitaṃ 
pālāśavarṇaṃ kapiśaṃ kṛṣṇapītaṃ ca | pālāśo haritaḥ 
hariditi syāvaḥ syātkapiṣo dhūmradhūmalau kṛṣṇalohitāviti
cāmaraḥ| śyāmavarṇamiti yāvat | varṇo varṇeneti samāsaḥ 
|

nīpaṃ sthalakadambakusumam | atha sthalakadambake | nīpaḥ syāt
pulaka iti śabdārṇave | dṛṣṭvā samprekṣya viditveti yāvat |

tathā kaccheṣvanūpeṣu | avyayaṃ vibhaktītiyādinā vibhaktyatha?
avayayībhāvaḥ| jalaprāyamanūpaṃ syātpuṃsi kacchastathā
avadhirityamaraḥ|

āvirbhūtāḥ prathamāḥ prathamotpannā mukulā yāsāṃ tāḥ 
kandalīrbhūmikadalīḥ| droṇaparṇī snigdhakandā kandalī
bhūkadalyapīti śabdārṇave |

jagdhvā bhakṣayitvā | ado jagdhiriti jadhyādeśaḥ|

aranyeṣvadhikasurabhimiti ghrāṇatarpanam | dagdhāraṇyeṣviti
pāṭhe dagdhamityadhikaviśeṣaṇam | arthavaśātkandalīśca
dṛṣṭvaivetyanvayo draṣṭavyaḥ|

urvyā bhūmergandhamāghrāya jalalavamuco meghasya te tava
mārgaṃ sūcayiṣyantyanumāpayiṣyanti | yatra yatra vṛṣṭikāryaṃ 
kandalīmukulanīpakusumādikam dṛśyate tatra tatra tvayā vṛṣamiti
anumīyata iti bhāvaḥ|| 21 ||

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha saraṅgāste tava mārgam sūcayiṣyanti kathayiṣyanti |

kiṃ kṛtvā | nīpaṃ kadambavṛkṣasya puṣpaṃ dṛṣṭvā | punaḥ 
kadambalīrvanaspativiśeṣāndṛṣṭvā |

kathambhūtaṃ nīpam | kesarairharitakapiśaṃ nīlapītavarṇam |

kathambhūtaiḥ kesaraiḥ| ardharūḍhairardhavikasitaiḥ|

kathambhūtāḥ kandalīḥ| āvirbhūtaprathamamukulā meghāgame
sañjātanūtanakorakāḥ|

kva | anukacchaṃ kacchamanu lakṣīkṛtya |

kathambhūtasya te | jalalavamuco jaladhārāvarṣiṇaśīlasya |

punaḥ kiṃ kṛtvā | ūrvyāḥ pṛthivyā gandhaṃ vāsanāmāghrāya
siṅghitvā |

keṣu | dagdhāraṇyeṣu vahninā dagdhavanabhūmiṣu |

kathambhūtaṃ gandham | adhikasurabhimatyantasaurabhaṃ |

ityanvayas ||

pṛthivyā hi gandhaḥ svābhāvika eva jalakaṇasiktāyāḥ punaḥ 
bhūyanbhavati |

saraṅgeti sāram gāyantīti sāraṅgā bhramarā nipaṃ 
dṛṣṭvā | sarovaraṃ gacchatīti sāraṅgā mṛgāḥ kandalīḥ 
dṛṣṭvā | sāraṃ salilaṃ gacchantīti saraṅgā gajāḥ|

jaleti jalalavaṃ muñcatīti jalalavamuktasya jalalavamucaḥ|

atrānumānālaṅkāraḥ|| 22 || -21-

ambhobindugrahaṇacaturāṃścātakānvīkṣyamāṇāḥ 

śreṇibhūtāḥ parigaṇayā nirdiśanto balākāḥ|

tvāmāsādya stanitasamaye mānayiṣyanti siddhāḥ 

sotkampāni priyasahacarīsambhramāliṅgitāni || 21a || 22 Ma; 23 Su;
omit Va,Da;

°rabhasān Su; sotkaṇṭhāni Su;

\mallinātha

pratikṣiptamapi vyākhyāyate 'mbha iti ||

ambhobindūnāṃ varṣodabindūnāṃ grahaṇe | sarvasahāpatitam? ambu na
cātakasya hitamiti śāstrādbhūspṛṣṭodakasya teṣāṃ 
rogahetutvādantarāla eva svīkāre caturāṃścātakān
vīkṣyamāṇāḥ kautukātpaśyantaḥ|

śreṇībhūtā baddhapaṅktīrbalākā bakapaṅktīḥ 
parigaṇanayā ekā dve tisra iti saṅkhyānena nirdiśanto hastena
darśayantaḥ|

siddhāḥ stanitasamaye tvadgarjitakāle sotkampāni utkampapūrvakāṇi
priyasahacarīṇām sambhrameṇāliṅgitānyāsādya |
svayaṅgrahaṇāśleṣasukhamanubhūyetyarthaḥ| 
tvāṃ mānayiṣyanti | tvannimittatvātsukhalābhasyeti bhāvaḥ|| 22 ||
-21a-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha siddhā devaviśeṣāḥ sotkaṇṭhānyutkaṇṭhāyuktāni
votsāhayuktāni mānayiṣyantyanubhaviṣyanti |

kāni | priyasahacarīsambhramāliṅgitāni bhujābhyāṃ hṛdayena
sahahrḍayāliṅganacumbanādīni |

kiṃ kṛtvā | tvāṃ meghamāsādya prāpya |

kva | stanitasamaye garjanāvasare |

kathambhūtāḥ siddhāḥ| cātakāṃścātakapakṣījīvāngagana iti
śeṣo vīkṣyamānā avalokayantaḥ|

kathambhūtāṃścātakān | ambhovindhugrahaṇarabhasāñjalakaṇagrahaṇe utkaṇṭhitān |

punaḥ kathambhūtāḥ siddhāḥ| valākā vakapatnīrvakadārān
nirdiśanto 'ṅgulyā kṛtvā darśayantaḥ|

kayā | parigaṇanayaikadvayādigaṇanamātratayā |

kathambhūtā valākā vakastriyaḥ| śreṇībhūtāḥ paṅktyā
kṛtvaikībhāvaṃ sañjātāḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

sotkaṇṭheti utkaṇṭhāsahitāni sotkaṇṭhāni |

priyeti | priyasahacarīṇāṃ vallabhastrīṇāṃ sambhrameṇa kṛtvā
yāni kaṭhinakucahṛdayāliṅgitānyāśliṣitāni yāni tāni
priyasahacarīsaṃ bhramāliṅgitāni || 23 || -21a-

utpaśyāmi drutamapi sakhe matpriyārthaṃ yiyāsoḥ 

kālakṣepaṃ kakubhasurabhau parvate parvate te |

śuklāpāṅgaiḥ sanayanajalaiḥ svāgatīkṛtya kekāḥ 

pratyudyātaḥ kathamapi bhavāngantumāśu vyavasyet|| 22 || 23 Ma;
24 Su

sajalanayanais Da,Ma,Su; pratyudyāte Su;

VALL

asmaddhitārthaṃ tvaritamapi jigamiṣostava kakubhakusumasugandhau
sarvasminnadrau tavāhaṃ kālahāramutpaśyāmyutprekṣe |

kuta ityāha | yasmātpriyamitraiḥ śuklāpāṅgairmayūraiḥ 
sanayanajalairnetrodakayuktaiḥ kekāḥ svāgatīkṛtya vāgbhiḥ 
svāgataṃ kṛtvā pratyudgata ityuktipratyuktivaśātkālakṣepaḥ 
|

ataścārthaye tvām |

asmadarthaṃ kathamapi bhavāngantuṃ vyavasyedvyāyāmaṃ kuryāt|

ahamārtastvaṃ connata iti bhāvaḥ|

sanayanajalatvamatra cireṇa mitrālokanāt || 22 ||

\daksināvarta

upaśyamīti ||

utpaśyāmyutprekṣe cintayāmītyarthaḥ|

kakubhasurabhāvanena pratyudgamane puṣpasampattirnisargasiddheti
uktam | śuklāpāṅgairmayūraiḥ| mayūro barhiṇo barhī
śuklāpāṅgaḥ śikhāvala iti yādavaḥ|

sajalanayanairmeghasandarśanānandena sāśrujalanayanaiḥ| anena
śuklapātragataṃ pādyajalaṃ sūcitam |

svāgatīkṛtya kekā ityanena kuśalapraśno vivakṣitaḥ|
pratyudyātaḥ pratyudgataḥ| ātithyakriyayā pratyudgamanamatra
vivakṣitam || 22 ||

\mallinātha

utpaśyāmīti ||

he sakhe megha matpriyārthaṃ yathā tathā drutam kṣipram | laghu
kṣiprataraṃ drutamityamaraḥ| yiyāsoryātumicchorapi |
yāteḥ sannantādupratyayaḥ| te tava kakubhaiḥ kuṭakusumaiḥ 
surabhau sugandhini | kakubhaḥ kuṭe 'rjuna iti śabdārṇave | parvate
parvate pratiparvatam | vīpsāyāṃ dviruktiḥ| kālakṣepaṃ 
kālavilambam | kṣepo vilambe nindāyāmiti viśvaḥ| utpaśyāmi
utprekṣe|

vilambahetuṃ darśayannāśugamanaṃ prārthayata śukleti |

sajalāni sānandabāṣpāṇi nayanāni yeṣāṃ taiḥ śuklapāṅgaiḥ 
mayūraiḥ| mayūro barhiṇo barhī śuklāpāṅgaḥ śikhāvalaḥ 
iti yādavaḥ| kekāḥ svavāṇīḥ| kakā vāṇī mayūrasyeti
amaraḥ|

svāgatīkṛtya svāgatavacanīkṛtya pratyudyātaḥ pratyudgataḥ 
mayūravāṇīkṛtātithya ityarthaḥ| bhavānkathamapi
yathākathañcidāśu gantuṃ vyavasyedudyuñjīta | prārthane liṅ |

śeṣe prathama iti prathamapuruṣaḥ| śeṣaścāyaṃ 
bhavacchabdo yuṣmadasmacchabdavyatirekāt|

svāgatīkṛtya kekā ityatra kekāsvāropyamāṇasya
svāgatavacanasya prakṛtapratyudgamanopayogātpariṇāmālaṅkāraḥ|
taduktamalaṅkārasarvasva āropyamāṇasya prakṛtopayogitve
pariṇāma iti || 23 ||

-22-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he sakhe bho mitra bho megha parvate parvate girau girau te tava
kālakṣepaṃ kālavilambamutpaśyāmi sambhāvayāmi |

kathambhūtasya te | drutamapi śīghramapi yiyāsorgantukāmasya
gantuṃ vāñchakasya vā |

kimartham | matpriyārthaṃ matpatnyai matsandeśanivedanārtham |

ataḥ kāraṇāddhe megha bhavānkathamapi kenāpi prakāreṇāśu
śīghraṃ gantuṃ vyavasyet |

ko 'rthaḥ| yathākāryaṃ yathā tatra gatvā bhūyo 'tra
āgamanaṃ bhūyāttathetyarthaḥ|

kathambhūte parvate | kakubhasurabhāvarjunavṛkṣotpannakusumaiḥ 
śubhavāsite |

punaḥ kathambhūte parvate | pratyudyāte sanmukhamutthite |

kiṃ kṛtvā | śuklāpāṅgairmayūraiḥ kekā vāṇyaḥ 
svāgatīkṛtya sādarīkṛtya |

kathambhūtaiḥ śuklāpāṅgaiḥ| sajalanayanaiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

kekā ityatra tṛtīyārthe prathamā |

matpriya iti mama priyāyā bhāryāyā eva arthaḥ prajonanam
matpriyārtham |

yiyeti yātum icchuryiyāsustasya yiyāsoḥ|

kakubheti kakubho 'rjunanāmā vṛkṣastaiḥ surabhiḥ 
saugandhādhikastasminkakubhasurabhau |

sajaleti sajalāni sajalībhūtāni nayanāni netrāṇi yeṣām te
taiḥ sajalanayanaiḥ|| 24 || -22-

pāṇḍucchāyopavanavṛtayaḥ ketakaiḥ sūcibhinnaiḥ 

nīḍārambhairgṛhabalibhujāmākulagrāmacaityāḥ|

tvayyāsanne phalapariṇatiśyāmajambūvanāntāḥ 

sampatsyante katipayadinasthāyihaṃsā daśarṇāḥ||23|| 24 Ma; 25
Su;

pariṇataphala° Da?,Ma,Su;

VALL

tvayi nikaṭe sati daśārṇākhyā janapadā evaṃvidhāḥ 
sampatsyante bhaviṣyanti |

kīdṛśāḥ| ketakaiḥ puṣpaiḥ pāṇḍucchāyāḥ śuklaśobhāḥ 
upavanavṛtaya udyānakaṇṭhyo yeṣām | sitatvātketakānām|

sūcyā garbhakaṇṭakena bhinnairvidāritaiḥ| teṣāṃ hi
antaḥsthā sūcirbhittvā viniryāti |

tathā gṛhabalibhujāṃ kākānāṃ nīḍārambhairālayakramaiḥ 
ākulāni vyāptāni grāmacaityāni yeṣu| varṣabhayāddhi pakṣiṇaḥ 
prāvṛṣi nānyatra niryānti | caityaṃ buddhālayaḥ| yadi vā
mahābhogaprajñātatamo vanaspatiścaityaḥ|

tathā phalānāṃ pariṇatyā pākena śyāmā jambūvanāntā yatra|

kapitthānīva hi jambūphalāni pākena śyāmāyante|

katipayadinasthāyinaśca hamṣā yeṣu | meghāloke mānasagamanāt ||
23 ||

\daksināvarta

pāṇḍviti ||

pāṇḍucchāyopavanavṛtayaḥ pāṇḍucchāyā hariṇavarṇacchāyāḥ 
upavanavṛtayaḥ samīpavṛtayo yeṣām |

ketakaiḥ ketakīpuṣpaiḥ| sūcibhinnaiḥ sūcyākāreṣu mukulāgreṣu
bhinnairvikasitaiḥ|

nīḍārambhaiḥ kulāyopakramaiḥ|

gṛhabalibhujāṃ gṛheṣu balihāriṇāmannabhojināṃ kākādīnāṃ 
ityarthaḥ|

ākulagrāmacaityaḥ| caityaṃ nāma catuṣpathoddeśasthito vṛkṣaḥ 
| caityaṃ citāṅke buddhāṇḍa uddeśadrau suralāya iti yādavaḥ|
daśārṇā vindhyottarasthāḥ kecana janapadāḥ| daśārṇāḥ syuḥ 
vedikālā mālavāḥ syuravantaya iti yādavaḥ|

nanu poṭāyuvatītyādi {p2.1.65} sūtreṇa samāse katipayaśabdasya
uttarapadatvavidhānāddinakatipayasthāyīti vaktavyam | prāyikaṃ 
caitat | katipayapurasvāmye puṃsāṃ ka eṣa madajvara iti
bhartṛharivacanāt {bhartṛhari subhāṣita 3.57} || 23 ||

\mallinātha

pāṇḍviti ||

he megha tvayyāsanne sannikṛṣṭe sati daśārṇā nāma janapadāḥ 
sūcibhinnaiḥ sūciṣu mukulāgreṣu bhinnairvikasitaiḥ|
ketakīmukulāgreṣu sūciḥ syāditi śabdārṇave | ketakaiḥ 
ketakīkusumaiḥ pāṇḍucchāyā haritavarṇā upavanānāṃ 
vṛtayaḥ kaṇṭakaśākhāvaraṇā yeṣu te tathoktāḥ| prākāre
varaṇaḥ sālaḥ prācīraṃ prāntato vṛtirityamaraḥ| tathā
gṛhabalibhujāṃ kākādigrāmapakṣiṇāṃ nīḍārambhaiḥ 
kulāyanirmāṇaiḥ| kulāyo nīḍamastriyāmityamaraḥ|
cityāyā imāni caityāni rathyāvṛkṣāḥ| caityamāyatane
buddhavandye coddeśapādapa iti viśvaḥ| ākulāni saṅkīrṇāni
grāmeṣu caityāni yeṣu te tathoktāḥ| tathā pariṇataiḥ pakvaiḥ 
phalaiḥ śyāmāni yāni jambūvanāni tairantā ramyāḥ| mṛtau
avasite ramye samāptāvanta iṣyata iti śabdārṇave | tathā
katipayeṣu dineṣu sthāyino haṃsā yeṣu te tathoktāḥ 
evaṃvidhāḥ sampatsyante bhaviṣyanti |

poṭāyuvatistokakatipayetyādinā {p2.1.65} katipayaśabdasya
uttarapadatve 'pi na tacchabdasyottaratvamastyasya
śāstraprāyikatvāt || 24 || -23-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha daśārṇā daśārṇanāmāno deśaviśeṣā īdṛśāḥ 
sampatsyante bhaviṣyanti |

kva sati | tvayimegha āsanne nik'tavartini sati |

kathambhūto deśāḥ| ketakaiḥ ketakapuṣpaiḥ sārddhaṃ pāṇḍucchāyopavanavṛtayo dhavalaprabhā upavanavāṭikāḥ|

kathambhūtaiḥ ketakaiḥ| sūcibhinnairardhavikasitaiḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūtā daśārṇāḥ| gṛhavalibhujāṃ nīḍārambhaiḥ 
vakādīnāṃ svakīyāṅgaguptakaranaiḥ śalakaraṇairvā
ākulagrāmacaityā vyākulīkṛtagrāmavṛkṣāḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūtā daśārṇāḥ|
pariṇataphalaśyāmajambūvanāntāḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūtā daśārṇāḥ| katipayadinasthāyihaṃsāḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

pāṇḍviti dhavalaprabhā upavanavṛtīnām yatra te
pāṇḍucchāyopavanavṛtayaḥ|

gṛheti gṛhaṃ kalatraṃ tadānītāṃ valiṃ bhuñjanta iti
gṛhavalibhujo vakā ucyante | athavā caṭakāḥ|

ākuletyākulā vyākulībhūtā grāmacaityāḥ 
grāmasambandhino vṛkṣā yatra ta ākulagrāmacaityāḥ|

parīti pariṇatāni paripakvāni phalāni pariṇataphalāni taiḥ 
śyāmāni śyāmīsañjātāni jambūvanāni jambūvṛkṣavanānāṃ 
agrabhāgā yeṣu te pariṇataphalaśyāmajambūvanāntā vā
antaśabdaḥ svarūpavācakāḥ| varṣartau hi jambūvanānyatyantaṃ śyāmāni dṛśyante |

katīti katipayadināni stokamātradināni jalamālinyātsthāyinaḥ 
haṃsās katipayadinasthāyihaṃsāḥ| varṣartau hi jalamālinyaṃ 
bhavati | haṃsā hi nirmalodakaṃ pibantītibhāvaḥ|

atrānumānālaṅkāraḥ|| 25 || -23-

teṣāṃ dikṣu prathitavidiśālakṣaṇāṃ rājadhānīṃ 

gatvā sadyaḥ phalamavikalaṃ kāmukatvasya labdhā |

tīropāntastanitasubhagaṃ pāsyasi svādu yattat

sabhrūbhaṅgaṃ mukhamiva payo vetravatyāścalormi || 24 || 25 Ma;
26 Su

yasmāt Ma; subhrū° Su;

VALL

teṣāṃ daśārṇānāṃ vidiśākhyāṃ rājadhānīṃ gatvā
tatkṣaṇamavikalaṃ paripūrṇaṃ kāmukatvasya phalaṃ tvaṃ labdhā
prāpsyasi|

kuta ityāha | yadyasmādvetravatyāḥ saritastadevaṃvidhaṃ 
payaḥ pāsyasi |

kīdṛśam | tīropānte stanitena pakṣikūjitena skhalitena vā
subhagaṃ sundaraṃ svādu rucyaṃ calormi skhalitavīci | ata eva
sabhrūbhedena mukhena tulyam | ata eva kāmitvaphalalābhaḥ| kāmī
hi kāminyāḥ kuṭilabhru vaktraṃ svādu dhayati |

ūrmīṇāṃ bhruva upamānam | ?

yaditi hetupadam|

taditi payonirdeśaḥ|

vidiśāśabdaḥ pṛṣodarādiḥ|

lakṣaṇaṃ nāma |

(labdheti tṛnnantaḥ ) || 24 || !!!

\daksināvarta

teṣāmiti ||

teṣāṃ daśārṇānāṃ dikṣu prathitavidiśālakṣaṇāṃ 
prasiddhavidiśānāmadheyām | lakṣaṇaṃ kārṣike cihne nāmni
mudrāṅgasampadoriti yādavaḥ| babhūva vidiśā nāma purī
vetravatītaṭa iti kathāsāre | vidiśeti kāpi nadyapyasti
|

parabhṛtakalavyāhāreṣu tvamāttaratirmadhum

