| sabhrūbhaṅgaṃ bhrūbhaṅgasahitam |

vetravatyāścalormīti pāṭhaḥ| calormi calataraṅgam | idaṃ 
viśeṣaṇaṃ sabhrūbhaṅgaviśeṣaṇasthānīyam | kāminyāḥ 
sasītkāraṃ sabhrūbhaṅgaṃ mukhamiva vetravatyāḥ 
