uttaraślokaparijñānāyātredamanusandheyaṃ 
vidiśānagaravartinyaḥ paṇyāṅganāḥ sarvāṅgasundaryaḥ 
sarvalalitakalāvicakṣaṇāḥ sarvapuruṣāvarjanakuśalāśca bhavanti
| tatratyāḥ punarnāgarāḥ puruṣāstābhyo 'pyatisundarāḥ 
subhagayauvanāḥ strīsambhogavidagdhāśca bhavanti | teṣām
nāgarāṇāṃ saundaryātiśayena tānkāmayamānāḥ paṇyāṅganāḥ 
mātrādibhayena svagṛheṣu bhoktumapārayantyastasmānnagarāt
