gulikān Su;

\mallinātha

harāniti ||

yasyāṃ viśālāyāṃ koṭiśo vipaṇiṣu paṇyavīthikāsu |
vipaṇiḥ paṇyavīthiketyamaraḥ| racitānprasāritān | idaṃ 
viśeṣaṇaṃ yathāliṅgaṃ sarvatra sambadhyate |

tārāñchuddhān | tāro muktādisaṃśuddhau taraṇe śuddhamauktika 
iti viśvaḥ|

taralaguṭikānmadhyamaṇībhūtamahāratnān | tarale hāramadhyagaḥ 
ityamaraḥ| piṇḍe maṇau mahāratne guṭikā baddhapārada iti
śabdārṇave | hārānmuktāvalīstathā koṭiśaḥ śaṅkhāṃśca
śuktīśca muktāsphoṭāṃśca | muktāsphoṭaḥ striyāṃ śuktiḥ 
śaṅkhaḥ syātkamburastriyāmityamaraḥ| śaṣpaṃ 
bālatṛṇaṃ tadvacchyāmān| śaṣpaṃ bālatṛṇaṃ ghāsaḥ 
yavasaṃ tṛṇamarjanamityamaraḥ| unmayūkhaprarohān
udgataramyāṅkūrānmarakatamaṇīngāruḍaratnāni| tathā
vidrumāṇāṃ bhaṅgānpravālakhaṇḍāṃśca dṛṣṭvā
salilanidhayaḥ samudrāstoyamātramavaśeṣo yeṣāṃ te
tādṛśāḥ saṃlakṣyante | tathānumīyanta ityarthaḥ|
ratnākarādapyatiricyate ratnasampadbhiriti bhāvaḥ|| 33 || -31a-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha salilanidhayaḥ samudrāstoyamātrāvaśeṣā agre
vakṣyamāṇaratnādivarjitā jalarūpāḥ saṃlākṣyante |

kiṃ kṛtvā | yasyāṃ viśālāyāṃ nagaryāṃ tārānujjvalān
vipaṇiracitānhaṭṭaśreṇyāṃ vistāritānhārāndṛṣṭvā ca
punaḥ koṭiśaḥ koṭisañkhyānvipaṇiracitāñchaṅkhaśuktīḥ 
dṛṣṭvā ca punarvipaṇiracitānmarakatamaṇīndṛṣṭvā ca
punarvipaṇiracitāṃ vidrumāṇāṃ bhaṅgāndṛṣṭvā |

kathambhūtānhārān | taralagulikāṃstaralanāyakamaṇīn |

kathambhūtānmarakatamaṇīn | śaṣpaśyāmānbālatṛṇavat
śyāmān |

punaḥ kathambhūtānmarakatamaṇīn | unmayūkhaprarohān |

ityanvayaḥ||

salileti salilānāṃ jalānāmeva nidhayaḥ salilanidhayaḥ|

toyeti toyamātraṃ jalamātramevāvaśeṣamuddharitaṃ yeṣu te
toyamātrāvaśeṣāḥ|

śaṅkheti śaṅkhāśca śuktayaśca śaṅkhaśuktayastāḥ 
śaṅkhaśuktīḥ|

taraleti hāramadhye sthitaṃ ratnam nāyakaṃ taralaṃ viduriti |
ta eva gulikā yeṣu te tāṃstaralagulikān |
gulikākārataralālaṅkṛtānhārānityarthaḥ|

śaṣpeti | śaṣpaṃ bālatṛṇaṃ ghāsastadvacchyāmāstān
śaṣpaśyāmān |

marakateti marakatāni ca maṇayaśca marakatamaṇayastān
marakatamaṇīn |

unmayūkheti unmayūkhānyeva prarohāṇyaṅkurāṇi yeṣu te tān
unmayūkhaprarohān |

etena meghasyāgre mārgapurasya varṇanamasūci || 33 || -31a-

pradyotasya priyaduhitaraṃ vatsarājo 'tra jahre

haimaṃ tāladrumavanamabhūdatra tasyaiva rājñaḥ|

atrodbhrāntaḥ kila nalagiriḥ stambhamutpāṭya darpāt

ityāgantūnramayati jano yatra bandhūnabhijñaḥ|| 31b || 34
Ma,Su;

\mallinātha

pratyotasyeti ||

atra pradeśe vatsarājo vatsadeśādhīśvara udayanaḥ pradyotasya
nāmojjayinīnāyakasya rājñaḥ priyaduhitaraṃ vāsavadattāṃ 
jahra jahāra | atra sthale tasyaiva rājñas pradyotasya haimaṃ 
sauvarṇaṃ tāladrumavanamabhūt |

atra nalagirirnāmendradattastadīyo gajo darpātstambhaṃ 
ālānamutpāṭya uddhṛtya bhramaṇaṃ kṛtavāniti
itthambhūtābhiḥ kathābhirityarthaḥ| abhijñaḥ 
pūrvoktakathābhijñaḥ kovido jana āgantūndeśāntarāt
āgatān | auṇādikastunpratyayaḥ| bandhūnyatra viśālāyāṃ 
ramayati vinodayati |

atra bhāvikālaṅkāraḥ| taduktaṃ 

atītānāgate yatra pratyakṣatvena lakṣate |

atyadbhutārthakathanādbhāvikaṃ tadudāhṛtaṃ || iti || 34 ||
-31b-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he meghābhijñas janaścaturo manuṣyo yatra yasyāmujjayinyāṃ 
puri āgantūnāgantukajanānsvajanānbāndhavānpratīti
ramayati kathayati |

itīti kim | atra ujjayinyāṃ vatsarāja udayananāmā kumāraḥ 
pratyotasya priyaduhitaraṃ caṇḍapradyotanāmno bhūpasya
vallabhaputrīṃ vāsavadattānāmnīṃ jahra upahṛtavān coritavān |

punaratrojjayinyāṃ puri tāladrumavanaṃ tālavṛkṣāṇāṃ vanaṃ 
abhūjjātam |

kathambhūtaṃ vanam | haimaṃ kanakamayam | punastasyaiva
caṇḍapradyotasyaiva rājño bhūpasya |

atra ujjayinyāṃ puri kila niścayena nalagirināmā hastyudbhrāntaḥ 
bhramitaḥ|

kiṃ kṛtvā | darpānmadavaśātstambhaṃ gajālānamutpāṭya
pṛthvīto niṣkāsyonmūlya |

ityanvayaḥ||

kuśalaścaturo 'bhijña iti abhidhānacintāmaṇiḥ|

svabhavoktiralaṅkāraḥ|| 34 || -31b-

