\mallinātha

jālodgirṇairiti ||

jālodgirṇairgavākṣamārganirgataiḥ| jālaṃ gavākṣa ānāya 
jālake kapaṭe gaṇa itiyādavaḥ|

keśasaṃskāradhūpairvanitākeśavāsanārthairgandhadravyadhūpaiḥ 
ityarthaḥ| atra saṃskāradhūpayostādarthye 'pi
yūpadārvādivatprakṛtivikāratvābhāvādaśvaghāsādivat
ṣaṣṭhīsamāso na caturthīsamāsaḥ|

upacitavapuḥ paripuṣṭaśarīro bandhau bandhuriti vā prītyā
bhavanaśikhibhirgṛhamayūrairdatto nṛtyamevopahāraḥ 
upāyanaṃ yasmai sa tathoktaḥ| upāyanamupagrāhyamupahāraḥ 
tathopadetyamaraḥ|

kusumaiḥ surabhiṣu sugandhiṣu | lalitavanitāḥ sundarastriyaḥ|
lalitaṃ triṣu sundaramitiśabdārṇave | tāsāṃ pādarāgeṇa
lākṣārasenāṅkiteṣu cihniteṣu harmyeṣu dhanitabhavaneṣvasyāḥ 
ujjayinyā lakṣmīṃ paśyannadhvagamanena khedaṃ kleśaṃ nayethāḥ 
upanaya || 35 || -32-

bharturiti ||

bhartuḥ svāmino nīlakaṇṭhasya bhagavataḥ kaṇṭhasyeva chaviḥ 
yasyāsau kaṇṭhacchaviriti hetorgaṇaiḥ pramathaiḥ| gaṇastu
gaṇanāyāṃ syādgaṇeśe pramathe caya iti śabdārṇave | sādaraṃ 
yathā tathā vīkṣyamāṇaḥ san | priyavastusādṛśyādatipriyatvaṃ 
bhavediti bhāvaḥ|

