\daksināvarta

paścāditi ||

paścāt | uccairbhujataruvanamityekaṃ padam | bhujavanamiti
vaktavye taruśabdaprayogo meghāvataraṇayogyatvaṃ sūcayati |
pratinavajapāpuṣparaktaṃ pratyagrajapākusumalohitam |
śāntodvegastimitanayanaṃ bhayaṅkarasya gajājinasyādarśanāt
devyāḥ śānta udvegaḥ|| 36 || ?

\mallinātha

paścāditi |

paścātsandhyābalyanantaraṃ paśupateḥ śivasya nṛttārambhe
tāṇḍavaprārambhe pratinavajapāpuṣparaktaṃ 
pratyagrajapākusumāruṇaṃ sandhyāyāṃ bhavaṃ sāndhyaṃ tejaḥ 
dadhānaḥ|

uccairunnataṃ bhujā eva taravasteṣāṃ vanaṃ maṇḍalena
maṇḍalākareṇa abhilīno 'bhivyāptaḥ san | kartari ktaḥ|

bhavānyā bhavapatnyā |
indravaruṇabhavaśarvarudramṛḍahimāraṇyayavanamātulācāryāṇāṃ 
ānugiti ṅībānugāgamaśca |

śānta udvego gajājinadarśanabhayaṃ yayoste ata eva stimite niścale nayane yasminkarmaṇi tattathoktam | udvegastvarite
kleśe bhaye mantharagāminīti śabdārṇave |

bhaktiḥ pūjyeṣvanurāgaḥ| bhāvārthe ktinpratyayaḥ| dṛṣṭā
bhaktiryasya sa dṛṣṭabhaktiḥ san paśupaterādraṃ śoṇitārdraṃ 
yannāgājinaṃ gajacarma | ajinaṃ carma kṛttiḥ strītyamaraḥ|
tatrecchāṃ hara nivartaya | tvameva tatsthāne bhavetyarthaḥ 
| gajāsuramardanānantaraṃ bhagavānmahādevastadīyaṃ 
ārdrājinaṃ bhujamaṇḍalena bibhrattāṇḍavaṃ cakāreti
prasiddhaḥ|

dṛṣṭabhaktiriti kathaṃ rūpasiddhiḥ| dṛṣṭaśabdasya striyāḥ 
pumvadityādinā pumvadbhāvasya durghaṭatvādapūraṇīpriyādiṣu
iti niṣedhāt | bhaktiśabdasya priyādiṣu pāṭhāditi | tadetat
codyam dṛḍhabhaktiriti śabdamāśritya prativihitaṃ 
gaṇavyākhyāne dṛḍhaṃ bhaktirasyeti napuṃsakaṃ pūrvapadam |
adārḍhyaṃ nivṛttiparatve dṛḍhaśabdālliṅgaviśeṣasya
anupakāritvātstrītvamavivakṣitamiti | bhojarājastu bhaktaḥ 
ca karmasādhanāyāmityanena sūtreṇa bhajyate sevyata iti
karmārthatve bhavānībhaktirityādi bhavati | bhāvasādhanāyāṃ 
sthirabhaktirbhavānyāmityādi bhavatītyāha | tadetat
sarvaṃ samyagvivecitaṃ raghuvaṃśasañjīvanyā dṛḍhabhaktiriti
jyeṣṭha ityatra | tasmāddṛṣṭabhaktirityatrāpi
matabhedena pūrvapadasya strītvena napuṃsakatvena ca rūpasiddhiḥ 
astīti sthitam || 39 || -36-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

