mahākālaprāsāde puśupatermahādevasya ārdranāgājinecchāṃ 
rudhirārdragajacarmaṇa icchām vāñchāṃ hara dūrīkuryāḥ|?

kva | nṛtyārambhe nāṭakaprastāve | yato mahādevo hi pārvatyāḥ 
cittamohanārthamagrataḥ kandarpamohitaḥ san rudhirārdragajasya carma
svakīyabhujopari gṛhītvā tasya gajacarmādhaḥ kila svayaṃ nṛtyati
iti bhāvaḥ| tato nṛtyārambha ityuktam |

tvaṃ kiṃ kurvāṇaḥ| sāndhyaṃ sandhyākālīnaṃ tejaḥ 
rudhirārdragajacarmasamānaṃ sandhyārāgaṃ dadhāno bibhrāṇaḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ sāndhyaṃ tejaḥ| vikasitajapāpuṣparaktam |

punaḥ kathambhūtastvam | paścāddṛṣṭigocaraṃ tyaktvā
paścādbhāge pṛṣṭhata uccairbhujataruvanaṃ maṇḍalena
maṇḍalākāreṇābhilīna āśritaḥ| rudrasya bhujopari sthitaḥ 
maṇḍalākāreṇetyarthaḥ|?

punaḥ kathambhūtastvam | śāntodvegastimitanayanaṃ yathā syāt
tathā evaṃvidhaṃ haraṃ bhavānyāḥ pārvatyā dṛṣṭabhaktiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

ārdreti rudhireṇārdraṃ nāgasya gajasya yadajinam carma tasya
icchārdranāgājinecchā tāmārdranāgājinecchām |

vikasiteti vikasitaṃ yajjapāpuṣpaṃ jāsūnakusumaṃ tadvat
raktaṃ vikasitajapāpuṣparaktam |

paścāditi paścātpaścādbhāga uccairbhujā eva taravaḥ 
teṣāṃ vanam paścāduccairbhujataruvanam |

śānteti śānto vyapagata udvegastena stimite niścale nayane
yatra tacchāntodvegastimitanayanamiti | 
atra rudhirārdragajacarmāvalokane 'nudinaṃ nṛtyārambhasamaye tasyāḥ 
pārvatyā udvega āsīt | sa rudrastvayi gajājinasamānatvaṃ 
prāpte sati śāntam •••• tata eva dṛṣṭabhaktiḥ puṃvadveti
sūtreṇa dṛṣṭā bhaktiryasya sa dṛṣṭabhaktiḥ|

atropamālaṅkāraḥ|| 40 || -36-

gacchantīnāṃ ramaṇavasatiṃ yoṣitāṃ tatranaktaṃ 

ruddhāloke narapatipathe sūcibhedyaistamobhiḥ|

saudāminyā kanakanikaṣasnigdhayā darśayorvīṃ 

toyotsargastanitamukharo mā sma bhūrviklavāstāḥ||  37  || 40
Ma; 41 Su;

ca Da, Ma;

VALL

tatrojjayinyāmabhisārikāṇāṃ saudāminyā taḍitā rājamārgaṃ darśaya prakāśaya |

yato naktaṃ rātrau priyatamavasatiṃ vrajantīnām |

ata evātighanatvātsūcyā bhedyaistamobhī ruddhāloke 'vaṣṭabdhaprakāśe pathi |

kīdṛśyā tayā |

kanakanikaṣavatsuvarṇagharṣaṇavatsnigdhayārūkṣayā |

evaṃ ca krṭvā toyotsargārthaṃ stanitena garjitaḍambareṇa mukharaḥ saśabdo mā bhūḥ|

yatastā yoṣidbhāvātkātarāstrasnavaḥ||37||

\daksināvarta

gacchantīnāmiti ||

tatrojjayinyāṃ narapatipathe rājamārge |

sūcibhedyairatibahulatvātsūcyagrabhedenārhairityarthaḥ|

mā ca bhūriti cakāro darśayatikriyayā sevāsamuccayārthaḥ||
37 ||

\mallinātha

itthaṃ mahākālanāthasya sevāprakāramabhidhāya punarapi nagarasañcāraprakāramāha gacchantīnāmiti ||

tatrojjayinyāṃ naktaṃ rātrau ramaṇavasatiṃ priyabhavanaṃ prati
gacchantīnāṃ yoṣitām abhisārikāṇāmityarthaḥ|

sūcibhirbhedyairatisāndrairityarthaḥ| kanakasya nikaṣas
nikaṣyata iti vyutpattyā nikaṣa upalagatarekhā tasyeva snigdhaṃ 
tejo yasyāstayā | snigdhaṃ tu masṛṇe sāndre ramye klībe ca
tejasīti śabdārṇave |

sudāmnādriṇā ekadiksaudāmanī vidyut | tenaikadigiti
aṇpratyayaḥ| {p4.3.112}

tathorvīṃ mārgaṃ darśaya | kiṃ ca toyotsargastanitābhyām
vṛṣṭigarjitābhyāṃ mukharaḥ śabdāyamāno mā ca bhūḥ|

kutaḥ| tā yoṣito viklavā bhīravaḥ| tato vṛṣṭigarjite na
kārye ityarthaḥ|

nātra toyotsargasahitam stanitamiti vigrahaḥ| viśiṣṭasyeva
kevalastanitasyāpi aniṣṭatvāt | na ca dvandvapakṣa 
alpāctarapūrvanipātaśāstravirodhaḥ| lakṣaṇahetvoḥ kriyāyāḥ 
iti sūtra eva viparītanirdeśena pūrvanipātaśāstrasya
anityatvajñāpanāditi || 40 || -37-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha tatrojjayinyāṃ nagaryāṃ yoṣitāṃ strīṇāṃ naktaṃ 
rātrau saudāminyā vidyutā kṛtvorvīṃ bhūmiṃ darśaya
avalokayeḥ|

kva sati | narapatipathe rājamārge tamobhirandhakārai ruddhāloke sati ruddhamārgāvalokane sati |

kathambhūtānāṃ yoṣitām | ramaṇavasatiṃ bhartuḥ sambhogasthānaṃ 
gacchantīnām |

bho megha yathorvīṃ tathā toyotsargastanitamukharo jalābhāve
atyantaṃ garjitaśabditastvam mā sma bhūḥ|

katham | yatastā ramaṇavasatiṃ prati vrajantyo ramaṇyo viklavā bhayavihvalā bhaviṣyantīti bhāvaḥ|

kathambhūtaistamobhiḥ| sūcibhedyairatyantaniviḍatvāt
sūcyagrabhāgeṇāpi bheditumaśakyairvā |

kathambhūtayā saudāminyā | kanakanikaṣasnigdhayā suvarṇarekhayā
samānayā |

ityanvayaḥ||

toyeti toyasya jalasyotsargo varṣaṇaṃ vā nāśaḥ 
toyotsargājjalariktībhāvādataḥ stanitena garjitena mukharaḥ 
vadanaśīlo yaḥ sa toyotsargastanitamukharas | vṛṣṭigarjitābhyāṃ 
strīṇāṃ gamanavyāghāto na kāryaḥ| 
prāyeṇa strījātayo bhayavihvalā bhavantīti bhāvaḥ|

kanaketi nikaṣaśabdena kaṣopalaḥ śyāmaprastaraḥ| kanakasya
suvarṇasya nikaṣe rekhāsnigdhā kanakavikaṣasnigdhā tayā
kanakanikaṣasnigdhayā | nikaṣadṛṣadi gharṣitakanakasya yādṛśī
pītavarṇā rekhā syāttādṛśī nikaṣavacchyāmatvānmeghe 'pi
vidyuditi bhāvaḥ|

atra kṣepātiśayaḥ saṅkaraḥ|| 41 || -37- ?first iti bhāvas?nāśas?

tāṃ kasyāñcidbhavanavalabhau suptapārāvatāyāṃ 

nītvā rātriṃ ciravilasanātkhinnavidyutkalatraḥ|

dṛṣṭe sūrye punarapi bhavānvāhayedadhvaśeṣaṃ 

mandāyante na khalu suhṛdāmabhyupetārthakṛtyāḥ||  38  || 41 Ma;
42 Su;

VALL

tāṃ pūrvoktāṃ rātriṃ kasyāmapi bhavanavalabhau gṛhoparipure nītvātivāhyatataḥ sūryodaye bhūyo 'pibhavānmārgamavaśiṣṭaṃ vāhayedullaṅghayet |

yasmānmitrāṇāṃ yairarthakṛtyaṃ prayojanamabhyupetaṃ 
ūrīkṛtaṃ śirasāṅgīkṛtaṃ te na khalu mandāyante naiva
alasā bhavanti |

kīdṛśyāṃ valabhau | suptāḥ pārāvatāḥ kapotaviśeṣā yatra |
te hi kaṇṭharutaśravaṇārthaṃ nāgarakairgṛhe dhāryante|

tvaṃ kīdṛśas |

ciraṃ vilasanātkhinnaṃ śrāntaṃ vidyudeva kalatraṃ bhāryā
yasya saḥ|

ata eva valabhau viśramaṇam|

amando mando bhavati mandāyate | bhṛśāditvātkyaṅ |

arthaścāsau kṛtyamarthakṛtvam | arthaḥ prayojanam |
avaśyakāryatvāccāsya kṛtyatvam || 38 ||

\daksināvarta

tāmiti ||

kasyāñcitsuptapāravatāyām | anena viśeṣaṇena paurajanastāvat
varṣāsamayatvādvalabhiṃ vihāya garbhagṛhe śete tatra parāvatāḥ 
eva bhavanti teṣvapi supteṣu niḥśabdā bhavantītyuktam |

ciravilasanādvilasanaśabdena sphuraṇaṃ vilāsaśca vivakṣitaḥ|

vāhayetprāpayedityarthaḥ| vahantaṃ yāntamadhvānaṃ 
vāhayatīti vāhayedrūpam | adhvani ca yātītiprayogo 'sti |
eṣa panthā vidarbhāṇāmeṣa yāsyati kosalāniti darśanāt |
{mahābh.3.58.22}

abhyupetārthāḥ kṛtyāḥ kāryakriyā yaiste ??| kṛtyā
kriyādevatayoḥ kāryeklī kupati triṣviti yādavaḥ|| 38 ||

\mallinātha

tāmiti ||

ciraṃ vilasanātsphuraṇātkhinnaṃ vidyudeva kalatraṃ yasya sa
bhavānsuptāḥ pārāvatāḥ kalaravā yasyāṃ tasyāṃ 
viviktāyāmityarthaḥ| parāvataḥ kalaravaḥ kapota ityamaraḥ 
| janasañcārastatrāsambhavita eveti bhāvaḥ|

kasyāñcidbhavanavalabhau gṛhācchādanoparibhāga ityarthaḥ|
ācchādanaṃ syādvalabhī gṛhāṇāmiti halāyudhaḥ|

tāṃ rātriṃ nītvā sūrye dṛṣṭe satyudite satītyarthaḥ|
punarapyadhvaśeṣaṃ vāhayet |

tathā hi suhṛdāṃ mitrāṇāmabhyupetāṅgīkṛtārthasya
prayojanasya kṛtyā kriyā yaistaiḥ| abhyupetasuhṛdartha iti
arthaḥ| sāpekṣatve 'pi gamakatvātsamāsaḥ| kṛtyā
kriyādevatayoḥ kārye strī kupite triṣviti yādavaḥ| kṛñaḥ śa
ceti cakārātkyap {p3.3.100} |

na mandāyante khalu na mandā bhavanti hi | na vilambanta ityarthaḥ 
| lohitādiḍājbhyaḥ kyaṛiti kya.ḥ {p3.1.13}| vā kyaṣa iti
ātmanepadam {p1.3.90} || 41 || -38- zu viele ityarthas?

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha bhavānpunarapi bhūyo 'pyadhvaśeṣamuddharitamārgaṃ 
vāhayellaṅghayet |

kva sati | sūrye dṛṣṭe sati dṛṣṭau sūrya āgate sati sūryodaya 
ityarthaḥ|

kiṃ kṛtvā | tāṃ rātriṃ kasyāñcidbhavanavallabhau gṛhopari
kuḍyāṃ nītvā gamayitvā |

kathambhūto bhavān | khinnavidyutkalatraḥ 
śrāntībhūtavidyudrūpabhāryakaḥ|

kasmāt | ciravilasanātkṛtabahuvarṣaṇabhogāt |

kathambhūtāyām bhavanavallabhau | suptapārāvatāyām |
bhūyomārgalaṅghanakṛtyamāha | khalu niścayena bho megha suhṛdām
mitrāṇāṃ sauhārdena mitratveneti śeṣo ya 
abhyupetārthakṛtyāḥ satpuruṣāḥ 
aṅgīkṛtaparakāryakaraṇadṛḍhapratijñāste na mandāyante na
ālasyaṃ kurvanti |

ityanvayaḥ||

mayā manmitrasya kṛtyaṃ karaṇīyamityaṅgīkṛtaṃ bhavati | sa na
khalu mandāyate nālasyaṃ karotīti bhāvaḥ|

bhavaneti bhavanasya valabhī gṛhopari kuṭṭirvaraṇḍīti vā
tasyāṃ bhavanavalabhau |

supteti suptāḥ pārāvatā yasyāṃ sā tasyāṃ 
supapārāvatāyām |

abhyupeteti | abhyupetamaṅgīkṛtamarthasya prayojanasya kṛtyaṃ 
yaiste 'bhyupetārthakṛtyāḥ| etena labdhakāmopabhogatvam jaladasya
sūcitam || 42 || -38-

?sauhārdena mitratvena?vallabhī?

tasmin kāle nayanasalilaṃ yoṣitāṃ khaṇḍitānāṃ 

śāntiṃ neyaṃ praṇayibhirato vartma bhānostyajāśu  |

prāleyāsraṃ kamalavadanātso 'pi hartuṃ nalinyāḥ 

pratyāvṛttastvayi kararudhi syādanalpābhyasūyaḥ||  39  || Ma
42; 43 Su;

prāleyāśru Su; °nayanāt Su;

VALL

ataḥ kārāṇādbhānoḥ sūryasya vartma mārgaṃ tyaja | 
mācchadako bhūrityarthaḥ|

yasmāttasminkāle prabhātākhye khaṇḍitānāṃ vipralambhānāṃ 
aṅgānānāṃ priyairāgatyāsru netrajalaṃ śamanīyam |

yadi tvam asya paṭanibho bhavasi tadālokanapāṭavābhāvāt
niśāśaṅkayā nāgamanaṃ syāditi vartma bhānostyaja |

kiṃ ca so 'pi bhānuḥ khaṇḍitāyāḥ kamalinyāḥ priyāyāḥ 
kamalādeva vadanātprāleyamavaśyāyamevāsru hartuṃ 
śamayituṃ pratyāvṛttaḥ pratyāgataḥ| tenāpi padminyāḥ 
prārthanā kāryetyarthaḥ|

atastvayi kararudhi raśmirodhake 'nalpābhyasūyo bhavet| tvayi
mahāntaṃ roṣaṃ bhāvayet | yasya hi priyām prārthayamānasya yaḥ 
karamavaṣṭabhnīyāttasya tatra manyurbhavati |

nidrākaṣāyamukulīkṛtetyādi || 39 || (Su) ?āśu?

\daksināvarta

tasminniti ||

khaṇḍitānāṃ bharturanyāsaṅgadarśanādīrṣyāluḥ khaṇḍitā
| jñāte 'nyasaṅgavikṛte khaṇḍiterṣyākaṣāyiteti
daśarūpake {2.25} | (Ma)

śāntimuparatiṃ neyaṃ prāpayitavyam |

vartmodayavartma | tvayā prācīmukhe niruddhe praṇayinaḥ 
rātriśaṅkayā prabhāte 'pi khaṇḍitānāṃ prasādaṃ na kuryuḥ|
ato bhānorudayavartma tyajetyabhiprāyaḥ| so 'pi bhānuḥ 
api nalinyāḥ khaṇḍitāyā ityeva | tasyāḥ khaṇḍitātvaṃ 
bhānordeśāntaragamanāt | pratyāvṛttaḥ prati nivṛttaḥ|

kararudhyanena hastarodhaśca pratīyate || 39 ||

\mallinātha

tasminniti ||

tasminkāle pūrvokte sūryodayakāle praṇayibhiḥ priyatamaiḥ 
khaṇḍitānāṃ yoṣitāṃ nāyikāviśeṣāṇām | jñāta 
anyāsaṅgavikṛte khaṇḍiterśyākaṣāyiteti daśarūpake
{2.25} | nayanasalilaṃ śāntiṃ neyaṃ netavyam | nayatirdvikarmakaḥ 
| (Da)

ato hetorbhānorvartmāśu śīghraṃ tyaja tasyāvarako mā
bhūrityarthaḥ| vipakṣe 'niṣṭamācaṣṭa so 'pi bhānuḥ|

nalinānyambūjāni yasyās santīti nalinī padminī | tṛṇe 'mbuje
nalaṃ nā tu rājñi nāle tu na striyāmiti śabdarṇave | tasyāḥ 
svakāntāyāḥ kamalaṃ svakusumameva vadanaṃ tasmātprāleyaṃ 
himamevāsramaśru hartum śamayituṃ pratyāvṛttaḥ pratyāgataḥ 
| nalinyāśca barturbhānordeśāntare nalinyantaragamanāt
khaṇḍitātvamityāśayaḥ|

tatastvayi | karānaṃśūnruṇaddhīti kararut | kvip | tasmin
kararudhi sati | hastarodhini satīti ca gamyate | valihastāṃśavaḥ 
karā ityamaraḥ| analpābhyasūyo 'dhikavidveṣaḥ syāt |
prāyeṇecchāviśeṣavighātāddveṣo roṣaviśeṣaśca
kāmināṃ bhavantīti bhāvaḥ| kiṃ ca

ātmānaṃ cārkamīśānaṃ viṣṇuṃ vā dveṣṭi yo janaḥ|

śreyāṃsi tasya naśyanti raukhaṃ ca bhaveddhruvam || -raukha?-

iti niṣedhātkāryahānirbhaviṣyatīti dhvaniḥ|| 42 || -39- ??

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha tasminkāle sūryodaye praṇayibhirbhartṛbhī rātrau
anyatra suptvā sūryodaya āgatairevaṃvidhairbhartṛbhis
khaṇḍitānāṃ yoṣitāṃ strīṇāṃ nayanasalilaṃ netrarodanaṃ 
śāntiṃ neyaṃ vastreṇa kareṇa vā netrāmbu pramṛṣṭavyam |

ato vakṣyamāṇahetoryasminkāle sūryodaye bho megha tvam āśu
śīghraṃ bhānoḥ sūryasya vartma mārgaṃ tyaja raverupariṣṭhāt
chādanatvenābhramiṣeṇa mā bhava | no cettvayi meghe kararudhi
sūryasya kiraṇarūpakarāvarodhakāriṇi sati sūryastvayi
meghaviṣaye 'nalpābhyasūyo bahutara īrṣyāluḥ syāt |

so 'pi khaṇḍitāpativatsūryo 'pi nalinyāḥ khaṇḍitāyāḥ 
kamalanayanātkamalarūpanetrātkhaṇḍitānetrāmbuvatprāleyāśru
praleyarūpaṃ rodanaṃ hartuṃ dūrīkartuṃ pratyāvṛttaḥ 
paścādvalitaḥ sūryodaye khaṇḍitāpativadāgataḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

nayaneti nayanasya salilaṃ nayanasalilaṃ netrarodanamityarthaḥ|

prāleyeti prāleyamavaśyāyajalaṃ tadevāśru prāleyāśru |

kamaleti kamalameva nayanaṃ netraṃ kamalanayanaṃ tasmāt
kamalanayanāt |

analpeti nālpānalpā bahutaretyartho 'nalpā abhyasūyā
yasya so 'nalpābhyasūyaḥ|

khaṇḍitānāṃ lakṣaṇamidam

nidrākaṣāyamukulīkṛtatāmranetro nārīnakhavraṇaviśeṣavicitrāṅgaḥ|

yasyāḥ kuto 'pi gṛhameti patiḥ prabhāte sā khaṇḍiteti
kathitā || (Va) kavibhiḥ purāṇaiḥ||

khaṇḍitāpateḥ sūryopamānam | nalinyāḥ khaṇḍitāyā upamānam |
kamalasya nayanopamānam | aśruṇo 'vaśyāyasyopamānam | etena
sūryena saha mitratvaṃ kāryamiti sūcitam | utprekṣālaṅkāraḥ||
