gambhīrāyāḥ payasi saritaścetasīva prasanne

chāyātmāpi prakṛtisubhago lapsyate te praveśam |

tasmādasyāḥ kumudaviśadānyarhasi tvaṃ na dhairyāt

moghīkartuṃ caṭulaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni || 40 || 43 Ma; 44 Su;

VALL

gambhīrākhyāyāḥ saritaḥ payasi prasanne tava svabhāvasundaraḥ 
chāyārūpo 'pyātmā pratibimbarūpaścetasīva praveśaṃ 
lapsyate |

tasmātkāraṇādasyā nadyāḥ kais?[kumudavat] avasitāni
capalaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni kampamānamīnasphuritāvalokitāni
dhairyādgāmbhīryānmoghīkartuṃ vandhyayituṃ nārhasi |

tato mā gama ityarthaḥ| gamanāddhi tāni niṣphalāni syuḥ|
yaśca nāgaraḥ sa preyasyāṃ rāgeṇa vīkṣamāṇāyāṃ vilambate|

sa hi tasyāścetasi praviṣṭaḥ|| 40 || ?kumudaviśadāni?

\daksināvarta

gambhīrāyā iti ||

gambhīrāśabdenodāttanāyikā ca pratīyate |

chāyātmā pratibimbātmā | 
chāyā tvanātape kāntau pratibimbarkajāyayoriti yādavaḥ| 
anena viśeṣeṇa paramātmāpratibimbaṃ ca dhvanyate |

prakṛtisubhagaḥ prakṛtyā subhagaḥ sāṅkhyākhyasya tattvasya
saṃyogena subhaga ityartho 'pi grāhyaḥ| cetasi prakṛtisubhagas
paramātmabimbaḥ pratiphalatītyartho 'pi dhvanyata iti
avagantavyam | tvaṃ svarūpeṇa tāṃ gambhīrāṃ praveṣṭuṃ yadi
apinecchasi tathāpi tavacchāyātmā pravekṣyatyavaśyam |
tasmāt tvaṃ dhairyaṃ kṛtvā caṭulaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni
avamānayituṃ nārhasyeva | tato matkāryavilambo bhaviṣyati
iti bhāvaḥ|| 40 ||

\mallinātha

gambhīrāyā iti ||

gambhīrā nāma sarit | udāttanāyikā ca dhvanyate | tasyāḥ prasanna 
anuraktātvāddoṣarahite cetasīva prasanne 'tinirmale payasi |
prakṛtyāsvabhāvenaiva subhagaḥ sundaraḥ| sundare 'dhikabhāgye
ca durdinetaravāsare | turīyāṃśe śrīmati ca subhaga iti
śabdārṇave |

te tava chāyā cāsāvātmā ca | so 'pi pratibimbaśarīraṃ vā
praveśaṃ lapsyate | apiśabdātpraveśamanicchorapīti bhāvaḥ 
|

tasmācchāyādvārāpi praveśāvaśyambhāvitvādasyāḥ 
gambhīrāsyāḥ kumudavadviśadāni dhavalāni catulāni śīghrāṇi
śapharāṇāṃ mīnānāmudvartanānyulluṇṭhanānyeva
prekṣitānyavalokanāni | triṣu syāccatulaṃ śīghramiti
viśvaḥ|

etāvadeva gambhīrāyā anurāgaliṅgam |
dhairyāddhārṣṭyādvaiyātyāditi yāvat | moghīkartuṃ niṣphalīkartuṃ nārhasi |
nānuraktā vipralabdhavyetyarthaḥ| dhūrtalakṣaṇaṃ tu

kliśnāti nityaṃ gamitāṃ kāminīmitisundaraḥ|

upaityaraktāṃ yatnena raktāṃ dhūrto vimuñcati || iti || 43 ||
-40-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha apīti sambhāvanāyām | tvadīyaṃ sākṣādrūpamasyāṃ 
te tava cchāyātmāpi pratibimbacchāyā tadrūpa ātmādehaḥ 
praveśaṃ lapsyate |

kva | gambhīrāyāḥ saritaḥ payasi gambhīrānāmnyā nadyā jale |

kasyāḥ kasminniva | utprekṣyate gambhīrāyāḥ 
gāmbhīryaguṇadhāriṇyaḥ striyāścetasi manasīva | yathā
prakṛtisubhagaḥ svabhāvena janaścaturo bhavati tasya chāyātmā
api citralikhitamapi rūpaṃ gambhīrāyāḥ striyāścitte praviśati
citralikhitarūpopari parokṣe 'pi rāgiṇī bhavati tathā
gambhīrāyāścetasi tava chāyātmāpītibhāvaḥ|

kathambhūte cetasi | prasanne svacche |

bho megha tasmātkāraṇāt asyā gambhīrāyā nadyāḥ 
caṭulaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni cañcalamacchāni* evākṣiṇī
moghīkartuṃ niḥphalīkartuṃ tvaṃ na arhasi na yogyo bhavasi |

kasmāt | dhairyāddhīratvalakṣaṇapuruṣaguṇāt |

kathambhūtāni caṭulaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni | kumudaviśadāni
kumudavaddhavalāni |

ityanvayaḥ||

caṭuleti caṭulaśapharodvartanānyeva prekṣitāninetrāni
caṭulaśapharodvartanaprekṣitāni | mīnānāmudvartanena
dṛśyamānodaradeśasyātyantaṃ śubhratvādata udvartanamuktam
| etena meghasya nadyāmaṅgasaṅgena gamanasāphalyaṃ nirūpitam |
upamārūpakayoḥ saṅkarālaṅkāro 'tra || 44 || -40-

*maccha = prakritism for matsya, with wrong gender;

tasyāḥ kiñcitkaradhṛtamiva prāptavānīraśākhaṃ 

hṛtvā nīlaṃ salilavasanaṃ muktarodhonitambam |

prasthānaṃ te kathamapi sakhe lambamānasya bhāvi

jñātāsvādaḥ pulinajaghanāṃ ko vihātuṃ samarthaḥ|| 41 || 44
Ma; 45 Su;

nitamvam Su; vivṛta Da,Ma; vipula Su;

VALL

tasyā gambhīrāyā nīlaṃ salilameva vasanamambaraṃ 
pānavaśāddhṛtvāpāsya tava lambamānasya jalabharamantharatvāt
tatraiva tiṣṭhatas prasthānaṃ kathamapi bhāvi prayāṇaṃ kathaṃ 
api bhaviṣyati |

yasmādyo jñātāsvādo 'nubhūtarasaḥ sa pulinajaghanāṃ 
tīrapṛthunitambāṃ yuvatiṃ kastyaktuṃ samarthaḥ| tvaṃ ca
pānīyapānādviditāsvādaḥ| sāpi pulinameva jaghanaṃ 
yasyāḥ sā pulinajaghanā |

kīdṛśam salilavasanam | prāptaṃ labdhavadvānīraśakhāḥ 
vetasīlatāḥ|

vānīraśākhāśliṣṭamityarthas | prāptāpanne ca dvitīyayā |
yadi vā prāptā vānīraśākhā yeneti bahuvrīhiḥ|

ataścotprekṣate |

karadhṛtamiva hastāvaṣṭabdhaṃ yathā |

aṃśukaṃ harato hi kāmino nāryaḥ karābhyāṃ rundhanti |

nīlaṃ haritam | grīṣme 'lpatvāt |

ataśca haraṇānmuktamutsṛṣṭaṃ rodhastīrameva nitambaḥ 
yena |

yadapyambaraṃ hriyate tanmuktanitambaṃ bhavati |

bhaviṣyatīti bhāvi || 41 || ?sakhe, kiñcit?sāpi etc is not
needed?bhaviṣyati-bhāvi?

\daksināvarta

tasyā iti ||

muktarodhonitambaṃ muktarodhaḥ kaṭipradeśas | nitambaḥ paścime
śroṇibhāge ca kaṭake kat.āviti yādavaḥ|

jñātāsvādo jñātastrīsambhogarasaḥ|

vivṛtajaghanāṃ vivṛtakaṭipradeśām | jaghanaṃ syāt kaṭau
pūrvaśronibhāgāparāṅgayoriti yādavaḥ|| 41 ||

\mallinātha

tasyā iti ||

he sakhe prāptā vānīraśākhā ye tattathoktamata eva
kiñcidīṣatkaradhṛtaṃ hastāvalambitamiva sthitam |

muktastyakto rodhastaṭameva nitambaḥ kaṭiryena tattathā
uktam | nitambaḥ paścime śroṇibhāge 'drikaṭake kaṭāviti
yādavaḥ|

nīlaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tasyā gambhīrāyāḥ salilameva vasanaṃ 
hṛtvopanīya | prasthānasamaye preyasīvasanagrahaṇaṃ 
virahatāpavinodanārthamiti prasiddham |

lambamanasya pītasalilabharāllambamānasya | anyatra
jaghanārūḍhasya |

te tava prasthānaṃ prayāṇaṃ kathamapi kṛcchreṇa bhāvi |

kṛcchratve hetumāha jñāteti | jñātāsvādo 'nubhūtarasaḥ 
kaḥ pumānvivṛtaṃ prakaṭīkṛtaṃ jaghanaṃ kaṭiḥ 
tatpūrvabhāgo vā yasyāstām | jaghanaṃ syātkaṭau
pūrvaśroṇibhāgāparāṃśayoriti yādavaḥ| vihātuṃ tyaktuṃ 
samarthaḥ| na ko 'pītyarthaḥ|| 44 || -41-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho sakhe bho mitra kathamapi mahatā kaṣṭena te tava prasthānaṃ 
gamanaṃ bhāvi bhaviṣyati |

kathambhūtasya te | lambamānasya jalabhāramantharatvādgacchāmi na
veti saṃśayamānasya |

kiṃ kṛtvā | tasyā gambhīrāyā nadyā nīlaṃ nīlavarṇaṃ 
salilavasanaṃ jalameva vastraṃ hṛtvā gṛhītvā |

kathambhūtaṃ salilavasanam | muktarodhonitamvam |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ salilavasanam | prāptavānīraśākham |

tasyā gambhīrāyāḥ salilavasanaṃ kimiva | utprekṣyate kiñcit
karadhṛtamiva kiñcitkaragṛhītamiva | yathā kiñcit
karagṛhītaṃ kenacit bhavati tadapi kaṣṭena tyajyate |

amumevārtham dṛḍhayati | jñātāsvādo jano rasikamanuṣyaḥ 
vipulajaghanāṃ ramyajaghanapradeśāṃ vihātuṃ tyaktuṃ kaḥ 
samarthaḥ| na ko 'pityaktuṃ samarthaḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

salilamiti salilameva vasanaṃ salilavasanam | yathā striyāḥ 
vastraṃ bhavati tathā gambhīrāyā jalarūpavastramityarthaḥ|

mukteti muktaṃ rodhastīrameva nitamvo yena tat
muktarodhonitamvam |

prāpteti prāptā vānīrāṇāṃ vṛkṣāṇāṃ śākhā yatra
tatprāptavānīraśākham |

jñāteti jñātaḥ kāminyā āsvādo yena sa jñātāsvādaḥ|

vipulaṃ jaghanaṃ yasyāḥ sā tāṃ vipulajaghanām |

atra rūpotprekṣālaṅkāraḥ|| 45 || -41-

?after na ko 'pi tyaktuṃ samarthaḥ should follow iti arthas?

tvanniṣyandocchvasitavasudhāgandhasamparkapuṇyas

srotorandhradhvanitasubhagaṃ dantibhiḥ pīyamānas |

nīcairvāsyatyupajigamiṣordevapūrvaṃ giriṃ te

śīto vāyuḥ pariṇamayitā kānanodumbarāṇām || 42 || 45 Ma; 46
Su;

°nisyando° Su; ramyas Da,Ma.Su;

VALL

tato devagirimupajigamiṣoryiyāsostava satuṣāraḥ pavanaḥ 
nicairvāsyati mantharaṃ gamiṣyati|

kīdṛśaḥ| tava niṣyandena toyamokṣeṇocchvasitā vikasitā
hṛṣitā yāsau vasudhā bhūmistasyā gandhasamparkeṇa
saurabhavyatikareṇa puṇyo manojñaḥ|

tathā saukhyāddantibhiḥ pīyamānaḥ|

katham | srotorandhraṃ karavivaraṃ tasya dhvanitaṃ śūtkārastena
subhagaṃ ramyam | saśūtkṛtamityarthaḥ| suṣire hi
vātapraveśādadhiko dhvanirbhavati | srotaḥ karaḥ kariṇas |
yathā prāsaprotasrotasāntaḥkṣateneti māghasya | {śiśu18.49}

tathā kānane vana udumbaraphalāṇām pariṇamayitā pācayitā|
tadvaśātpākotpatteḥ|| 42 ||

\daksināvarta

tvanniṣyandocchavasitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyaḥ 
tvadīyanavajalabṛṃhitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyaḥ| anena vāyoḥ 
gandhava[t]tvamuktam |

srotorandhradhvanitasubhagaṃ srotasāṃ randhraṃ srotorandhramiti
jalapraṇālo vivakṣitaḥ|
srotorandhrasammūrchajjaladhvanitasubhagamityarthaḥ| ?

dantibhiḥ sarandhreṇa kareṇa pīyamāno vāyuḥ 
jalapraṇālaniḥsaratpravāha iva śabdāyata ityarthaḥ| anena
māndyamuktam |

nīcairadhastāddantibhiḥ pīyamānatvānmandavegastava nīcaiḥ 
eva vāsyati | tena dīrghādhvagāminaste vāyupreraṇayā śrāntiḥ 
na bhaviṣyatītyabhiprāyaḥ| ?

devapūrvam devaśabdapūrvaṃ giriṃ giriśabdam | etau devagiriśabdau
svarūpeṇa meghānabhigamyatvānmeghābhigamyaṃ svasamudāyavācyaṃ 
devagiriṃ lakṣyata ityanusandheyaṃ | ?

kānanodumbarāṇāmudumbaraphalānāṃ | kṛdyoge ṣaṣṭhī || 42 ||

\mallinātha

tvaditi ||

tvanniṣyandena tava vṛṣṭyocchvasitāyā upabṛṃhitāyā vasudhāyā bhūmergandhasya samparkeṇa ramyaḥ| 
surabhirityarthaḥ|

srotaḥśabdenendriyavācinā tadviśeṣo ghrāṇaṃ lakṣyate |
sroto 'mbuvegendriyayorityamaraḥ| srotorandhreṣu
nāsāgrakuhareṣu yaddhvanitaṃ śabdastena subhagam yathā tathā
dantibhirgajaiḥ pīyamānaḥ| vasudhāgandhalobhādāghrāyamānaḥ 
ityarthaḥ| anena māndyamucyate | kānaneṣu vaneṣu
udumbarāṇāṃ jantuphalanām | udumbaro jantuphalo yajñāṅgaḥ 
hemadugdhaka ityamaraḥ| pariṇamayitā paripākayitā | mitāṃ 
hrasva iti hrasvaḥ| śito vāyuḥ| devapūrvaṃ devaśabdapūrvaṃ 
giriṃ devagirimityarthaḥ| upajigamiṣorupagantumicchoḥ|
gameḥ sannantādupratyayaḥ| te tava nīcaiḥ śanairvāsyati |
tvāṃ vījayiṣyatītyarthaḥ|

sambandhamātravivakṣāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhī |

devapūrvaṃ girimityatra devapūrvatvaṃ giriśabdasya | na tu
sañjñinastadarthasyeti sañjñāyāḥ sañjñitvābhāvāt
avācyavacanaṃ doṣamāhurālaṅkārikāḥ| taduktamekāvalyāṃ 
yadavācyasya vacanamavācyavacanaṃ hi tat|| iti | samādhānaṃ tu
devaśabdaviśeṣitena giriśabdena śabdapareṇa meghopaganamayogyaḥ 
devagirirlakṣyata iti kathañcitsampādyam || 45 || -42- ?letzte
Teil?

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho sakhe bho megha vāyuḥ pavanaste tava nīcairmandaṃ śanaiḥ 
śanairvāsyati |

kathambhūto vāyuḥ| śīto 'tyantam śītalaḥ|

bho megha te kiṃ kartumicchoḥ| gambhīrāto devagirināmānaṃ 
parvatamupajigamiṣorgantukāmasya |

kathambhūtaṃ girim | devapūrvam | devaśabdo gireḥ śabdāt
[pūrvam] devagirimityarthaḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūto vāyuḥ|
tvannisyandocchvasitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyaḥ|

punaḥ kathambhūto vāyuḥ| kānanodumvarāṇāṃ pariṇamayitā
paripācayitā | viśeṣaṇadvayena vāyoḥ saugandhyamuktam |

punaḥ kathambhūto vāyuḥ| śrotorandhradhvanitasubhagaṃ yathā
bhavati tathā dantibhirgajaiḥ pīyamānaḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

upeti upa samīpe gantumicchurupagamiṣustasyopagamiṣoḥ|

deveti devaḥ pūrvo yasya sa taṃ devapūrvamīdṛśaṃ giriṃ 
devagirimityarthaḥ|

tvannisyamiti tvannisyandena bhavajjalasiñcanena samucchvasitaḥ 
samullasito vasudhāyā bhūmyā yaḥ saugandhastasya samparkaḥ 
tena ramyastvannisyandocchvasitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyaḥ| etena
saugandhyam |

sroteti srota indriyaṃ srotorandhraḥ śuṇḍādaṇḍastasya
dhvanitaṃ tena subhagaṃ srotorandhradhvanitasubhagam | gajasya bhayam
bhavati yato gajāḥ saphūtkāraṃ pibanti | ato vāyoḥ 
mandatvaguṇam |

kānaneti udumvarāṇāṃ kānanāni kānanodumvarāṇi teṣāṃ kānanodumvarāṇām |
vṛkṣāṇāṃ madhye vāyurataḥ śaityaguṇam |
devagiripārśve prabhūtānyudumvaravṛkṣāṇi | tāni hi meghāgama 
eva pacyante | cediha kāvye he megha te tava śīto vāyurvāsyati
atastvannisyandocchvasitavasudhāgandhasamparkaramyastvaṃ 
pṛthakkriyate tadā meghasya viśeṣaṇamanyathā vāyoḥ|

anumānālaṅkāro 'tra || 46 || -42-

tatra skandaṃ niyatavasatiṃ puṣpameghīkṛtātmā

puṣpāsāraiḥ snapayatu bhavānvyomagaṅgājalādraiḥ|

rakṣāhetornavaśaśibhṛtā vāsavīnāṃ camūnāṃ 

atyādityaṃ hutavahamukhe sambhṛtaṃ taddhi tejaḥ|| 43 || 46 Ma; 47
Su;

VALL

tatra devagirau sadāsannihitaṃ kumāraṃ tvaṃ surasaridudakasarasaiḥ 
kusumavarṣaiḥ puṣpameghīkṛtātmatvātsnapayeḥ pūjayeḥ|

yasmādvāsavīnāṃ camūnāmaindrīṇāṃ senānāṃ rakṣārthaṃ 
navaśaśibhṛtā candramaulinātyādityaṃ sūryādapyadhikaṃ 
tattejo vīryaṃ sambhṛtaṃ kṣiptam |

asuropadrutasurarakṣārthaṃ hi kārttikeyo hareṇa gauryāṃ janitaḥ 
ityāgamaḥ| tacca śukraṃ svasthānacalitamagninā pītamabhūt
|

vāsavīnāmiti durlabhaḥ prayogaḥ| vṛddhācchenāṇaḥ 
bādhitatvāt |

atikrānta ādityo yena tadatyādityam || 43 || ?hutavamukhe;?

\daksināvarta

tatreti ||

tatra devagirau niyatavasatim | purā kila devārthamasurānnihatya
tatra viśrāntaḥ skando devairyācitaḥ san tatraiva
maddarśanāyāgatābhyāṃ śivābhyāṃ saha nityam vasāmīti
pratijñātavān | tasmāttatra skandasya niyatavasatitvamuktamiti
aitihyamanusandheyaṃ |

puṣpameghīkṛtātmā kāmarūpatvādetanmeghasya sambhavatyuktaṃ 
aitihyaṃ kiñcidvivṛṇoti | ?

rakṣāhetoritīyaṃ ṣaṣṭhī hetuprayoga iti ṣaṣṭhī |

atyādityamatikrāntādityaṃ |

hutavahamukhe sambhṛtaṃ taddhi teja iti skandasyāgnimukhotpatteḥ 
uktam || 43 ||

\mallinātha

tatreti ||

tatra devagirau nityatā vasatiryasya tam | nityasannihitamiti
arthaḥ| purā kila tārakākhyāsuravijayasantuṣṭaḥ 
suraprārthanāvaśādbhagavānbhavanīnandanaḥ skando nityaṃ 
ahamiha saha śivābhyāṃ vasāmītyuktvā tatra vasitīti
prasiddhaḥ| skandaṃ kumāraṃ svāminam |

puṣpāṇāṃ meghaḥ puṣpameghaḥ| puṣpameghīkṛtātmā
kāmarūpatvātpuṣpavarṣukameghīkṛtavigrahaḥ san |

vyomagaṅgājalādraiḥ puṣpāsāraiḥ puṣpasampātaiḥ|
dhārāsampāta āsāra ityamaraḥ| bhavānsvayameva snapayatu
abhiṣiñcatu | svayaṃ pūjāyā uttamatvāditi bhāvaḥ| tathā ca
śambhurahasye

svayaṃ yajati ceddevamuttamā sodarātmajaiḥ|

madhyamā yā yajedbhṛtyairadhamā yājanakriyā ||

iti skandasya pūjyatvasamarthanenārthāntaraṃ nyasyati rakṣeti |

tadbhagavānskanda ityarthaḥ| vidheyaprādhānyāt
napuṃsakanirdeśaḥ| vāsavasyemā vāsavyaḥ| tasyedamiti
aṇ | tāsāṃ vāsavīnāmaindriṇāṃ camūnāṃ senānāṃ 
rakṣāhetoḥ rakṣayā kāraṇena rakṣārthamityarthaḥ| ṣaṣṭhī
hetuprayoga iti ṣaṣṭhī |

navaśaśibhṛtā bhagavatā candraśekhareṇa |

vahatīti vahaḥ| pacādyac | hutasya vaho hutavaho vahnistasya
mukhe sambhṛtaṃ sañcitam | ādityamatikrāntamatyādityam |
atyādayaḥ krāntādyarthe dvitīyeti samāsaḥ| tejo hi
sākṣādbhagavato harasyaiva mūrtyantaramityarthaḥ| ataḥ 
pūjyamiti bhāvaḥ| mukhagrahaṇaṃ tu śuddhatvasūcanārthaṃ | tat
uktam śambhurahasye

gavāṃ paścāddvijasyāṅghro yāgināṃ hṛtkavervacaḥ|

paraṃ śucitamaṃ vidyānmukhaṃ strīvahnivājinām || iti || 46 ||
-43- ?z?

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

he megha tatra devagirau parvate puṣpameghīkṛtātmā
kusumavṛṣṭikṛdmegharūpatāṃ prapannaḥ sannevaṃvidho bhavān
skandaṃ kārttikeyaṃ mahādevaputraṃ snapayatu prakṣālayatu |

kaiḥ| puṣpāsāraiḥ puṣpairāsārairvā vegavadvarṣaṇaiḥ 
puṣpābhāve vṛṣṭyā vā puṣpāsāraiḥ pradhānapuṣpaireveti
bhāvaḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ skandam | niyatavasatiṃ devagirau nirantarasthāyinam |

kathambhūtaiḥ puṣpasāraiḥ| vyomagaṅgājalārdraiḥ 
ākāśagaṅgājalapavitraiḥ|

tanmāhātmyamāha | hi yato bho megha navaśaśibhṛtā mahādevena
yattejaḥ svakīyaṃ vīryaṃ hutavahamukhe 'gnimadhye sambhṛtaṃ 
rakṣitaṃ |

kasya hetoḥ kimartham | vāsavīnāṃ camūnāṃ 
indrasambandhinīsenānāṃ rakṣāhetordaityebhyaḥ 
rakṣākaraṇārtham | tadidaṃ tejas | etena tejaḥkathanena skandasya
rudratanayatvamuktam |

kathambhūtaṃ tejaḥ| atyādityaṃ sūryādapi adhikaṃ tejaḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

puṣpeti apuṣpaḥ puṣpameghīkṛta ātmā deho yena sa puṣpameghīkṛtātmā |

niyateti niyatā niścalīkṛtā vasatiḥ sthitiḥ sthānaṃ yena sa
taṃ niyatavasatim |

puṣpeti puṣpaiścāsāraiśca puṣpāsāraiḥ| āsāraḥ 
vegavānvarṣa ityabhidhānacintāmaṇiḥ|

vasorindrasyemā vāsavyastāsāṃ vāsavīnām | etena jaladasya
skandapūjanaṃ puṣpāsārairuktam |

