dhavalāpāṅgojjvalīkaraṇam | anena nartakasya mukhamaṇḍanasamādhiḥ 
ca pratīyate |

pavakeḥ skandasya | anena hutavahamukhe sambhṛtaṃ taddhi teja iti
asya vivaraṇaṃ kṛtam | {43}

paścātpuṣpasnapanātpaścāt |

adrigrahaṇagurubhiradrigrahaṇaṃ guhāgrahaṇam |

