\mallinātha

jyotiriti ||

jyotiṣastejaso lekhā rājayastāsāṃ valayaṃ maṇḍalam yasya
astīti tathoktam | galitaṃ bhraṣṭaṃ na tu laulyātsvayaṃ 
chinnamiti bhāvaḥ| yasya mayūrasya barhaṃ piccham | picchabarhe
napuṃsaka ityamaraḥ| bhavānī gaurī putrapremṇā putrasnehena
kuvalayadalaprāpi kuvalayasya dalaṃ patraṃ tatprāpi tadyogi yathā
tathā karṇe karoti | dalena saha dhārayatītyarthaḥ| yadvā
kuvalayasya dalaprāpi dalabhāji dalārhe karṇe karoti | kvibantāt
saptamī | dalaṃ parihṛtya tatsthāne barhaṃ dhatta ityarthaḥ|
nāthastu kuvalayadalakṣepīti pāṭhamanusṛtya kṣepaḥ 
nindāpasāraṇaṃ veti vyākhyātavān |

haraśaśirucā haraśiraścandrikayā dhautāpāṅgaṃ svato 'pi
śauklyādatidhavalitanetrāntam | apāṅgau netrayorantāviti
amaraḥ|

pāvakasyāgnerapatyaṃ pāvakiḥ skandaḥ| ata iñ | tasya taṃ 
pūrvoktaṃ mayūraṃ paścātpuṣpābhiṣecanānantaramadreḥ 
devagireḥ karturgrahaṇena guhāsaṅkramaṇena gurubhiḥ|
pratidhvānamahadbhirityarthaḥ| garjitairnartayethā nṛtyaṃ 
kāraya | mārdaṅgikabhāvena bhagavantaṃ kumāramupāsveti
bhāvaḥ|

nartayethā ityatra aṇāvakarmakāccittavatkartṛkāditi
ātmanepadāpavādaḥ| nigaraṇacalanārthebhyaśceti parasmaipadaṃ 
na bhavati tasya na pādamyāḍyamāḍyasaparimuharucinṛtivadavasa iti
pratiṣedhāt || 47 || -44- ?z?

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha puṣpaiḥ skandapūjitānantaraṃ paścāttvaṃ pāvakeḥ 
agnerapatyasya kārttikeyasya tam mayūraṃ vāhanaṃ mayūraṃ 
nartayethā nṛtyaṃ kārayeḥ|

kaiḥ| garjitairgarjāravaiḥ kṛtvā |

taṃ kam | yasya mayūrasya barhaṃ picchaṃ bhavānī pārvatī karṇe
karoti karṇābharaṇaṃ karoti |

kena | putrapremṇā putraḥ kārttikeyastadvahanasya snehena |

kathambhūtaṃ barham | jyotirlekhāvalayi |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ barham | galitaṃ na tu troṭitam |

punaḥ kathambhūtaṃ barham | kuvalayadalaprāpi
kuvalayadalaprāpanaśīlam |

kathambhūtaṃ mayūram | dhautāpāṅgaṃ śvetadeham |

kayā | haraśaśirucā rudracandrakāntyā |

kathambhūtairgarjitaiḥ| adrigrahaṇagurubhiḥ 
devagiripratiśabdasaṃspardhitaiḥ|

ityanvayaḥ||

pāvaka[pāvakeḥ ?] iti pāvakasyāgnerapatyaṃ sutaḥ pāvakiḥ 
ata iñsūtreṇa tasya pāvakeragnijanmanaḥ {p.4.1.95} | skandaḥ 
hi agnerutpannaḥ| kathaṃ | devasenārakṣārthaṃ daityebhyaḥ 
śivena svavīryaṃ vahnau kṣiptaṃ | tato vīryātskando jātaḥ|
skandena daityā hatā iti bhāvaḥ|

putreti putrasya prema putraprema tena putrapremṇā |

jyotiriti jyotiṣāṃ kāntīnāṃ lekhā śreṇī tāsāṃ valayaṃ 
maṇḍalaṃ tadasyāstīti yattajjyotirlekhāvalayi |

kuvaleti kuvalasya dalaṃ kuvalayadalasyānukāraṃ prāpnoti
evaṃśīlaṃ yattatkuvalayadalaprāpi |

dhauteti dhautaḥ śuklīkṛto 'pāṅgo yasya sa taṃ 
dhautāpāṅgam | haraśiraścandrikāsamparkeṇa dhavalībhūtamayūraṃ 
ityarthaḥ|

hareti harasya śaśiruggharaśaśiruk tayā haraśaśirucā | etena
jaladasyādhvani skandasya pūjanamuktam |

