ārādhyaivaṃ śaravaṇabhuvaṃ devamullaṅghitādhvā

siddhadvandvairjalakaṇabhayādvīṇibhirmuktamārgaḥ||

vyālambethāḥ surabhitanayālambhajāṃ mānayiṣyan

srotomūrtyā bhuvi pariṇatāṃ rantidevasya kīrtim || 45 || 48 Ma; 49
Su;

enam Da?,Ma,Su; °bhavam Da?,Ma;

VALL

śaravaṇabhuvaṃ kumāramevaṃ puṣpasāraiḥ snapanādiprakāreṇa
ārādhya kiñciccādhvānamatikramya rantidevasya rājñaḥ 
kīrtiṃ carmaṇvatyākhyāṃ mānayiṣyanpūjayituṃ vyālambethāḥ 
śrayethā gaccheḥ|

kīdṛśīṃ | surabhitanayā gāvastāsāmalambhanaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ 
tato jātāṃ prasūtāṃ bhuvi ca srotomūrtyā pravāharūpeṇa
pariṇatāṃ rūpāntaraṃ gatām | tena hi nṛpeṇa kratuṣu
atibaṃhīyasyo gāvaḥ sañjñāpitāyāsāṃ rudhirāccarmabhyaḥ 
ca carmaṇvatī sampannetyāgamaḥ|

tvaṃ kīdṛśaḥ| siddhamithunaistoyabindutrāsānmuktamārgaḥ 
parihṛtapathaḥ| yato vīṇibhirvallakīhastaiḥ| tantrī(s?)hi
jalārdrāvisvarābhavati |

agnerāsādya vīryaṃ soḍhumakṣamayā gaṅgayāśaravaṇe
tyaktamityataḥ śarajatvaṃ skandasya |

pranirantaḥśarekṣuplakṣetyādinā ṇatvam || 45 ||

\daksināvarta

ārādhyeti ||

siddhadvandvaiḥ skandamupavīṇayitumāgacchadbhiriti bhāvaḥ|
vīṇibhirvīṇāvadbhiḥ|

vrīhyāditvādiniḥ|

vrīhiḥ śikhāṣṭakā mālā patākā varmakarmaṇī |

mekhalā baḍavā vīṇā sañjñā carma valākayā || iti
vrīhyādigaṇaḥ| jalasiktatantrīkā vīṇā na kvaṇatīti
siddhānāṃ meghamārgaṃ parityāgaḥ|
vakṣyamāṇārthaparijñānāyātredamanusandheyaṃ 

daśapurākhyasya purasyādhipatiḥ puṇyaślokaḥ kaścana rantidevaḥ 
iti rājā babhūva | tadīyānāṃ dhenūnāṃ madhye pratidinaṃ 
kāñcanakhuraśṛṅgādyavayavaiḥ sañcaramāṇāḥ kāścana
devagaṇyaḥ samavatīrya svairaṃ vihṛtya gacchanti | tāsāṃ rūpam
dṛṣṭvā rantidevadhenavaḥ papracchuḥ kuto yuṣmākamīdṛśaṃ 
rūpaṃ sañjātamiti | 
tāḥ punarabruvan purā yajñeṣu sañjñāpitā vayamīdṛśyo jātā iti | 
tāśca dhenavaḥ svāminam rantidevamupagamyābruvan | 
he rājannetāvantaṃ kālaṃ bhavato vayamupakṛtavatyaḥ| 
tasmādasmānkratuṣu tvamālabhethā yena divyarūpās bhavāma iti | 
so 'pi tā yajñeṣu viśasya tāsāṃ carmāṇi parvatamiva kvāpi sambabhāra | 
tasmātsaraktaniḥsyandāccarmaparvatātkāpinadī pravahatiyāṃ 
carmaprabhavatvāccarmaṇvatimāhuriti bhāratīyamupākhyānaṃ 
hṛdaye kṛtvā tāṃ nadīṃ tasya kīrtitvena varṇayannāha
vyālambethā iti | vyālambethā vinamya prāpnuhi |

surabhitanayālambhajāṃ surabhitanayā dhenavastāsāmālambhaḥ 
viśasanam | sotromūrtyā carmaṇvatījalamūrtyā || 45 || gaṇa ist
zusatz?

\mallinātha

ārādhyeti ||

enaṃ pūrvoktaṃ śarā bāṇatṛṇāni | śaro bāṇe bāṇatṛṇa 
iti śabdārṇave | teṣāṃ vanaṃ śaravaṇam | pranirantaḥśara 
itiyādinā ṇatvam {p8.4.5} | tatra bhavo janma yasya taṃ 
śaravaṇabhavam | avarjyā bahuvrīhirvyadhikaraṇo janmāt
uttarapada itivāmanaḥ| avarjyo 'gatikatvādāśrayaṇīyaḥ 
ityarthaḥ| devaṃ skandam | śarajanmā ṣaḍānana ityamaraḥ|
ārādhyopāsya |

vīṇibhirvīṇāvadbhiḥ| vrihyāditvādiniḥ| siddhadvandvaiḥ 
siddhamithunairbhagavantaṃ skandamupavīṇayitumāgatairiti
bhāvaḥ| jalakaṇabhayāt | jalasekasya vīṇākvaṇapratibandhakatvāt
iti bhāvaḥ| muktamārgastyaktavartmā sannullaṅghitādhvā |
kiyantamadhvānaṃ gata ityarthaḥ| surabhitanayānāṃ gavāṃ 
ālambhena sañjñapanena jāyata ititathoktām | bhuvi loke
srotomūrtyāpravāharūpeṇa pariṇatāṃ rūpaviśeṣamāpannāṃ 
rantidevasya daśapurapatermahārājasya kīrtim | carmaṇvatyākhyāṃ 
nadīmityarthaḥ| mānayiṣyansatkariṣyan| vyālambheyithāḥ 
ālambyāvatarerityarthaḥ|

purā kila rājño rantidevasya gavālambheṣvekatra sambhṛtāt
raktaniṣyandāccarmarāśeḥ kācinnadī sasyande | sā carmaṇvatī
ityākhyāyata iti || 48 || -45-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha ullaṅghitādhvā kiyadullaṅghitamārgaḥ sanvīṇibhiḥ 
vīṇāpāṇiyuktaiḥ siddhadvandvaiḥ kinnarayugmairata eva
jalakaṇabhayājjale lagne vīṇā viṇaśiṣyatīti bhayādataḥ 
tvam muktamārgaḥ saṃstyaktamārgaḥ sanvyālambethā vyālambanaṃ 
kūryāḥ|

kiṃ kṛtvā | enaṃ śaravaṇabhuvaṃ devaṃ kārttikeyamārādhya
devagirāvārādhayitvā pūjayitvā |

bho megha bhavānkiṃ kariṣyan | rantidevasya rantidevanāmnaḥ 
bhūpasya kīrtiṃ mānayiṣyansādaratvena śroṣyan |

kathambhūtāṃ kīrtim | surabhitanayālambhajām |

punaḥ kathambhūtāṃ kīrtim | bhuvi bhūmau pariṇatāṃ vistṛtām |

kayā | srotomūrtyā nadīrūpeṇa |

ityanvayaḥ||

adhvani sanmukhāgatakinnaramukhāttvaṃ mārgaṃ tyaktvā rantidevasya
kīrtiṃ śṛṇuyā iti bhāvaḥ|

ullamiti ullaṅghito 'dhvā mārgo yena sa ullaṅghitādhvā |

siddhānāṃ devaviśeṣeṇām vā kinnarāṇāṃ dvandvāni
siddhadvandvāni taiḥ siddhadvandvaiḥ|

jaleti jalakaṇādvarṣaṇādbhayaṃ jalakaṇabhayam tasmāt
jalakaṇabhayāt | jalārdrībhūtāyām viṇāyāṃ siddhā na
gāsyantīti bhāvaḥ|

vīṇibhis vīṇāpāṇibhirityarthaḥ|

surabhīti surabhitanayā gāvastāsāṃ samālabho vināśaḥ 
tasmājjatām surabhitanyālambhajām | yato hi rantidevena
gomedhayajñe suśataśo dhenavo yajña āhūtāḥ|
tadraktanadīpravāhena carmaṇvatīnadī jateti prasiddhaḥ| etena
jaladasya rantidevakīrtiśravaṇamuktam |

