tvayyādātuṃ jalamavanate śār"giṇo varṇacaure

tasyāḥ sindhoḥ pṛthumapi tanuṃ dūrabhāvātpravāham |

prekṣiṣyante gaganagatayo dūramāvarjya dṛṣṭīḥ 

ekaṃ muktāguṇamiva bhuvaḥ sthūlamadhyendranīlam || 46 || 49 Ma; 50
Su;

nūnam Da?,Ma;

VALL

tvayi toyaṃ grahītumavanate lambamāne sati tasyāḥ sindhoḥ 
carmaṇvatyāḥ pravāhaṃ siddhākhyā nabhaścarāścakṣūṃṣi
dūramatyarthamāvarjya nikṣipya kautukāddrakṣyanti | yataḥ 
bhuvaḥ sthūlamadhyendranīlamekaṃ muktāguṇaṃ mauktikadāmeva |
srotaso muktāguṇanibhatvādambudasya ca mahānīlatulyatvam |

kīdṛśaṃ pravāham | pṛthumapi tanuṃ vistīrṇamapi svalpam |

kutaḥ| dūrabhāvādviprakarṣāt | dūrāddhi mahadapi svalpaṃ 
dṛśyate | sajalatvātkṛṣṇasya varṇacaure nīle | etena
indranīlanibhatvamuktam || 46 ||

\daksināvarta

mayā tasyāḥ kā mānanetyapekṣāyāmāha tvayīti ||

pṛthumapi tanuṃ dūrabhāvāttanuṃ pravāhamityanvayaḥ|
gaganagatayaḥ khecaraḥ siddhādayaḥ| ekaṃ muktāguṇamiti
ekaśabda ekāvalīsamādhinā proktaḥ|| 46 ||

\mallinātha

tvayīti ||

śārṅginaḥ kṛṣṇasya varṇasya kānteścaure varṇacaure |
tattulyavarṇa ityarthaḥ| tvayi jalamādātumavanate sati
pṛthumapi dūratvāttanuṃ sūkṣmatayā pratīyamānaṃ tasyāḥ 
sindhoścarmaṇvatyākhyāyāḥ pravāham |

gagane gatiryeṣāṃ te gaganagatayaḥ khecarāḥ 
siddhagandhārvādayaḥ| ayamapi bahuvrīhiḥ pūrvavajjanmāt
uttarapadeṣu draṣṭavyaḥ| nūnaṃ satyaṃ dṛṣṭīrāvarjya
niyamyaikamekayaṣṭikaṃ sthūlo mahānmadhye
madhyamaṇībhūta indranīlo yasya taṃ bhuvo bhūmeḥ 
muktāguṇaṃ muktāhāramiva prekṣiṣyante |

atrātyantanīlameghasaṅgatasya pravāhasya
bhūkaṇṭhamuktāguṇatvenotprekṣaṇādutprekṣaiveyamiti
ivaśabdena vyajyate | niruktakārastu tatra tatropamā yatra
ivaśabdasya darśanamitīvaśabdadarśanādatrāpyupamaiva
itibabhrāma || 49 || -46-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha gaganagatayo vidyādharā devā dūramatyarthaṃ 
dṛṣṭīrāvarjya prasārayitvā madhyāduttaraṃ tasyāḥ sindhoḥ 
sindhunadyaḥ pravāhaṃ pṛthumapi vistīrṇamapi dūrabhāvāt
dūratastanuṃ sūkṣmamekasaṅkhyaṃ bhuvo bhūmyā muktāguṇaṃ 
iva mauktikamālāmiva prekṣiṣyante 'valokayiṣyanti |

kva sati | tvayi meghe jalamādātuṃ gṛhītumavanate namrībhūte
sati namrījāte sati |

kathambhūte tvayi | śārṅgiṇo varṇacaure kṛṣṇavacchyāmavarṇe
|

kathambhūtaṃ muktāguṇam | sthūlamadhyendranīlaṃ |

ityanvayaḥ||

śārṅgīti śārṅgadhanurvidyate yasyā asau śārṅgī tasya śārṅgiṇaḥ| kṛṣṇasyetyarthaḥ|

varṇeti varṇaṃ śyāmarūpaṃ corayatīti varṇacaurastasmin
varṇacaure |

gaganeti gagana ākāśe gatiryeṣāṃ te gaganagatayaḥ| devāḥ 
vidyādharā ityarthaḥ|

sthūleti sthūlo madhya indranīlo maṇiviśeṣo ratnajātiḥ 
vā yasya sa taṃ sthūlamadhyendranīlam |

sindhunadyā hi suvistṛtamauktikamālāyā upamā | meghasya
tanmadhye sthūlamadhyendranīlasyopamā | yathā nāryāḥ 
mauktikamālā syāttatheyaṃ bhūmyā mauktikamālā | devāḥ 
dṛṣṭīḥ prasārya drakṣyantīti bhāvaḥ|

