tāmuttīrya vraja paricitabhrūlatāvibhramāṇāṃ 

pakṣmotkṣepāduparivilasatkṛṣṇaśāraprabhāṇām |

kundakṣepānugamadhukaraśrīmuṣāmātmabimbaṃ 

pātrīkurvandaśapuravadhūnetrakautuhalānām || 47 || 50 Mall; 51 Su;

°sāra° Su;

VALL

tāṃ carmaṇvatīmatītya daśapurākhye nagare
yuvatinayanakautukānāmātmānaṃ pātrīkurvaṃstāsāṃ 
netraviṣayaṃ nayangaccheḥ| daśapuranikaṭena yayā yathā
tannāgarikāstvāmīkṣerannityarthas | kīdṛśānām |
nāgarikatvātparicitā abhyastā bhrūśākhāvilāsā yeṣām |
tathā tvadālokanavaśātpakṣmotkṣepeṇopari vilasantī sphurantī
kṛṣṇaśāraprabhā yeṣām | ataśca kundakusumasya yaḥ kṣepaḥ 
preraṇaṃ tasyānugatā anuyāyino ye bhramarāsteṣāṃ śriyaṃ 
śobhāṃ muṣṇanti yāni teṣām | kundānāṃ sitatvādalīnāṃ ca
kālatvāt | yadyapi kautūhalaviśeṣaṇānyetāni tathāpi vastubalāttadvatāṃ netrāṇāmevaita guṇāḥ|| 47 ||

\daksināvarta

tāmiti ||

uparivilasatkṛṣṇaśāraprabhāṇāṃ | kṛṣṇaraktasitaḥ śāra iti
yādavaprakāśena śāraśabdo varṇatrayasāṅkaryavācako yadi
apyatra pṛthageva kṛṣṇaśabdaḥ pādānācchāraśabdaḥ 
sitaraktavarṇayoḥ sāṅkarye saṅkucitavṛttiḥ| tathā
śrīrāmāyaṇaprayogaśca vidyata kṛṣṇaśāre vilocana iti |
saptaśatyāṃ ca eko vi kālasāroṇa deīti |
kundakṣepānugamadhukaraśrīmuṣām | kundasya kṣepo vāyunā
preraṇam | madhukaraśrīrmadhukaraśobhā | raktakusumodareṣu
madhupānārthaṃ praveśānmadhukarāṇāṃ tatparāgapāṭalatvaṃ ca
vidyata ityanusandheyam |

ātmabimbaṃ svaśarīramaṇḍalam | bimbo 'strī
maṇḍalasamapratimāmukhalakṣmasu | pratibimbastatprakṛtāviti
yādavaḥ| daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhalānām | vadhūḥ strī |
netrāṇāṃ kautuhalādāgatānyunmeṣaṇādīni netrakautūhalāni |
tasmānnetrakautūhalānāṃ netronmeṣaṇādīnāṃ 
paricitabhrūlatāvibhramatvamuparivilasatkṛṣṇaśāraprabhatvaṃ 
sambhavati || 47 ||

\mallinātha

tāmiti ||

tām carmaṇvatīmuttīrya |

bhruvo latā iva bhrūlatāḥ| upamitasamāsaḥ| tāsāṃ 
vibhramā vilāsāḥ paricitāḥ kḷptā yeṣu teṣām | ?

pakṣmāṇi netralomāni | pakṣma sūtre ca sūkṣmāṃśe kiñjalke
netralomanīti viśvaḥ| teṣāmutkṣepādunnamanāddhetoḥ|

kṛṣṇāśca tāḥ śārāśca kṛṣṇaśārā nīlaśabalāḥ|
varṇo varṇeneti samāsaḥ| kṛṣṇaraktasitāḥ śārā iti
yādavaḥ| tataśca śāraśabdādeva siddhe kārṣṇye punaḥ 
kṛṣṇapadopādānaṃ kārṣṇyaprādhānyartham | raktatvaṃ tu na
vivakṣitamupamānānusārāttasya svābhāvikasya strīnetreṣu
sāmudrikavirodhāditarasyāprasaṅgāt | kvacidbhāvakathanam tu
upapattiviṣayam | upari vilasantyaḥ kṛṣṇaśārāḥ prabhā yeṣāṃ 
teṣām |

kundāni mādhyakusumāni | mādhye kundamityamaraḥ| teṣāṃ 
kṣepa itastataścalanaṃ tasyānugā anusāriṇo ye
madhukarāsteṣāṃ śriyaṃ muṣṇantīti tathoktānām |
kṣipyamāṇakundānuvidhāyimadhukarakalpanāmityarthaḥ|
daśapuraṃ rantidevasya nagaraṃ tasya vadhvaḥ striyaḥ| vadhūḥ 
jāyā snuṣācetyamaraḥ| tāsāṃ netrakautūhalānāṃ 
netrābhilāṣāṇām | sābhilāṣadṛṣṭānāmityarthas |
ātmabimbaṃ svamūrtiṃ pātrīkurvanviṣayīkurvanvraja gaccha || 50
|| -47-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha tāṃ sindhunadīmuttīryottāritvā vraja gaccha |

tvaṃ kiṃ kurvan | ātmabimbaṃ svakīyabimbaṃ prati pātrīkurvan
sthānīkurvan |

keṣām | daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhalānāṃ 
kautukajanyanayananirīkṣaṇānām |

kathambhūtānāṃ daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhālānām |
paricitabhrūlatāvibhramāṇāṃ sadabhyastabhrūlatāvilāsānām |

punaḥ kathambhūtānānām daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhālānām |
uparivilasatkṛṣṇasāraprabhāṇām |

kasmāt | pakṣmotkṣepādardhavilokitatvādvakradṛṣṭyā
vilokitatvāt |

punaḥ kathambhūtānānām daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhālānām |
pakṣmotkṣepādata eva kundakṣepānugamadhukaraśrīmuṣāṃ 
kundakusumapreraṇānuyāyibhramaraśobhānukāriṇām |

ityanvayaḥ||

daśapuravadhūnāṃ daśapuranagarastrīṇām netrarūpakautūhalāni
kautukāni cañcalanirīkṣaṇāni yāni tāni teṣāṃ 
daśapuravadhūnetrakautūhalānām | paricitena vāraṃvāramabhyasena
bhrūlatānāṃ vibhramāḥ paricitabhrūlatāvibhramāsteṣām
paricitabhrūlatāvibhramāṇām |

uparīti uparivilasantyaḥ kṛṣṇasārāḥ kṛṣṇena kṛṣṇavarṇena
sārāḥ kṛṣṇadhavalaprabhā yeṣāṃ te teṣāṃ 
uparivilasatkṛṣṇasāraprabhāṇām |

kundeti kundakṣepānugena mucakundapuṣpavāsanāpreraṇāgatena
kundakusumoparisthitānāmīdṛśānāṃ madhukarāṇāṃ śriyaṃ 
śobhāṃ vā sādṛśyatāṃ muṣṇantīti
kundakṣepānigamadhukaraśrīmuṣasteṣāṃ 
kundakṣepānugamadhukaraśrīmuṣām | etena daśapuranagarasya
upariṣṭādbhūtvā gantavyaṃ tvayā | upamālaṅkāro 'tra || 51 ||
-47-

brahmāvartaṃ janapadamadhaśchāyayā gāhamānāḥ 

kṣetraṃ kṣatrapradhanapiśunaṃ kauravaṃ tadbhajethāḥ|

rājanyānāṃ śitaśaraśatairyatra gāṇḍīvadhanvā

dhārāpātaistvamiva kamalānyabhyaṣiñcanmukhāni || 48 || 51
Ma; 52 Su;

atha cchāyayā° Da,Ma; adhaśchāyayā Su; °varṣat Da?,Ma,Su;

VALL

tato brahmāvartākhyaṃ janapadamadhaśchāyayā pratibimbena
saṃspṛśaṃstatkurukṣetraṃ yayāḥ| kṣatrapradhanapiśunaṃ 
rājanyakasamarasūcakam | adyāpi śaraśakaladyālokanāt |

yatra ca kṣatriyāṇāṃ tīkṣṇaśaraśatairarjuno vadanāni
abhyasiñcatsandhukṣayāmāsa nirbharīcakāra | bhavāniva
jalavṛṣṭibhirnalinānīti śarabāhulyakathanam || 48 ||

\daksināvarta

brahmeti ||

brahmāvartamiti madhyadeśe puṇyaḥ ko 'pi janapadaḥ| atra manuḥ 

śarasvatīdṛṣadvatyordavanadyoryadantaram |

taṃ devanirmitaṃ deśaṃ brahmāvartaṃ pracakṣate || iti | {2.17}

athānantaram | chāyayā gāhamāno 'nena tasya puṇyadeśatvāt
svarūpeṇākramaṇaṃ na yuktamiti sūcitam |

kṣatrapradhanapiśunaṃ | adyāpiśiraḥkapālādimattayā
pāṇḍavānāṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ yuddhasūcakam |

kauravaṃ kurūṇāṃ sambandhi |

rājanyānāṃ mūrdhābhiṣiktānām |

gāṇḍīdhanvārjunaḥ| dhanu"ścetyanaṅādeśaḥ| {p5.4.132}

mukhāni mukhagrahaṇamanekakarmāśrayatvātkṛtam || 48 ||

\mallinātha

brahmāvartamiti ||

athānantaraṃ brahmāvartaṃ nāma janapadaṃ deśam | atra manuḥ 
sarasvatīdṛṣadvatyordevanadyoryadantaram |

taṃ devanirmitaṃ deśaṃ brahmāvārtaṃ pracakṣate || iti | {2.17}

chāyayānātapamaṇḍalena gāhamānaḥ praviśanna tu svarūpeṇa |
pīṭhakṣetrāśramādīni parivṛtyānyato vrajediti vacanāt |
kṣatrapradhanapiśunamadyāpi śiraḥkapāla[a?]dimattayā
kurupāṇḍavayuddhasūcakamityarthaḥ| yuddhamāyodhanaṃ janyaṃ 
pradhanaṃ pravidāraṇamityamaraḥ|

tat prasiddhaṃ kurūṇāmidaṃ kauravaṃ kṣetraṃ bhajethāḥ|
kurukṣetraṃ vrajetyarthaḥ|

yatra kurukṣetre | gāṇḍyasyāstīti gāṇḍīvaṃ 
dhanurviśeṣaḥ| gāṇḍyajagātsañjñāyāmiti matvarthīyaḥ 
vapratyayaḥ {p5.2.110}| kapidhvajasya gāṇḍīvagāṇḍīvau
punnapuṃsakāvityamaraḥ| taddhanuryasya sa gāṇḍīvadhanvā
arjunaḥ| vā sam̐jñāyāmityanaṅādeśaḥ| śitaśaraśataiḥ 
niśitabāṇasahasrai rājanyānāṃ rājñāṃ mukhāni dhārāṇāṃ 
udakadhārāṇāṃ pātaiḥ kamalāni tvamivābhyavarṣadabhimukhaṃ 
vṛṣṭavān | śaravar.śeṇa śirāṃsi cicchedetyarthaḥ|| 51 ||
-48-

\sumativijaya

asya vyākhyā ||

bho megha tatkauravaṃ kṣetraṃ tīrthabhūtaṃ kurukṣetraṃ tvam
bhajethāḥ sevethāḥ|

kathambhūtaṃ kauravam kṣetram | kṣatrapradhanapiśunam |

bho megha tvaṃ kiṃ kurvānaḥ| adhaḥ kurukṣetrasyādhaḥ 
paścātbhāge vartamānaṃ brahmāvartaṃ janapadaṃ brahmāvartākhyaṃ 
deśaṃ gāhamāno 'vagāhyamānaḥ|

kayā | chāyayātmapratibimbena |

taditikim | gāṇḍīvadhanvā dhanañjayanāmā nṛpo yatra
kurukṣetre rājanyānāṃ mukhāni bhūpasamūhānāṃ vadanāni tvaṃ 
iva megha iva abhyavarṣadvṛṣṭaḥ|

kaiḥ| śitaśaraśataistīkṣṇabāṇaśatasaṅkhyāyuktaiḥ|

kathambhūtaiḥ śitaśaraśataiḥ| dhārāpātaiḥ 
dhāroparidhārāyāṃ patanaśīlaiḥ|

bho megha yathā tvaṃ kamalāni tīkṣṇajaladhārāśataiḥ kṛtvā
abhivarṣasivṛṣṭiṃ karoṣi tathā gāṇḍīvadhanvāpi |

ityanvayaḥ||

kṣatreti kṣatrāṇāṃ bhūpānāṃ pradhanasyasaṅgrāmasya
piśunaṃ kathakaṃ kṣatrapradhanapiśunam |

rājeti rājñāṃ gaṇā rājanyāsteṣāṃ rājanyānām |

śiteti śitāni tīkṣṇāni yāni śaraśatāni tīraśatasaṅkhyāni
śitaśaraśatāni taiḥ śitaśaraśataiḥ| etena kurukṣetrasya
avalokanaṃ meghasyoktam |

atropamālaṅkāraḥ|| 52 || -48-

