krauñcārātinā spardhamānaḥ paraśurāmaḥ krauñcācalaṃ śareṇa
sarandhramakarot | tena tasya mahatī kīrtirāsīt | tasmāt
bhṛgupatiyaśovartmetyuktam | yathāha murāriḥ 
{anargharāghava 4.55}

yadbāṇāvraṇavartmanā śikhariṇaḥ krauñcasya haṃsacchalāt

