prāleyeti ||

prāleyādrerhimādrerupataṭaṃ taṭasamīpe | avyayaṃ vibhakti
ityādinā samīpārthe 'vyayībhāvaḥ| tāṃstān | vīpsāyāṃ 
dviruktiḥ| viśeṣān draṣṭavyārthān | viśeṣo 'vayave dravye
draṣṭavyottanavastunīti śabdārṇave |

atikramyānusarergaccherityanāgatena sambandhaḥ| haṃsānāṃ 
