krauñcarandhreṇa sañcaranta ityāgamaḥ| bhṛgupateḥ 
jāmadagnyasya yaśovartma | yaśaḥpravṛttikāraṇamityarthaḥ|

yatkrauñcasyādreḥ randhramasti tena krauñcabilena baleḥ 
daityasya niyamane bandhane abhyudyatasya pravṛttasya viṣṇoḥ 
vyāpakasya trivikramasya śyāmaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ pāda iva
tiryagāyāmena kṣiprapraveśanārthaṃ tirascīnadairdhyeṇa śobhata 
iti tathāvidhaḥ sannudīcīmuttarāṃ diśamanusareranugaccha |

purā kila bhagavato devāddhūrjaṭerdhanurupaniṣadaṃ 
