\mallinātha

yatreti ||

yatrālakāyāṃ pādapā vṛkṣā nityāni puṣpāṇi yeṣāṃ te
tathā | na tu ṛtuniyamāditi bhāvaḥ| ata evonmattaiḥ 
bhramarairmukhārāḥ śabdāyamānāḥ|

nalinyaḥ padminyo nityāni padmāni yāsāṃ tāstathā| na tu
hemantavarjitamityarthaḥ| ata eva haṃsaśreṇibhiḥ 
racitaraśanāḥ| nityam haṃsapariveṣṭitā ityarthaḥ|

bhavanaśikhinaḥ krīḍāmayūrā nityaṃ bhāsvantaḥ kalāpāḥ 
barhāṇi yeṣāṃ tathoktāḥ| na tu varṣāsveva | ata eva
kekābhirutkaṇṭhā udgrīvāḥ|

pradoṣā rātryo nityā jyotsnā yeṣāṃ te | na tu śuklapakṣe eva
| ata eva pratihatā tamasāṃ vṛttirvyāptiryeṣāṃ te ca te
ramyāścetitathoktāḥ|| 3 || -65a-

ānandotthaṃ nayanasalilaṃ yatra nānyairnimittaiḥ 

nānyastāpaḥ kusumaśarajādiṣṭasaṃyogasādhyāt |

nāpyanyasmātpraṇayakalahādviprayogopapattiḥ  omit Va,Da;

vitteśānāṃ na ca khalu vayo yauvanādanyadasti || 65b ||  4 Ma;
71 Su;

anyatra Su;  declared prakṣipta by Ma;

\mallinātha

ānandeti ||

yatrālakāyāṃ vitteśānāṃ yakṣāṇām | vittādhipaḥ kuberaḥ 
syātprabhau dhanikayakṣayoriti śabdārṇave | ānandotthaṃ 
ānandajanyameva nayanasalilam | anyairnimittaiḥ śokādibhirna |

iṣṭasaṃyogena sādhyānnivartanīyāt | na tu apratīkāyāditi
arthaḥ| kusumaśarajānmadanaśarajādanyastāpo na asti
praṇayakalahādanyasmātkāraṇāt viprayogenopapattiḥ 
virahaprāptirapi nāsti |

kiṃ ca yauvanādanyadvayo vārdhakaṃ nāsti |

ślokadvayaṃ prakṣiptam || 4 || -65b-

yasyāṃ yakṣāḥ sitamaṇimayānyetya harmyasthalāni

jyotiśchāyākusumaracanānyuttamastrīsahāyāḥ|

āsevante madhu ratiphalaṃ kalpavṛkṣaprasūtaṃ 

tvadgambhīradhvaniṣu śanakaiḥ puṣkareṣvāhāteṣu || 66 ||  3 Da;
5 Ma; 74 Su;

śita° Su; °racitāni Da?,Ma;  prasūtim Su;

VALL

yasyāmalakāyāṃ nityaṃ varapurandhrisahitā guhyakeśvarāḥ 
saudhatalānyāgatya ratiphalaṃ na tu kalahādijanakaṃ kalpavṛkṣajaṃ madhu rasaṃ sevante |

kīdṛśāni sthalāni | sitamaṇimayāni sphāṭikāni | ata eva
jyotiśchāyāstārāvalipratibimbānyeva kusumaracanā puṣpaprakaro yeṣu |

kadāsevante | bhavata iva gambhīro nirhrādī dhvaniryeṣāṃ 
