\mallinātha

mandākinyā iti ||

yatrālakāyāmamaraiḥ prārthitāḥ sundarya ityarthaḥ|
kanyā yakṣakumāryaḥ| kanyāḥ kumārikānāryoriti viśvas |

mandākinyā gaṅgāyāḥ salilena śiśiraiḥ śītalairmarudbhiḥ 
