bhavanānāmantarantarbhavanam | avyayaṃ vibhaktītyādinā
avyayībhāvaḥ| akṣayyā antarbhavane nidhayo yeṣāṃ te tathā
uktāḥ| yathecchābhogasambhāvanārthamidam viśeṣaṇam |

