yathā tathā prāpyāpi viphalapreraṇā dīpanirvāpaṇākṣamatvāt
niṣphalakṣepā bhavati | atrāṅganānāṃ 
ratnapradīpanirvāpaṇapravṛttyā maugdhyaṃ vyajyate || 7 || -69- ?last
sentence?

gatyutkampādalakapatitairyatra mandārapuṣpaiḥ 

kḷptacchedyaiḥ kanakakamalaiḥ karṇavibhraṃśibhiśca |

muktālagnastanaparimalaiśchinnasūtraiśca hāraiḥ 

nāiśo mārgaḥ saviturudaye sūcyate kāminīnam || 70 ||  omits Da;
11 Ma; 75 Su;

patracchedais Ma; °visaṃsibhis Su;  °parimalacchinna° Su;given by the
editor of Da

muktājālaiḥ stanaparisaracchinnasūtrais Ma; before II.7 'matvā
devam'

VALL

yatrābhisārikāṇāṃ naiśo mārgaḥ prabhāte 'mībhiḥ sūcyata 
anumīyate vā |

kaiḥ| stanajaghanabhareṇa gatyutkampātkeśacyutaiḥ 
mandārakusumaiḥ| karṇabhraṣṭaiśca kanakanalinaiḥ kḷptacchedyaiḥ 
racitavicchittaviśeṣaiḥ| tathā muktāmaṇiṣu lagnaḥ stanaparimalaḥ 
kucāmodo yeṣāṃ taiśchinnasūtrairmuktāhāraiśca | tadetena
bhraṣṭābharaṇāgrahaṇena samṛddhiruktā |

chedanīyaṃ chedyaṃ patralatādi | kḷptaśabde kṛpo ro laḥ 
{p8.2.18} || 70 ||

?anumīyate vā?

\mallinātha

gatīti ||

yatrālakāyāṃ kāminīnāmabhisārikānāṃ | niśi bhavaḥ 
naiśo mārgaḥ saviturudaye sati gatyā gamanenotkampaścalanaṃ 
tasmāddhetoralakebhyaḥ patitairmandārapuṣpaiḥ suratarukusumaiḥ 
|

tathā patrāṇāṃ patralatānāṃ chedaiḥ khaṇḍaiḥ patitairiti
śeṣaḥ| tathā karṇebhyo vibhraśyantīti karṇanibhraṃśīni
taiśca kanakasya kamalaiḥ| ṣaṣṭhyā vivakṣitārthalābhe sati
mayaṭā vigrahe 'dhyāhāradoṣaḥ| evamanyatrāpi anusandheyam |

tathā muktājālairmauktikasaraiḥ| śironihitairityarthaḥ|

tathā stanayoḥ parisaraḥ pradeśastatra chinnāni sūtrāṇi yeṣāṃ 
tairhāraiśca sūcyate jñāpyate |
mārgapatitamandārakuṣumādiliṅgairayamabhisārikāṇām panthāḥ 
ityanumīyata ityarthaḥ|| 11 || -70-

vāsaścitraṃ madhu nayanayorvibhramādeśadakṣaṃ 

puṣpodbhedaṃ saha kisalayairbhūṣaṇānāṃ vikalpān |

lākṣārāgaṃ caraṇakamalanyāsayogyaṃ ca yasyāmomit Va,Da;

ekaḥ sūte sakalamabalāmaṇḍanaṃ kalpavṛkṣaḥ|| 70a ||  12 Ma; 72
Su;

given by the editor of Da

between II.7 and II.8

\mallinātha

kacadhāryaṃ dehadhāryaṃ paridheyaṃ vilepanam |

caturdhā bhūṣaṇaṃ prāhuḥ strīṇāmanyacca daiśikam || iti
rasākare |

tadevaitadāha vāsa iti ||

yasyāmalakāyāṃ citraṃ nānāvarṇaṃ vāso vasanam |
paridheyamaṇḍanametat |

nayanayorvibhramāṇāmādeśa upadeśe dakṣaṃ | anena
vibhramadvārā madhuno maṇḍanatvamanusandheyam | tacca
maṇḍanādivaddehadhārye 'ntarbhāvyam | madhu madyam |

kisalayaiḥ pallavaiḥ saha puṣpodbhedamubhayaṃ cetyarthaḥ|
idaṃ tu kacadhāryam |

bhūṣaṇānāṃ vikalpānviśeṣān | dehadhāryametat |

tathā caraṇakamalayornyāsasya samarpaṇasya yogyam | rajyate 'nena
iti rāgo rajakadravyam | lākṣaiva rāgastaṃ lākṣārāgaṃ ca
| cakāro 'ṅkarāgādivilepanamaṇḍanopalakṣaṇārthaḥ|

sakalam sarvam | caturvidhamapītyarthaḥ| abalāmaṇḍanaṃ 
yoṣitprasādhanajātam | ekaḥ kalpavṛkṣa eva sūte janayati | na tu
nānāsādhanasampādanaprayāsa ityarthaḥ|| 12 || -70a-

patraśyāmā dinakarahayaspardhino yatra vāhāḥ 

śailodagrāstvamiva kariṇo vṛṣṭimantaḥ prabhedāt |

yodhāgraṇyaḥ pratidaśamukhaṃ saṃyuge tasthivāṃsaḥ|  omit Va,Da;

pratyādiṣṭābharaṇarucayaścandrahāsavraṇāṅkaiḥ|| 70b ||  13
Ma; 69 Su;

śaṣpa° Su;

\mallinātha

patreti ||

he jalada yatrālakāyaṃ vāhā hayāḥ patraśyāmāḥ 
palāśavarṇās | ata eva dinakarahayaspardhino varṇato vegataḥ 
ca sūryāśvakalpāḥ| tathā śailodagrāḥ śailavadunnatāḥ 
kariṇaḥ prabhedānmadasrāvāddhetostvamiva vṛṣṭimantaḥ|

agraṃ nayantītyagraṇyaḥ| satsūdviṣetyādinākvip |
agragrāmābhyāṃ nayateriti vaktavyāṇṇatvam | yodhānāṃ 
agraṇyo bhaṭaśreṣṭāḥ saṃyuge yuddhe pratidaśamukhaṃ 
abhirāvaṇaṃ tasthivāṃsaḥ sthitavantaḥ| ata eva candrahāsayas
rāvaṇāservraṇāni kṣatānyevānṅkāścihnāni taiḥ|
candrahāso ravaṇāsāvasimātre 'pi ca kvaciditiśāśvataḥ|
pratyādiṣṭābharaṇarucayaḥ pratiṣiddhabhūṣaṇakāntayaḥ|
śastraprahārā eva vīrāṇāṃ bhūṣaṇamiti bhāvaḥ|

atrāpi bhāvikāla"mkāraḥ|| 13 || -70b-

matvā devaṃ dhanapatisakhaṃ yatra sākṣādvasantaṃ 

prāyaścāpaṃ na vahati bhayānmanmathaḥ ṣaṭpadajyam |

sabhrūbhaṅgaprahitanayanaiḥ kāmilakṣyeṣvamodhaiḥ 

tasyārambhaścaturavanitāvibhramaireva siddhaḥ|| 71 ||  7 Da;
14 Ma; 81 Su;

manmathaḥ ṣaṭpadajyam (Da),Ma,Su;  tvāmapi prekṣya kāmas Da;

°bhaṅgaṃ prahita° Su; siddhis Da,Su;

VALL

yatra puryāṃ sākṣādāsīnaṃ haramavetya smaraḥ ṣaṭpadajyaṃ ṣaṭpadamaurvīkaṃ dhanuḥ prāyeṇa trāsānnādatte |
svavyāpārānna kuruta ityarthaḥ|

kathaṃ tarhi mithuneṣvanyonyaṃ premetyāha | 
tasya kāmacāpasyārambho vyāpāraḥ pravīṇāṅganavilāsaireva sampadyate |

kīdṛśaiḥ| kāmilakṣyeṣu sabhrūbhaṅgāni prahitāni kṣiptāni
nayanāni yeṣu | tathāmodhairavandhyaiḥ kāryakāribhiḥ| tat
etena yuvatiprāvīṇyamuktam || 71 ||

\daksināvarta

matvā devaṃ dhanapatisakhamiti |

anena vaiśravaṇasakhyātkailāse nityaṃ śivo vasatītyuktam |

prāya utprekṣāyāmidamavyayam |

manye śaṅke dhruvaṃ prāyo nūnamityevamādibhiḥ|

utprekṣā vyajyate śabdairivaśabdo 'pi tādṛśaḥ|| iti
alaṅkāre |

bhayāttvāmapi prekṣya kāma iti pāṭhaḥ| virahiṇāṃ 
protsāhakāriṇaṃ bhavantam prekṣyāpītyarthaḥ|

mayi taṃ deśaṃ praviṣṭe madanavyāpāraḥ kathaṃ bhaviṣyatīti
āśaṅkyāhasabhrūbhaṅgaprahitanayanairiti |

tasyārambhastasya pravṛttiḥ siddhiḥ siddho bhaviṣyatīti
arthaḥ|

tvāmapi prekṣyetyanena meghasambandha uktaḥ| manmathaḥ 
ṣaṭpadajyamiti pāṭhe pūrvaślokeṣviva meghasambandho na syāt
|| 7 || -71-

\mallinātha

matveti ||

yatrālakāyāṃ manmathaḥ kāmaḥ|

dhanapateḥ kuberasya sakheti dhanapatisakhaḥ| rājāhaḥsakhibhyaḥ 
ṭac | taṃ devaṃ mahādevaṃ sākṣādvasantaṃ sakhisnehāt
nijarūpeṇa vartamānaṃ matvā jñātvā bhayādbhālekṣaṇabhayāt
ṣaṭpadā eva jyā maurvīyasya tam cāpaṃ prāyaḥ prācuryeṇa na
vahati na bibharti |

kathaṃ tarhi tasya kāryasiddhirata āha sabhrūbhaṅgeti |

tasya mamathasyārambhaḥ kāmijanavijayavyāpāraḥ sabhrūbhaṅgaṃ 
prahitāni prayuktāni nayanāni dṛṣṭayo yeṣu taistathoktaiḥ 
kāmina eva lakṣyāṇi teṣvamodhaiḥ saphalaprayogairityarthaḥ 
| manmathacāpo 'pi kvacidapi modhaḥ syāditi bhāvaḥ|

caturāśca tās vanitāśca tāsāṃ vibhramairvilāsaireva
siddho niṣpannaḥ| yadanarthakaraṃ pakṣikaphalaṃ ca tat
progādvaraṃ niścitasādhanaprayoga itibhāvaḥ|| 14 || -71-

tatrāgāraṃ dhanapatigṛhānuttareṇāsmadīyaṃ 

dūrāllakṣyaṃ tadamaradhanuścāruṇā toraṇena |

yasyopānte kṛtakatanayaḥ kāntayā vardhitas me

hastaprāpyastavakanamito bālamandāravṛkṣaḥ|| 72 ||  8 Da; 15 Ma;
82 Su;

°gṛhāt (Va),(Ma),Su;tvadamara° Da;  surapati° Ma,Su;°stabaka° Ma;

VALL

tatraivamvidhāyāmalakāyāṃ dhanapatigṛhānuttareṇa
rājarājaveśmānyuttareṇa tadasmākamagāram gṛham |

abhijñānānyāha | śakracāparamyeṇa toraṇena dūrādapi dṛśyam
|

yasya copānte nikaṭe bālo mandāravṛkṣo 'sti |

kīdṛśaḥ| madīyayā priyayā sekādinā poṣitaḥ| yataḥ 
kṛtakatanayaḥ putrīkṛtaḥ| bālatvācca karagrāhyairgucchaiḥ 
namrībhūtaḥ|

uttareṇetyenabantaḥ {comp:p5.3.35} | tadyoge ca gṛhāniti
enapā dvitīyā {p2.3.31} | pañcamyantaḥ pāṭhastvanarthaḥ|| 72
||

\daksināvarta

tatreti ||

tasyāmalakāyām | itaḥ paraṃ pañcasu ślokeṣu yayā kayācana
vidhayā meghasambandhamuktvā svagṛhasya lakṣaṇamāha | vakṣyati
caibhiḥ sādho hṛdayanihitairlakṣaṇairlakṣayethā iti {77}|

dhanapatigṛhānuttareṇeti pāṭhaḥ| dhanapatigṛhān
vaiśravaṇagṛhān | gṛhāḥ puṃsi ca bhūmnyevetyamaraḥ|
uttareṇottarataḥ samīpe | enabanyatarasyāmadūre 'pañcamyāḥ 
ityenappratyayaḥ {p5.3.35} | enapā dvitīyeti dvitīyā {p2.3.31}
|

kṛtakatanayaḥ kṛtrimaputrakaḥ| bālamandāravṛkṣaḥ 
bālakalpavṛkṣaḥ| tvadamaradhanuscāruṇā toraṇeneti
meghasambandha uktaḥ|| 8 || -72-

\mallinātha

itthamalakāṃ varṇayitvā tatra svabhāvasyābhijñānamāha
tatreti ||

tatrālakāyāṃ dhanapatigṛhānkuberagṛhānuttareṇottarasmin
adūradeśe | enabanyatarasyāmadūre 'pañcamyā ityenappratyayaḥ 
{p5.3.35} | enapā dvitīyeti dvitīyā {p2.3.31} | gṛhāḥ puṃsi ca
bhūmnyevetyamaraḥ| dhanapatigṛhāditipāṭha uttareṇa
itinainappratyayāntaḥ kiṃ tu toraṇenetyasya viśeṣaṇaṃ 
tṛtīyāntam | dhanapatigṛhānuttarasyāṃ diśi yattoraṇaṃ 
bahirdvāraṃ te lakṣitamityarthaḥ|

asmākamidamasmadīyam | vṛddhāccha itipakṣe chapratyayaḥ|
agāraṃ gṛham | surapatidhanuścāruṇā maṇimayatvāt
abhraṅkaṣatvāccendracāpasundareṇa toraṇena bahirdvāreṇa
dūrāllakṣyaṃ dṛśyam | anenābhijñānena dūrata eva jñātuṃ 
śakyamityarthaḥ|

abhijñānātaramāha | yasya agārasya upānte prākārāntaḥ 
pārśvadeśe me mama kāntayā vardhitaḥ poṣitaḥ kṛtakatanayaḥ 
kṛtrimasutaḥ| putratvenābhimanyamānamityarthaḥ| hastena
prāpyairhastāvacayaiḥ stabakairgucchairnamitaḥ| syāt
gucchakastu stabaka ityamaraḥ| bālamandāravṛkṣaḥ 
kalpavṛkṣo 'stītiśeṣaḥ|| 15 || -72-

vāpī cāsminmarakataśilābaddhasopānamārgā

haimaiḥ syūtā  kamalamukulaiḥ snigdhavaiḍūryanālaiḥ|

yasyāstoye kṛtavasatayo mānasaṃ sannikṛṣṭaṃ 9 Da;

na dhyāsyanti vyapagataśucastvāmapi prekṣya haṃsāḥ|| 73 ||
16 Ma; 83 Su;

sphītā Da; channā Ma,Su;  vikacakamalais Ma,Su; °dīrgha° Da?;
°vaidurya° Da,Ma;

nādhyāsyanti Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

abhijñānantarāṇyāha |

asminnasmadgṛhe vāpī padminī vidyate |

kīdṛśī | marakatamaṇiśilābhirbaddho racitaḥ sopānamārgaḥ 
yasyāḥ| tathā snigdhairvaiḍūryamaṇibhireva nālo daṇḍaḥ 
yeṣāṃ tairhaimaiḥ sauvarṇaiḥ padmamukulaiḥ syūtāprotā
sambaddhā | vāpyāṃ hi padmairbhāvyam |

yasyāśca toye kṛtavasatayo haṃsāstvāmapi prekṣya
varṣāsamaye 'pi nikaṭamapi mānasaṃ saro na dhyāsyantina
smariṣyanti | yato vyapagataśucaḥ| tatraivopadravābhāvāt
nirduḥkhāḥ|

hemaśabdo rajatādis {comp:p4.3.154} || 73 ||

\daksināvarta

vāpīti ||

asmin agāre | sphītā puṣṭā | yasyāstoya iti yasyāṃ 
kṛtavasataya iti vaktavye toyagrahaṇaṃ varṣākāle 'pi toyasya
prasādātiśayasūcakam | ādhyāsyantīti pāṭhaḥ| ādhyānaṃ 
utkaṇṭhā | ādhyānamutkaṇṭhotkalike same ityamaraḥ|

tvāmapi prekṣyetyanena meghasambandha uktaḥ|| 9 || -73-

\mallinātha

itaḥ paraṃ caturbhiḥ ślokairabhijñānāntaramāha vāpīti ||

asminmadīyāgāre marakataśilābhirbaddhaḥ sopānamārgo yasyāḥ 
sā tathoktā |

vidure bhavā vaidūryāḥ| vidūrāññya iti ñyapratyayas |
vaidūryāṇāṃ vikārā vaidūryāṇi | vikārārthe 'ṇpratyayaḥ|
snigdhāni vaidūryāṇi nālāni yeṣāṃ tairhaimaiḥ sauvarṇaiḥ 
vikacakamalaiśchannā vāpī cāstīti śeṣaḥ| yasyā vāpyāḥ 
toye kṛtavasatayaḥ kṛtanivāsā haṃsāstvāṃ meghaṃ prekṣya
api vyapagataśuco varṣākāle 'pi vyapagatakaluṣajalatvāt
vītaduḥkhāḥ santaḥ sannikṛṣṭaṃ sannihitam | sugamamapīti
arthaḥ| mānasaṃ mānasasaro nādhyāsyanti notkaṇṭhayā
smariṣyanti | ādhyānamutkaṇṭhāpūrvakaṃ smaraṇamiti
kāśikāyām || 16 || -73-

yasyāstīre nicitaśikharaḥ peśalairindranīlaiḥ 

krīḍāśailaḥ kanakakadalīveṣṭanaprekṣaṇīyaḥ|

madgehinyāḥ priya iti sakhe cetasā kātareṇa  10 Da;

prekṣyopāntasphuritataḍitaṃ tvāṃ tameva smarāmi || 74 ||17
Ma; 84 Su;

tasyās Da,Ma,Su;  vihita°  Da; racita° Ma,Su;

VALL

yasyā vāpyāstīra evamvidhaḥ krīḍāśailo 'sti |

kīdṛśaḥ| peśalairmanojñairindranīlamaṇibhirnicitaśikharaḥ 
baddhaśṛṅgaḥ| kanakamayīnāṃ ca kadalīlatānāṃ veṣṭena
parivalanena prekṣaṇīyo ramyaḥ|

ataśca matpriyāyāḥ kānta iti nikaṭollasitaśatahradaṃ bhavantaṃ 
ālokya sādṛśyāttamevādriṃ kātareṇa adhīreṇa manasā
smarāmi | sādṛśyātpriyatvācca smaraṇam | kātaratvaṃ tu
virahavaśāt | śeṣatvāvivakṣayā tamityadhīgartheti
ṣaṣṭyabhāvaḥ {p2.3.52} || 74 || ?sakhe?

\daksināvarta

tasyā iti ||

peśalaiścārubhiḥ| cārau dakṣe peśala ityamaraḥ|
madgehinyāḥ priya iti itiśabdo hetau | tameva krīḍāśailameva
| upāntasphuritataḍitaṃ tvāṃ prekṣya kātareṇa cetasā tameva
smarāmītyanvayaḥ|

atra meghasambandhaḥ spṛṣṭaḥ|| 10 || -74-

\mallinātha

tasyā iti ||

tasyā vāpyāstīre peśalaiścārubhiḥ| cārau dakṣe ca
peśala ityamaraḥ| indranīlai racitaśikharaḥ 
indranīlamaṇimayaśikhara ityarthaḥ| kanakakadalīnāṃ 
veṣṭanena paridhinā prekṣaṇīyo darśanīyaḥ krīḍāśailaḥ 
astīti śeṣaḥ|

he sakha upānteṣu prānteṣu sphuritāstaḍito yasya tattathā
uktam | idaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ kadalīsāmyārthamuktam |
indranīlasāmyaṃ tu meghasya svābhāvikamityanena sūcyate |

tvāṃ prekṣya madgehinyāḥ priya iti hetostasya śailasya
madgṛhiṇīpriyatvāddhetorityarthaḥ|

kātareṇa bhītena cetasā | bhayaṃ cātra sānandameva |
vastūnāmanubhūtānāṃ tulyaśravaṇadarśanāt | śravaṇāt
kīrtanādvāpi sānandā bhīryathā bhavediti rasākare
darśanāt | tameva krīḍāśailameva | evakāraḥ 
viṣayāntaravyavacchedārthaḥ| sadṛśavastvanubhavāt
iṣṭārthasmṛtirjāyata ityarthaḥ| ata evātra
smaraṇākhyo 'laṅkāraḥ| taduktaṃ sadṛśānubhavāt
anyasmṛtiḥ smaraṇamucyata iti | niruktakārastu tvām tameva
smarāmīti yojayitvā meghe śailatvāropamācaṣṭe | tat
asaṅgatamadarayākārāropasya purovartinyanubhavātmakatvena
smaratiśabdaprayogānupapatteḥ śailatvabhāvanāsmṛtirityapi na
upapadyate | bhāvanāyāḥ smṛtitve pramāṇābhāvādanubhavāyogāt
sādṛśyopanyāsasya vaiyarthācca visadṛśe 'pi śālagrāma 
haribhāvanādadarśanāditi || 17 || -74-

raktāśokaścalitakisalayaḥ kesaraścātra kāntaḥ 

pratyāsannau kuravakavṛtermādhavīmaṇḍapasya |

ekaḥ sakhyāstava saha mayā vāmapādābhilāṣī  11 Da;

kāṅkṣatyanyo vadanamadirāṃ dohadacchadmanāsyāḥ|| 75 ||
18 Ma; 85 Su;

kurabaka° Ma; dohala° Da;

VALL

atra keliparvate raktāśokakesaratarū pallavitau staḥ|

kuravakavṛkṣairvṛtirvarṇikā kaṇṭhī yasya tasya
mādhavīlatāmaṇḍapasya pratyāsannau savidhau | yayoścaiko 'śokastava sakhyā madgehinyā vāmapādābhilāṣī |
caraṇaprahārānugraheṇa tasya vikāsāt | mayā saha | 
ahamapi sāparādhastadīyaṃ pādaprahāramabhilaṣāmītyarthaḥ|
aparo bakulo dohadacchadmanā sekābhilāṣavyājenāsyā matpreyasyā vadanamadirāṃ kāṅkṣati | 
taruṇīmukhāsavasekena
tasya vikāsāt | mayā saha | ahamapi tadīyāṃ vadanamadirāṃ 
kāṅkṣāmītyarthaḥ|

aśokādīnāṃ praśastatvādupādānam || 75 || ?ca?

\daksināvarta

rakteti ||

kesaro bakulaḥ| kuravakavṛteḥ kuravaka eva vṛtirāvaraṇam
