tanmadhye gṛhamadhye | sphaṭikaphalakā sphaṭikamayī nivāsaphalakā
yasyāḥ| sphaṭikaphalakopādānaṃ mayūrasya śītapriyatvāpekṣayā
kṛtam | anatiprauḍhavaṃśaprakāśaiḥ 
taruṇaveṇukādaṇḍasamānavarṇaiḥ| śiñjāvalayasubhagairiti |
śiñjā śiñjitaṃ śiñjāvanti valayāni śiñjāvalayāni |
śākhāvṛkṣavatsamāsaḥ| śiñjadvalayasubhagairiti pāṭhe |
śiñja avyakte śabda ityayaṃ dhāturātmepadī | tasmāt
