meghasambandha uktaḥ|| 12 || -76-

\mallinātha

tanmadhya iti ||

kiṃ ceti cārthaḥ| tanmadhye tayorvṛkṣayormadhya 
anatiprauḍhānāmanatikaṭhorāṇāṃ vaṃśānāṃ prakāśa iva
prakāśo yeṣāṃ taistaruṇaveṇusacchāryairmaṇibhiḥ 
marakataśilābhirmūle baddhā | kṛtavediketyarthaḥ|

sphaṭikaṃ sphaṭikamayaṃ phalakaṃ pīṭhaṃ yasyāḥ sā |
kāñcanasya vikāraḥ kāñcanī sauvarṇī vāsayaṣṭiḥ 
nivāsadaṇḍo 'stīti śeṣaḥ| śiñjā bhūṣaṇadhvaniḥ|
bhūṣaṇānāṃ tu śiñjitamityamaraḥ| bhidāditvādaṅ |
śiñjidhāturayaṃ tālavyādirna tu dantyādiḥ|
śiñjāpradhānāni valayāni taiḥ subhagā ramyāstaiḥ| tālaiḥ 
karatalavādanairme mama kāntayā nartito vo yuṣmākaṃ suhṛt
sakhā nīlakaṇṭho mayūraḥ| mayūro barhiṇo barhī
nīlakaṇṭho bhujaṅgabhugityamaraḥ|

divasavigame sāyaṅkāle yāṃ yaṣṭikām adhyāste | yaṣṭyāmāste
ityarthaḥ| adhiśīṅsthāsāṃ karmeti karmatvāddvitīyā |

