\daksināvarta

ebhiriti ||

sādho vidvan | lakṣaṇaiścihnaiḥ|

lakṣayethāḥ paśyerityarthaḥ| śaṅkhapadmau śaṅkhapadmākhyau
nidhiviśeṣau | nidhirnā śevadhirbhedāḥ śaṅkhapadmādayaḥ 
nidherityamaraḥ| lakṣayateḥ karmādarśanāllakṣayestaditi
kecitpaṭhanti | tasminpāṭhe taditi pūrvoktamagāram
parāmṛśyate |

idānīmātmīyaṃ tadbhavanaṃ saṃsmṛtya viṣaṇṇa āha
kṣāmacchāyamiti kṣāmakānti | abhikhyāṃ śobhām || 13 || -77-

\mallinātha

ebhiriti ||

he sādho nipuṇa | sādhuḥ samartho nipuṇas veti kāśikāyām |
hṛdayanihitairavismṛtairityarthaḥ| ebhiḥ pūrvoktaiḥ 
lakṣaṇaistoraṇādibhirabhijñānairdvāropānte | ekavacanaṃ 
avivakṣitaṃ dvārapārśayorityarthaḥ| likhite vapuṣyākṛtī
yayostau tathoktau śaṅkhapadmau nāma nidhiviśeṣau | nidhirnā
śevadhirbhedāḥ padmaśaṅkhādaya ityamaraḥ| 
dṛṣṭvā ca nūnaṃ satyamadhunedānīm | adhuneti nipātaḥ| madviyogena
mama pravāsena kṣāmacchāyaṃ mandacchāyamutsavoparamāt
kṣīṇakānti bhavanaṃ madgṛhaṃ lakṣayethāḥ|

tathā hi sūryāpāye sati kamalaṃ padmaṃ svāmātmīyāṃ 
abhikhyāṃ śobhām | abhikhyā nāmaśobhayorityamaraḥ| na
puṣyati nopacinoti khalu | sūryavirahitaṃ padmamiva pativirahitam
gṛhaṃ na śobhata ityarthaḥ|| 20 || -77-

