vilasitaṃ sphuraṇaṃ tatsadṛśīm || 78 ||

\daksināvarta

gatveti ||

śīghrasampātahetostīvrasampātahetoḥ|

prathamakathite tasyāstīre vihitaśikhara iti pūrvokte {74} |

ratnasānāvidaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ saudāmanīdarśane 'pi ratnaprabhā
iti tasyā vṛddhijananāya kṛtam |

vidyudunmeṣadṛṣṭiṃ vidyudunmeṣo vidyutsphuraṇaṃ tadeva
dṛṣṭiriti vidyutunmeṣadṛṣṭiḥ|| 14 || -78-

\mallinātha

nijagṛhaniścayānantaraṃ kṛtyāha gatveti ||

he megha śīghrasampāta eva hetustasya | śīghrapraveśārthaṃ 
ityarthaḥ| ṣaṣṭhī hetuprayoga iti ṣaṣṭhī | sampātaḥ patane
vege praveśe vedasamvida iti śabdārṇave |

sadyaḥ sapadi kalabhasya karipotasya tanuriva tanuryasya tasya
bhāvastāmalpaśarīratāṃ gatvā prāpya prathamakathite tasyāḥ 
tīra ityādinā pūrvoddiṣṭe ramyasānau {74} | niṣīdanayogya iti
arthaḥ| krīḍāśaile niṣaṇṇa upaviṣṭaḥ san |

alpā alpaprakārā bhāḥ prakāśo yasyāstāṃ | prakāre

guṇavacanasyeti dviruktiḥ|

khadyotānāmālī tasyā vilasitena sphuritena nibhāṃ samānāṃ 
vidyudunmeṣo vidyutprakāśaḥ sa eva dṛṣṭistām bhavanasāntaḥ 
antarbhavanaṃ tatra patitāṃ praviṣṭāṃ kartumarhasi |

yathā kaścitkiñcidanviṣyankvacidunnate sthitvā śanaiḥ 
śanairatitarāṃ drāghīyasīṃ dṛṣṭimiṣṭadeśe pātayati
tadvadityarthaḥ|| 21 || -78-

tanvī śyāmā śikharadaśanā pakvabimbādharauṣṭhī

madhye kṣāmā cakitahariṇaprekṣanī nimnanābhiḥ 

śroṇībhārādalasagamanā stokanamrā stanābhyāṃ 

yā tatra syādyuvativiṣaye sṛṣṭirādyeva dhātuḥ|| 79 ||
