Da,Ma,Su;

matsaṃyogaḥ sukhamupanayes Su;

VALL

dīrghoṣṇatvādoṣṭhapallavadāhinocchvāsenālakaṃ nunaṃ 
utkṣipantīmapāsyantīm |

kīdṛśam | śuddhasnānātpānīyamātrābhiṣekena paruṣaṃ rūkṣam
| yadi hi sā maṅgalārthaṃ kadācitsnāti tat
surabhitailāmalakādiśūnyena toyamātreṇa |

āgaṇḍaṃ lambata ityāgaṇḍalambaṃ kapolasrastam |

tathā mayā sahecchāratairyā niśā kṣaṇavadativāhitā tāṃ 
evoṣṇairbāṣpairvirahaśayyāyāṃ rodanena māsamiva
yāpayantīṃ nayantīm || 88 ||

\daksināvarta

niḥśvāseneti ||

vikṣipantīṃ calayantīm | 
śuddhasnānādgandhāmalakādirahitasnānāt | paruṣamasnigdham | 
āgaṇḍalambaṃ gaṇḍāvadhi lambamānamityarthaḥ| upanamedupagacchet |
nayanasalilotpīḍaruddhāvakāśāṃ bāṣpaughaniruddhanidrāvasarām ||
23 || -88-

\mallinātha

niḥśvāseneti ||

śuddhasnānāttailādirahitasnānātparuṣaṃ kaṭhinasparśaṃ 
nūnamāgaṇḍalambam | supsupeti samāsaḥ| alakaṃ 
cūrṇakuntalān | jātāvekavacanam |

adharakisalayaṃ kleśayatikliśnātīti vā tena tathoktena |
uṣṇenetyarthaḥ| kliśyateḥ ṇyantātkliśnateraṇyantāt
vā tācchīlye ṇiniḥ| niḥśvāsena vikṣipantīṃ cālayantīm |

tathā svapnajo 'pisvapnāvasthājanyo 'pi |
sākṣātsambhogāsambhavāditi bhāvaḥ| matsambhogaḥ kathaṃ kena
api prakāreṇopanamedāgacchet | atyāśayeneti śeṣaḥ| iti
naivoktārthatvādaprayogaḥ| prayoge cāpaunaruktyamiti
ālaṅkārikāḥ| prārthanāyāṃ liṅ |

nayanasalilotpīḍenāśrupravṛttyā ruddhāvakāśāṃ 
ākrāntasthānām | durlabhāmityarthaḥ| nidrāmākāṅkṣantīm
| snehānuratvāditi bhāvaḥ| atrāśruvisarjanena lajjātyāgaḥ 
vyajyate || 32 || -88-

pādānindoramṛtaśiśirāñjālamārgapraviṣṭān

pūrvaprītyā gatamabhimukhaṃ sannivṛttaṃ tathaiva |

cakṣuḥ khedātsajalagurubhiḥ pakṣmabhiśchādayantīṃ 25 Da;

sābhre 'hnīva sthalakamalinīṃ na prabuddhāṃ na suptām || 89 ||
31 Ma; 99 Su;

pūrvam Su; api tatas Da;khedāccakṣus Su; salila° Da?,Ma,Su;

naprabuddhāṃ nasuptām Da?,Ma; prabuddhaprasuptām Su;

VALL

sabāṣpatvādgurubhirduḥsahaiḥ pakṣmabhirlomabhiḥ khedāt
cakṣurācchādayantīṃ sthagayantīm |

kīdṛśam | pīyūṣaśītalānvātāyanapraviṣṭānindoḥ pādān
kiraṇānpūrvaprītyā sammukhaṃ gataṃ prasṛtam | tataḥ 
madviraheṇa khedakāritvāttathaivasannivṛttam | yadvadeva
rabhasādgataṃ tadvadeva pratyāgatamityarthaḥ|

ataścākṣṇoḥ sthaganānna prabuddhāṃ na suptām |
netranimīlanātprabodhābhāvo nidrābhāvaśca svāpaśūnyatayā |
ataśca sābhre 'hani sthalakamalinīmivetyupamā | sā hi
sābhratvānna prabuddhā dinavaśācca na suptā |

pūrvaivātra vākyatraye kriyā || 89 ||

\daksināvarta

pādāniti ||

pūrvaprītyā pūrvakālasnehena | gatamapīndoḥ pādānprāptaṃ 
api |

tataḥ sannivṛttaṃ tathaiveti pāṭhaḥ| tata indupādebhyaḥ|
sannivṛttaṃ svayameva sannivṛttaṃ khedādvirahavyasanāt|
pūrvakālaprītyā candrakiraṇāngatvā tebhyo virahakhedāt
yathāgataṃ nivṛttaṃ cakṣurityarthaḥ|

pakṣmabhirakṣiromabhiḥ|

sābhre 'hni meghacchanne dine |

na prabuddhāṃ na suptāṃ sthalakamalinī sūryakiraṇaspṛṣṭā
vikasati meghacchannaiḥ kiraṇairaspṛṣṭā nimīlati ca || 25 || -89-

\mallinātha

pādāniti ||

jālamārgapraviṣṭāngavākṣavivaragatānamṛtaśiśirānindoḥ 
pādānraśmīnpūrvaprītyā pūrvasnehena | pūrvavat
ānandakarā bhaviṣyatīti buddhyeti bhāvaḥ|

abhimukhaṃ yathā tathā gataṃ tathaiva sannivṛttaṃ yathā gataṃ 
tathaiva pratinivṛttam | tadā teṣāmatīva duḥsahatvāditi
bhāvaḥ| cakṣurdṛṣṭiṃ khedātsalilagurubhiraśrudurbhareṇa
pakṣmabhiśchādayantīm |

ata eva sābhre durdine 'hni divase naprabuddhāṃ meghāvaraṇāt
avikasitāṃ nasuptāmaharityamukulitām | ubhayatrāpi
nañarthasya naśabdasya supsupeti samāsaḥ| sthalakamalinīmiva
sthitām |

etena viṣayadveṣākhyā ṣaṣṭhī daśā sūcitā || 31 || -89-
?tadā?supsupā?

jāne sakhyāstava mayi manaḥ sambhṛtasnehamasmāt

itthambhūtāṃ prathamavirahe tāmahaṃ tarkayāmi |

vācālaṃ māṃ na khalu subhagammanyabhāvaḥ karoti  27 Da; 34 Ma;

pratyakṣaṃ te nikhilamacirādbhrātaruktaṃ mayā yat || 90 ||
101 Su;

sakalam Da;

VALL

kathamevaṃvidhāmetāmasvasthāmavaiṣītyāha ||

tasyā bhavadvayasyāyā yato mayi manaḥ sambhṛtasnehaṃ 
atiprītimadataḥ kāraṇāditthambhūtāmevaṃvidhāṃ daśāṃ 
avāptāṃ tāmahamādyaviyoge tarkayāmyutprekṣe |

na ca sneha eva tvayi tasyā nāstīti vaktum yujyata ityāha |

subhagamiṣṭamātmānaṃ manyate subhagammanyastadbhāvo māṃ 
naiva vācālaṃ yatkiñcanabhāṣiṇaṃ kurute | tasmādyattava
mayoktametadaśeṣaṃ tava acirātpratyakṣam | avaśyaṃ tvaṃ 
evaṃvidhāṃ tāṃ dvitrairdinairdrakṣyasītyarthaḥ|| 90 ||
?jāne?bhrātar?

\daksināvarta

sā tvadvirahe khinnāṃ daśāṃ prāptuṃ kiṃ kāraṇamiti
āśaṅkyāha jāna iti ||

itthambhūtāṃ pūrvoktaduḥkāvasthām |

bhavānsaubhāgyenaivamāhetyāśaṅkyāha vācālaṃ māṃ 
iti | subhagammanyabhāvaḥ| subhagaśabdopapadānmanyaterdhātoḥ 
ātmamāne kha"śceti khaś {p3.2.83} | arurdviṣadajantasya muṃ 
subhagammanyaḥ| tasya bhāvaḥ subhagammanyabhāvaḥ {p6.3.67} |

pratyakṣaṃ te sakalamiti mayā uktamidaṃ sarvaṃ tavācireṇa
pratyakṣaṃ bhaviṣyatītyarthaḥ|| 27 || -90-

\mallinātha

nanvīdṛśīṃ daśāmāpanneti kathaṃ tvayā niścitamataḥ 
āha

jāna iti ||

he megha tava sakhyā mano mayi sambhṛtasnehaṃ sañcitānurāgaṃ 
jāne | asmātsnehajñānakāraṇātprathamavirahe |
prathamagrahaṇaṃ duḥkhātiśayadyotanārtham | tāṃ tvatsakhīṃ 
itthambhūtāṃ pūrvoktāvasthāmāpannām tarkayāmi |

nanu subhagamānināmeṣa  svabhāvo yadātmani strīṇāṃ 
anurāgaprakaṭanaṃ tatrāha vācālamiti | subhagamātmānaṃ 
manyata iti subhagammanyaḥ| ātmanāne kha"śceti khaśpratyayaḥ 
{p3.2.83} | arurdviṣadityādinā mumāgamaḥ {p6.3.67} | tasya bhāvaḥ 
subhagammanyabhāvaḥ subhagamānitvaṃ māṃ vācālaṃ bahubhāṣiṇaṃ 
na karoti khalu | saundaryābhimānitā na prakaṭayāmītyarthaḥ|
syājjalpākastu vācālo vācāṭo bahugarhyavāgityamaraḥ|
ālajāṭacau bahubhāṣiṇītyālacpratyayaḥ| kiṃ tu he bhrātaḥ 
mayoktam yadadhikṣāmāmityādi {87} tannikhilaṃ sarvaṃ 
acirācchīghrameva te tava pratyakṣam bhaviṣyatīti śeṣaḥ||
34 || -90-

sā sannyastābharaṇamabalā pelavaṃ dhārayantī

śayyātsaṅge nihitamasakṛdduḥkhaduḥkhena gātram |

tvāmapyasraṃ navajalamayaṃ mocayiṣyatyavaśyaṃ 26 Da;

prāyaḥ sarvo bhavati karuṇāvṛttirārdrāntarātmā || 91 ||  33
Ma; 100 Su;

peśalam Ma,Su; āsram Da; aśrum Su;

VALL

sābalā kṛśāṅgīdṛśaṃ deham vahantī niścetanamapi tvāṃ 
navajalamayamasramavaśyaṃ tyājayiṣyati |

kīdṛśaṃ gātram | pelavaṃ kṛśaṃ sukumāram | ata eva
sannyastābharaṇaṃ tyaktamaṇḍanam | tathā talpapṛṣṭhe nikṣiptaṃ 
apyatikleśena bibhratī |

yadyevaṃvidhā sā kimityahaṃ rodimītyāha |

yasmādya ārdrāntarātmā sarasacittaḥ sa sarvaḥ prāyeṇa
karuṇāvṛttiḥ kṛpāśīlo bhavati | tvaṃ ca sajalatvāt
ārdrāntaraḥ|

karuṇā kṛpaiva vṛttirvyāpāro yasya sa karuṇāvṛttiḥ|
kṛpārthavṛtteḥ karuṇāśabdasya bhāṣitapuṃskatvābhāvānna
puṃvadbhāvaḥ| duḥkhaduḥkhenetyādhikye dvirvacanam |

duheriva mucerapi dvikarmakatvāttvāmasraṃ mocayiṣyatīti ||
91 || ?asakṛt?

\daksināvarta

seti ||

sānyastābharaṇaṃ śarīrasadāttyaktābharaṇam | pelavaṃ mṛdu |

tvāmapyāsraṃ navajalamayaṃ mocayiṣyatyavaśyamiti tathā
duḥkhitāṃ dṛṣṭvā tvamapyavaśyam bāṣpaṃ mokṣyasīti
arthaḥ| karuṇāvṛttiḥ karuṇāmayacittavṛttiryasya |

ārdrāntarātmā meghasya jalārdrāntarātmatvaṃ vivakṣitam || 26 ||
-91-

\mallinātha

seti ||

abalā durbalā sanyastābharaṇaṃ kṛśatvātparityaktābharaṇaṃ 
asakṛdanekaśo duḥkhaduḥkhena duḥkhaprakāreṇa | prakāre
guṇavacanasyeti dvirbhāvaḥ| śayyotsaṅge nihitaṃ peśalaṃ 
mṛdulaṃ śarīraṃ dhārayantī vahantī | anenātyantāśaktyā
mūrchāvasthā sūcyate |

sā tvatsakhī tvāmapi navajalamayaṃ navāmburūpamasraṃ bāṣpaṃ 
avaśyaṃ sarvathā mocayiṣyati | dvikarmasu  pacādīnāṃ 
upasaṅkhyānamiti muceḥ pacāditvāddvikarmatvam |

tathā hi prāyaḥ prāyeṇa ādrāntarātmā mṛduhṛdayaḥ| meghastu
dravāntaḥśarīraḥ| sarvaḥ karuṇāmayī vṛttiḥ 
antḥkaraṇavṛttiryasya sa karuṇāvṛttirbhavati hi yasmāt | asmin
avasare sarvathā tvayā śīghraṃ gantavyamanantaradaśāparihārāya
iti sandarbhābhiprāyaḥ|

nanu kimidamādimaṃ cakṣuḥprītimupekṣyāvasthāntarāṇi eva
tatrabhavānkavirādṛtavān | ucyate

sambhogo vipralambhaśca dvidhā śṛṅgāra ucyate |

saṃyuktayostu sambhogo vipralambho viyuktayoḥ||

pūrvānurāgamānākhyapravāsakaruṇātmanā |

vipralambhaścaturdhātra pravāsastatra ca tridhā ||

kāryataḥ sambhramācchāpādasminkāvye tu śāpajas |

prāgasaṅgatayoryūnoḥ sati pūrvānurañjane ||

cakṣuḥprītyādayo 'vasthā daśa syustatkramo yathā |

dṛṅmanaḥsaṅgasaṅkalpā jāgaraḥ kṛśatā ratiḥ||

hrītyāgonmādamūrchāntā ityanaṅgadaśā daśa |

pūrvasaṅgatayoreva pravāsa iti kāraṇāt ||

na tatrāpūrvavaccakṣuḥprītirutpattumarhati |

tatsaṅgasya tu siddhasyāpyavicchedo 'tra vardhyate ||

anyathā pūrvavadvācyeti tāvadvyavasthiteḥ|

vaiyārthyādādimāṃ hitvā vairasyādantimām tathā ||

hṛtsaṅgādirihācaṣṭa kaviraṣṭāviti sthitiḥ|

matsādṛśyam likhantīti padye 'smin pratipāditā |

cakṣuḥprītiriti proktaṃ niruttarakṛtānanam |

cakṣuḥprītirbhaveccitreṣvadṛṣṭacaradarśanāt |

yathā mālavikārūpamagnimatrāsya paśyataḥ|

proṣitānāṃ ca bhartr̤ṇāṃ dṛṣṭādṛṣṭapūrvatā ||

atha tatrāpi sandehe svakalatrāṇi pṛcchatu |

kiṃ bhartṛpratyabhijñā syātkiṃ vaideśikabhāvanā ||

pravāsādāgate svasminnityalaṃ kalahairvṛthā || iti || 33 ||
-91-

ruddhāpāṅgaprasaramalakairañjanasnehaśūnyaṃ 

pratyādeśādapi ca madhuno vismṛtabhrūvilāsam |

tvayyāsanne nayanamuparispandi śaṅke mṛgākṣyāḥ 

mīnakṣobhākulakuvalayaśrītulāmeṣyatīti || 92 ||  28 Da; 35 Ma;
102 Su;

vāmam Da;  manye mīnoccala° Da; mīnakṣobhāccala° Ma,Su;

VALL

bhavati nikaṭasthe sati tasyā hariṇanayanāyā netraṃ 
uparispanditvādanimeṣotphalanacaṭulotpalaśobhāsāmyaṃ prāpsyati
ityāśaṅke sambhāvayāmīti śubhasūcanam |

strīṇāṃ hi vāmākṣisphuraṇamānandamāsannamāha |

kīdṛśaṃ nayanam | lambairalakai ruddhāpāṅgaprasaraṃ 
nivṛttakaṭākṣakṣepam | śokāccāñjanasnehena rahitam | tathā
madyasya varjanādviskhalitabhrūvilāsam || 92 ||

\daksināvarta

ruddhāpāṅgaprasaraṃ ruddhāpāṅge prasaras yasya | apāṅgaḥ 
netrāntaḥ| añjanasnehaśūnyamañjanena snehaḥ snigdhatvaṃ 
añjanasnehastena śūnyam |

