\daksināvarta

tasminniti ||

tasmin niśīthe kāle matsandeśaiḥ sukhayitumalaṃ paśya sādhvīṃ 
niśītha ityuktatvāt {86} |

labdhanidrāsukhā syāditi sā satataṃ virahavedanādanidrā bhavati
daivādyadi suptā syādityarthaḥ|

anvāsya yāmamātram sahasveti | nanu virahiṇāṃ yāmamātraṃ 
svāpo na bhavati | uktaṃ ca tribhāgaśeṣāsu niśāsu ca kṣaṇaṃ 
nimīlya netre sahasā vyabudhyateti | satyamidam | na tat
svāpāpekṣayā yāmamātrapadaṃ prayuktaṃ kiṃ tu sambhogāpekṣayā |
sambhogasya paramāvadhirekavāras yāmāvasāyika iti
kāmatantravido vadanti | tathā rativilāse paramā tu ratiryūnāṃ 
iṣṭā yāmāvasādhikīti |

sadyaḥ kaṇṭhacyutabhujalatāgranthīti padacchedaḥ|
gāḍhopagūḍhaṃ gāḍhaliṅganam || 30 || -94-

\mallinātha

tasminniti ||

he jalada tasminkāle tvadupasarpaṇakāle sā matpriyā labdhaṃ 
nirdrāsukhaṃ yayā tādṛśī syādyadi syāccet | enāṃ 
nidrāṇāmanvāsya | paścādāsitvetyarthaḥ|
upasargavaśātsakarmakatvam | stanitavimukho garjitaprāṅmukhaḥ 
niḥśabdaḥ san | anyathā nidrābhaṅgaḥ syāditi bhāvaḥ|

yāmamātraṃ praharamātram | dvau yāmapraharau samāvityamaraḥ|
sahasva pratīkṣasva | prārthanāyāṃ loṭ | śaktayoḥ 
ekavārasuratasya yāmāvadhikatvātsvapne 'pi tathā bhavitavyamiti
abhiprāyaḥ| tathā ca ratisarvasve ekavārāvadhiryāmo ratasya
paramo mataḥ| caṇḍaśaktimatoryūnoradbhutakramavartinoriti |

yāmasahanasya prayojanamāha mā bhūditi | asyāḥ priyāyāḥ 
praṇayini preyasi mayi kathañcit kṛcchreṇa svapnalabdhe sati |
gāḍhopagūḍhaṃ gāḍhāliṅganam | napuṃsake bhāve ktaḥ| sadyaḥ 
tatkṣaṇaṃ kaṇṭhāccyutaḥ srasto bhujalatayorgranthirbandhaḥ 
yasya tanmā bhūnmāstu | kathañcillabdhasyāliṅganasya
sadyo vighāto mā bhūdityarthaḥ|

