tāmāyuṣmānmama ca vacanādātmanā copakartuṃ 

brūyādevaṃ tava sahacaro rāmagiryāśramasthaḥ|

avyāpannaḥ kuśalamabale pṛcchati tvāṃ viyuktaḥ 34 Da;

pūrvāśāsyaṃ sulabhavipadāṃ prāṇināmetadeva || 98 ||  41 Ma;
107 Su;

āyuṣman Da,Ma,Su; vacanaracanām Su; ātmanas Da,Ma,Su;

upakartus Da; bruyās Da,Ma; °ābhāṣyam Ma,Su;

VALL

āyuṣmānbhavānmadīyena vacasā [ca?] svayaṃ copakartuṃ tāṃ 
itthaṃ brūyādvadet |

yathā tava sahacaraḥ patiścitrakūṭāsīno 'vyāpanno jīvan
tvāṃ kuśalaṃ pṛcchatīti |

kimityubhayagatakuśalakathanamevādāvityāha |

yasmātsuprāpavipattīnāṃ śarīriṇāmetadeva pūrvāśāsyaṃ 
prathamakāṅkṣaṇīyaṃ yatsvāsthyaṃ nāma |

āyuṣmāniti vacane kartṛpadaṃ na tvāmantraṇaṃ brūyāditi
prathamapuruṣaprayogāt |

āśāsyaśabde 'nupasargādhikārādetistuśāsvriti kyababhāvaḥ 
{p3.1.109} || 98 || ?ca - ca?abale?viyuktas?

\daksināvarta

tāmiti ||

āyuṣmannityanena tvayi jīvati sāham ca jīvā cetyuktam |

ātmanaścopakarturiti pāṭhaḥ| upakarturupakāriṇaḥ|

mama vacanāccāyuṣmannupakāriṇastava vacanācca tāmevaṃ 
brūyā ityarthaḥ|

meghavacanaprakāramāha tava sahacaro rāmagiryāśramastha iti |
āśramapadaṃ tatrāpi tapasviprāya eva vartata iti dyotayituṃ 
prayuktam | atredamanusandheyaṃ tava sahacara ityādi manmukhena
idamāhetyantaṃ vākyajātam meghasya vacanam | ataḥ paraṃ 
śyāmāsvaṅgamityādivacanaṃ yakṣasya ceti |

pūrvāśāsyaṃ sulabhavipadāṃ prāṇināmetadevetisvayaṃ 
avyāpannaḥ san priyajanaṃ prati kuśalapraśnaṃ karotīti yadetatsulabhavipadāṃ prānṇināṃ prathamaprārthanīyamityarthaḥ|| 34
|| -98-

\mallinātha

samprati sandiśati tāmiti ||

he āyuṣman | praśaṃsāyām matup | paropakāraślāghyajīviteti
arthaḥ| mama vacanaṃ prārthanāvacanaṃ tasmāccātmanaḥ svasya
upakartuṃ ca | paropakāreṇātmānaṃ kṛtārthayitumityarthaḥ|
upakārakriyāṃ prati karmatve 'pi tasyopakarotītyādivat
sabandhamātrā vivakṣāyāmātmana iti ṣaṣṭhī na virudhyate |
yathāha bhāraviḥ sā lakṣmīrupakurute yayā pareṣāmiti |
yathā śrīharṣaśca sādhūnāmupakartuṃ lakṣmīṃ draṣṭuṃ 
vihāyasā gantumiti | tathā ca kvacatkvaciddvitīyādarśanāt
sarvasya tatheti nāthavacanamanāthavacanameva |

tām priyāmevaṃ brūyāḥ|

kimityāha he abale tava sahacaro bhartā rāmagireḥ 
citrakūṭasyāśraṃeṣu tiṣṭhatīti rāmagiryāśramasthaḥ san |
avyāpanno na mṛta ityarthaḥ| amaraṇe hetumāhaviyuktaḥ 
viyogaḥ prāpto duḥkhī saṃstvām kuśalaṃ pṛcchati |
duhyāditvātpṛcchaterdvikarmatvam |

tathā hi sulabhavipadāmayatnasiddhanipattīnāṃ prāṇināmetat
eva kuśalameva pūrvābhāṣyaṃ prathamamavaśyaṃ praṣṭavyam |
kṛtyāścetyāvaśyakārthe ṇyatpratyayaḥ|| 41 || -98-

aṅgenāṅgaṃ tanu ca tanunā gāḍhataptena taptaṃ 

sāsreṇāsradravamaviratotkaṇṭhamutkaṇṭhitena |

uṣṇocchvāsaṃ samadhikatarocchvāsinā dūravartī  35 Da;

saṅkalpaiste viśati vidhinā vairiṇā ruddhamārgaḥ|| 99 ||  42 Ma;
107 Su;

na tu ca Da; pratanu Ma,Su; asradrutam Da,Ma;  aśrudravam Su; °khara° Da;
tais Su;

VALL

tataḥ kimityāha ||

tava preyāndūravartī saṅkalpairutkaṇṭhāvaśādaṅgenāṅgaṃ 
viśati vapuṣā tvaddehaṃ praveṣṭumicchati | tvayaikyaṃ 
yiyāsatītyarthaḥ| bhinnayoścaikyaṃ sārūpyādbhavatīti
tayoraṅgayostanu ca tanuneti pṛthagviśeṣaṇaiḥ 
sādṛśyakathanena samānurāgatāmāha |

asraṃ dravatītyasradravam | padāditvādac |

kasmādātmanā nāyātītyāha | vidhureṇa vidhinā
ruddhavartmā | viyogasya varśabhogyatvāt | tanu ca tanuneti
cārthābhāvātpratanu tanuneti paṭhanīyam || 99 ||
?incomplete?contradiction?

\daksināvarta

aṅgeneti ||

aṅgena śarīreṇa | kīdṛśena śarīreṇa

kīdṛśamityapekṣāyāmāha na tu ca tanuneti | cakāraḥ 
prativiśeṣaṇamākhyātasambandhaṃ kartuṃ prayuktaḥ|

aṅgasya tanutve nidānamāha gāḍhataptena taptamiti |

tāpasya kimabhivyañjakamityapekṣāyāmāha sāsreṇeti |

āsradrutamiti pāṭhaḥ| drutāsramityarthaḥ| āhitāgnyādiṣu
pāṭhātsādhutvam |

āsrasya kiṃ nimittamityapekṣāyāmāhāviratotkaṇṭhaṃ 
utkaṇṭhitena | ātmadharmā apyutkaṇṭhādayaḥ śarīre 'pi
prayujyante | uktaṃ ca tvayyāyattaṃ kṛṣiphalamiti bhrūkārān
abhijñairiti {16} |

utkaṇṭhāyāḥ kimabhivyañjanakamityapekṣāyāmāha
uṣṇocchvāsamiti |

samadhikakharocchvāsineti pāṭhaḥ| kharamuṣṇam | tigaṃ 
tīvraṃ kharaṃ tīkṣṇaṃ caṇḍamuṣṇaṃ paṭu smṛtamiti
bhaṭṭahalāyudhaḥ| ucchvāsaśabdena niḥśvāso vivakṣitaḥ|

saṅkalpaistairiti saṅkalpairmānasakarmābhūtaiḥ 
tanutvatāpādiviśiṣṭaiḥ śarīrāvasthāntaraiḥ|

kimarthamevam karotītyāśaṅkyāha vidhinā vairiṇā
ruddhamārga iti || 35 || -99- ?kīdṛśena śarīreṇa?

\mallinātha

aṅgeneti ||

kiṃ ca | dūravartīdūrasthaḥ|

na cāgantum śakyata ityāha vairiṇā virodhinā vidhinā daivena
ruddhamārgaḥ pratibaddhavartmā sa te sahacarastanunā kṛśena
gāḍhataptenātyantasantaptena sāsreṇa sāśruṇā |

utkaṇṭhā vedanāsya jātotkaṇṭhitaṃ tenotkaṇṭhitena |
tadasya sañjātamityādinetacpratyaya utkaṇṭhervā kartari
ktaḥ| samadhikataramadhikamucchvāsitīti samadhikatarocchvāsi
tena | dīrghaniḥśvāsinetyarthaḥ| tācchilye ṇiniḥ|

aṅgena svaśarīreṇa pratanu kṛśaṃ taptaṃ viyogaduḥkhena santaptaṃ 
aśrudrutamaśruklinnam | aśru netrāmbu rodanam cāsramasru ca
ityamaraḥ|

aviratotkaṇṭhamavicchinnavedanamuṣṇocchvāsaṃ tīvraniḥśvāsam
| tigmaṃ tīvraṃ kharaṃ tīkṣṇaṃ caṇḍamuṣṇaṃ samaṃ smṛtaṃ 
iti halāyudhaḥ| aṅgaṃ tvadīyaṃ śarīraṃ taiḥ svasaṃvedyaiḥ 
saṅkalpairmanorathairviśati | ekībhavatītyarthaḥ|

atra samarāgitvadyotanāya nāyakena nāyikāyāḥ samānāvasthatvaṃ 
uktam || 35 || -99-

śabdākhyeyaṃ yadapi kila te yaḥ sakhīnāṃ purastāt

karṇe lolaḥ kathayitumabhūdānanasparśalobhāt |

so 'tikrāntaḥ śravaṇaviṣayaṃ locanānāmagamyaḥ 36 Da;

tvāmutkaṇṭhāviracitapadaṃ manmukhenedamāha || 100 ||  43 Ma;
109 Su;

locanābhyām adṛṣṭas Da,Ma, ~adṛśyas Su;

VALL

sa tava priyo manmukhenedam vakṣyamāṇam tvāmāha bravīti |

sa kaḥ| yatkila śabdākhyeyaṃ prakaṭavācyaṃ tadapi
sakhīsannidhāne vyājaṃ vidhāya yastava karṇe vaktuṃ lolaḥ 
sakāṅkṣa āsīt |

kuto hetoḥ| ānanasparśalobhāt | karṇe kathanaṃ hi tasya
tvanmukhasparśasukhānubhavāya |

kīdṛśaḥ saḥ| śravaṇaviṣayamatikrānto 'prāptaḥ 
dūrasthatvāt | ata eva locanānāmagamyo netrairdraṣṭuṃ 
aśakyaḥ| utkaṇṭhayā viracitāni padāni śabdā yatreti
kathanaviśeṣaṇam || 100 ||

\daksināvarta

śabdeti ||

śabdākhyeyaṃ śabdā evākhyeyamabhidheyam yasya tat
śabdākhyeyaṃ nirarthakamityarthaḥ|

sakhīnāṃ purastāditi vacanaṃ janākīrṇatvāt
nirvyājānanasparśadaurlabhyāduktam |

śravaṇaviṣayaṃ śravaṇadeśam anyonyavārtāśravaṇadeśamiti
arthaḥ| utkaṇṭhāviracitapadamutkaṇṭhāmadhikṛtya
viracitaśabdamityarthaḥ| idaṃ vakṣyanāṇaṃ kāmatantroktāni
virahiṇīsadṛśāvalokanacitrakarmasvapnasamāgamatadaṅgaspṛṣṭasparśanāni
catvāri vinodanāni uktānīti anusandheyam | yathā guṇapatākāyām

viyoge cāyoge priyajanasadṛkṣānugamanam

tataścitrālokaṃ svapanasamaye darśanamapi |

tadaṅgaspṛṣṭānāmupagatavatāṃ sparśamiti

pratīkāraḥ kāmavyathitamanasāṃ ko 'pi gaditaḥ|| iti || 36 ||
-100-

\mallinātha

samprati svāvasthanivedanāya prastauti ||

śabdākhyeyamiti ||

he abale yaste priyaḥ sakhīnāṃ purastādagra ānanasparśe
tvanmukhasamparke lobhādgārdhyāt | adharapānalobhādityarthaḥ|

śabdākhyeyaṃ śabdena raveṇākhyeyamuccairvācyamapi yattat
vacanamapīti śeṣaḥ| karṇe kathayituṃ lolo lālaso 'bhūt
kila | lolupo lolubho lolo lālaso lampaṭo 'pi ceti
yādavaḥ|

śravaṇaviṣayaṃ karṇapathamatikrāntaḥ| tathā locanābhyāṃ 
adṛṣṭaḥ| atidūratvādadraṣṭuṃ śrotuṃ ca na śakya iti
bhāvaḥ|

sa te priyastvāmutkaṇṭhayā viracitāni padāni
suptiṅantaśabdā vākyāni vā yasya tattathoktam | padaṃ 
śabde ca vākye ceti viśvaḥ| idaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ 
śyāmāsvaṅgamityādikaṃ manmukhenāha | manmukhena sa eva
brūta ityarthaḥ|| 43 || -100- ?iti arthas - iti bhāvas?

śyāmāsvaṅgaṃ cakitahariṇaprekṣite dṛṣṭipātaṃ 

gaṇḍacchāyāṃ śaśini śikhināṃ varhabhāreṣu keśān |

utpaśyāmi pratanuṣu nadīvīciṣu bhruvilāsān37 Da;

hantaikasthaṃ kvacidapi na te bhīru sādṛśyamasti || 101 ||44
Ma; 110 Su;

°hariṇī° Su; prekṣite or prekṣaṇe?  Va; prekṣaṇe Da?,Ma;  °pātān
Su;

vaktra° Da?,Ma,Su;  barha° Da,Ma,Su; °patākām Da; °patākās (Ma);
ekasmin Ma; caṇḍi Da,Ma;

VALL

idaṃ kimityāha ||

he bhīru kātare tava sārūpyamekasthaṃ kaṣṭa kvacidapi na
vidyate |

yadālokyātmānaṃ samāśvāsayeyam |

tathā hi śyāmālatāsu tavāṅgamutprekṣe | tadvattanutvāt |

cakitahariṇaprekṣaṇe ca dṛṣṭipātam | trastasāraṅgavaccaṭulāvalokanāt |

evamuttaratra yathāyathaṃ yojyam |

kapolakāntiṃ mṛgāṅka utpaśyāmi | mayūrāṇām kalāpāṭopeṣu
kacabharam | sūkṣmasaritkalloleṣu bhrūvilāsān|

bhīrvityanvarthaṃ nāma nārīṇām | sañjñāpūrvako vidhiḥ 
anitya iti hrasvaguṇābhāvaḥ 
{comp:Paribhāṣenduśekhara93.1/p7.3.108}|| 101 ||

\daksināvarta

teṣu priyāsadṛśāvalokanamāha śyāmāsviti |

śyāmāsu priyaṅgalatāsu | utpaśyāmyutprekṣe | pratanuṣu
atiśayena tanvīṣu |

bhrūpatākāṃ patākā dhvajaṃ bhrūreva patākā bhrūpatākā |
bhruvaḥ patākātvena rūpaṇaṃ bhāvādisūcaktvāt |

hanta viṣāde | ekasthamekasya sthitam |

caṇḍi atyantakopane | anenaikatra sādṛśaṃ labdhaṃ cet bhavati
tadevālaṃ bhavatikiṃ mayā kāryamiti mahyam māṃ kupyeti
parihāsābhiprāyeṇa prayuktam |

sadṛśameva sādṛśyaṃ pūrvodāhṛtānāṃ sadṛśavācitvāt || 37
|| -101- ?mahyam-mām?

\mallinātha

sādṛśyapratikṛtisvapnadarśanatadaṅgaspṛṣṭasparśākhyāni
catvāri virahiṇām vinodasthānāni | tathā coktaṃ guṇapatākayām

viyogāvasthāsu priyajanasadṛśānubhavanam

tataścitraṃ karma svapanasamaye darśanamapi |

tadaṅgaspṛṣṭānāmupanatavatāṃ darśamapi

pratīkāro 'naṅgavyathitamanasāṃ ko 'pi gaditas || iti |

tatra sadṛśavastudarśanamāha syāmāsviti ||

śyāmāsu priyaṅgulatāsu | śyāmā tu mahilāhvayā | latā govandanī
gundrā priyaṅguḥ phalinī phalīti amaraḥ| aṅgaṃ śarīraṃ 
utpaśyāmi | saukumāryādisāmyāṅgamiti tarkayāmītyarthaḥ|

tathā cakitaharīṇām prekṣaṇe te dṛṣṭipātam |

śaśini vaktracchāyām mukhakāntiṃ tathā śikhināṃ barhiṇāṃ 
barhabhāreṣu barhasamūheṣu keśān pratanuṣu svalpāsu nadīnāṃ 
vīciṣu | atra vīcīnāṃ viśeṣaṇopādāne nānuktaguṇagrahaḥ 
doṣaḥ| bhrūsāmyanirvāhāya mahattvadoṣanirākaraṇārthatvāt
tasyeti | taduktaṃ rasaratnākare dhyanyutpāde guṇotkarṣe
bhogoktau doṣavāraṇe | viśeṣaṇādi doṣasya nāsti
anuktaguṇagraha iti | bhrūvilāsān | bhrūpatākā iti pāṭhe
bhruvaḥ patākā iva ityupamitasamāsaḥ| utpaśyāmīti sarvatra
sambadhyate |

tathāpi nāsti manonirvṛtiratyāśayenāha hanteti | hanta
viṣāde | hanta harṣe 'nukapāyāṃ vākyārambhaviṣādayoriti
amaraḥ|

he caṇḍi kopane | caṇḍastvatyantakopana ityamaraḥ|
gaurāditvānnīṣ | upamānakathanamātreṇa na kopitavyamiti
bhāvaḥ|

kvacidapi kasminnapyekasminvastuni te tava sādṛśyaṃ nāsti |
ato na nirvṛṇomītyarthaḥ| anenāsyāḥ saundaryamanupamaṃ 
itivyajyate || 44 || -101-

tvāmālikhya praṇayakupitāṃ dhāturāgaiḥ śilāyāṃ 

ātmānaṃ te caraṇapatitaṃ yāvadicchāmi kartum |

asraistāvanmuhurupacitairdṛṣṭirālipyate me  38 Da;

krūrastasminnapi na sahate saṅgamaṃ nau krṭāntaḥ|| 102 ||  45
Ma; 112 Su;

aśrais Su; ālupyate Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

bhavantīṃ praṇayakupitāṃ prītyā ruṣitāṃ dhāturāgaiḥ 
sindūrādirāgairdṛṣatsvālikhya prārthanayātmānaṃ tava
pādagataṃ kartuṃ yāvadicchāmi tāvattvadākārasya smaraṇāt
bāśpairasakṛdupacitairvṛddhaiścakṣuṣī mamācchādyete |

ataśca tasminnapi tvadākāre tatrāpi citre krūro viṣamaḥ 
vidhirnāvāvayoḥ samāgamaṃ na kṣamate || 102 ||

\daksināvarta

citradarśanamāha tvāmiti ||

dhāturāgairdhātvākhyāñjanadravyaiḥ| ātmānam mām |
tasminnapi ālekhye 'pi | nāvavayoḥ| kṛtānto daivam || 38 || -102-

\mallinātha

samprati pratikṛtidarśanamāha tvāmiti ||

he priye praṇayena premātiśayena kupitāṃ kupitāvasthāyuktāṃ tvām
| tvatpratikṛtimityarthaḥ|

dhāturbhavādiśabdādigaurikādiṣvajādiṣviti yādavaḥ| ta 
eva rāgā rañjakadravyāṇi | citrādirañjakadravye lākṣadau
praṇayecchayoḥ| sāraṅgādau ca rāgaḥ syādāruṇye rañjane
pumāniti śabdārṇave |

tairdhāturāgaiḥ śilāyāṃ śilāpaṭṭa ālikhya nirmāya |
ātmānaṃ māṃ matpratikṛtimityarthaḥ| te tava citragatāyāḥ 
ityarthaḥ| caraṇapatitaṃ kartum tathā lekhituṃ yāvadicchāmi
tāvadicchāsamakālaṃ muhurupacitaiḥ pravṛddhairasraiḥ 
aśrubhiḥ kartṛbhiḥ| asramaśruṇi śoṇita iti viśvaḥ| me
dṛṣṭirālupyata āvriyata ityarthaḥ| tataḥ 
dṛṣṭipratibandhanāllekhanaṃ pratibadhyata iti bhāvaḥ|

kiṃ bahunā | krūro ghātukaḥ| nṛśaṃso ghātukaḥ krūra iti
amaras | kṛtānto daivam | kṛtāntaḥ 
yamasiddhāntadaivākuśalakarmasviti amaraḥ| tasminnapi citre 'pi |
nāvāvayoḥ| yuṣmadasmadoḥ ṣaṣṭhīcaturthīdvitīyāsthayoḥ 
vāmnāvaunāvadeśaḥ {p8.1.20} | saṅgamaṃ sahavāsaṃ na sahate |
saṅgamalekhanamapyāvayorasahamānaṃ daivamāvayoḥ saṅgaṃ na
sahata iti kimu vaktavyamityapiśabdārthaḥ|| 45 || -102-

dhārāsiktasthalasurabhiṇastvanmukhasyāsya bāle

dūrībhūtaṃ pratanumapi māṃ pañcabāṇaḥ kṣiṇoti |

gharmānta vai vada baṭa kathaṃ vāsarāṇi vrajeyuḥ 

diksaṃsaktapravitataghanavyastasūryātapāni || 102a ||  omit Va,Da,Ma;
111 Su;

kṣaṇoti Su; asmin vigaṇaya kāle, ~vigamaya Su;  mentioned by Kāle and
Hultzsch

°pravirala° Su;

\mallinātha (the commentary is that of the Telugu version given by Hultzsch)

dhārābhirudakadhārābhiḥ siktaṃ yatsthalaṃ bhūstadiva
surabhiṇaḥ parimalavatastvanmukhasya tvadānanasya dūrībhūtaṃ 
dūrastham | ata eva pratanumatikṛśam | tathābhūtamapi māṃ 
pañcabāṇaḥ| pañca bāṇāḥ śarā aravindādayo yasya saḥ|
manmathaḥ kṣiṇoti bādhate | kṣiṇoterlaṭ |

gharmānte vai grīṣmānte tu | varṣākāla ityarthaḥ| dikṣu
samyaksaktāḥ saṃsaktā apratiralā medurāśca ye ghanāḥ 
meghāstairavyaktaḥ sūryasyātapo yeṣu tāni vāsarāṇi |
kathaṃ kena prakāreṇa vrajeyurgaccheyurbata kaṣṭaṃ vada brūhi
|| 45a || -102a-

māmākāśapraṇihitabhujaṃ nirdayāśl.esahetoḥ 

labdhāyāste kathamapi sati svapnasandarśaneṣu |

paśyantīnāṃ na khalu bahuśo na  sthalīdevatānāṃ 

muktāsthūlāstarukisalayeṣvasruleśāḥ patanti || 103 ||  39 Da;
46 Ma; 113 Su;

mayā Da?,Ma,Su;  tuhinakaṇikācchadmanā devatānām (Da);aśru°
Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

he sati guṇavati tava svapne daivavaśātprāptāyāḥ 
gāḍhāliṅganāyākāśa śūnya eva prasāritabhujaṃ 
vīkṣamāṇānāṃ vanadevatānāṃ drumapallaveṣu mauktikapṛthavaḥ 
bāṣpakaṇā asakṛtkhalu na patantyapi tu bhraśyantyeva |
tādṛśī me daśāmālokya tā api kṛpayā rudantitarāmiti
arthaḥ|| 103 ||

\daksināvarta

svapnasamāgamamāha māmiti ||

sambhāvanārthaṃ nañdvayaṃ prayuktam |

sthalīdevatānāṃ tarukisalayeṣviti vakṣyamāṇatvāt
vanaśabdaprayogaḥ| tarukisalayeṣvidam patitānāmaśruleśānāṃ 
prakāśanāya prayuktam | svapnasandarśane kathamapi lapsyamānāyāḥ 
tava nirdayāśleṣahetoḥ svāpātprāgevākāśapraṇihitabhujaṃ 
mām dṛṣṭvā karuṇarasāviddhahṛdayā vanasthalīdevatā baṣpam
muñcantītyarthaḥ|

anye tu paśyantīnāṃ tuhinakaṇikācchadmanā devatānāmiti
pāṭhamādṛtya vyācakṣate | idaṃ rasāvahaṃ na bhavati |
kāmārtasya tattvaṃ vihāya vyājabaṣpamocanavarṇanasyāyuktatvāt
|| 39 || -103- ?vanaśabda?

\mallinātha

adhunā svapnadarśanamāha māmiti ||

suptasya vijñānaṃ svapnaḥ| svapnaḥ suptasya vijñānamiti viśvaḥ 
| sandarśanaṃ saṃvit | darśanaṃ samaye śāstre dṛṣṭau svapna 
akṣṇi saṃvidīti śabdārṇave | svapnasandarśanāni
svapnajñānāni | cūtavṛkṣādivatsāmānyaviśeṣabhāvena
sahaprayogaḥ|

teṣu mayā kathamapi mahatā prayatnena labdhāyā gṛhītāyāḥ|
dṛṣṭāyā iti yāvat |

te tava nirdayāśleṣo gāḍhaliṅganaṃ sa eva hetustasya |
nirdayāśleṣārthamityarthaḥ| ṣaṣṭhī hetuprayoga iti
ṣaṣṭhī |

ākāśe nirviṣaye praṇihitabhujaṃ prasāritabāhuṃ mām
paśyantīnāṃ sthalīdevatānāṃ muktā mauktikānīva sthūlāḥ 
aśruleśā bāṣpabindavastarukisalayeṣu| anena celāñcalena
aśrudhāraṇasamādhirdhvanyate | khalu bahuśo na patantīti na
kiṃ tu patantyevetyarthaḥ|

niścaye nañdvayaprayogaḥ| tathā cādhikārasūtraṃ 
smṛtiniścayasiddhārtheṣu nañdvayaprayogaḥ siddha iti |
mahātmagurudevānāmaśrupātaḥ kṣitau yadi |

deśabhraṃśo mahadduḥkhaṃ maraṇam ca bhaveddhruvamiti |

kṣitau devatāśrupātaniṣedhadarśanādyakṣasya
maraṇābhāvasūcanārthaṃ tarukisalayeṣu patantītyuktam || 46 ||
-103-

bhittvā sadyaḥ kisalayapuṭāndevadarudrumāṇāṃ 

ye tatkṣīrasrutisurabhayo dakṣiṇena pravṛttāḥ|

āliṅgyante guṇavati mayā te tuṣārādrivātāḥ 40 Da;

pūrvaspṛṣṭaṃ yadi kila bhavedaṅgamebhistaveti || 104 ||  47
Ma; 114 Su;

pūrvaṃ spṛṣṭam Ma,Su;

VALL

he guṇavati śīlānvite saralatarūṇāṃ tatkṣaṇaṃ 
pallavakavāṭāmupamṛdya taddrumasambandhikṣīrasrutisugandhayo ye
himālayānilā dakṣiṇena pravṛttā asyām diśi vātum prastutāḥ 
te mayāśliṣyante |

kimartham | yadi kilaibhirmārutaiḥ sahavāsātkadācit
tvadīyaṃ śarīraṃ spṛṣṭaṃ bhavet | ataśca

vāhi vāta yataḥ kāntā tāṃ spṛṣṭvā māmapi spṛśeḥ|

bahvetatkāmayānasya śakyametena jīvitum {rāmāy5.75.8} | (Da)

dakṣiṇenetyenabantaḥ {p5.3.35} || 104 || ?iti?

\daksināvarta

tadaṅgaspṛṣṭasparśanamāha bhittveti ||

devadārudrumāṇām | dāruśabde sati kimartham drumaśabdaḥ 
prayukta iti nāśaṅkanīyaṃ sañjñāpātitvāddāruśabdasya |
uktaṃ ca sa devadārudrumavedikāyāmiti |

dakṣiṇena mārgeṇeti śeṣaḥ| prakṛtyādibhya upasaṅkhyānaṃ 
iti tṛtīyā {vārtt2.3.18} | asya viśeṣyāprayogaḥ samena dhāvati
viśeṣeṇa dhāvatītivat | prayuktaṃ ca bhūya evottareṇeti
|

guṇavati guṇaḥ śarīrasya hṛdyaḥ sparśaguṇo vivakṣitaḥ|
guṇavatyāliṅganādiṣu sukhasparśavatītyarthaḥ|

etadeva vivṛṇoti pūrvaspṛṣṭaṃ yadi kila bhavedaṅgamebhiḥ 
taveti | kilaśabdaḥ sambhāvanāyām | ebhistuṣārādrivātaiḥ|
itiśabdo hetau | asyārthasya mūlam vāhi vāta yataḥ kāntā tām
spṛṣṭvā māmapi spṛśeti śrīrāmāyaṇavacanam {rāmāy5.75.8}
(Va)|| 40 || -104-

\mallinātha

idānīṃ tadaṅgaspṛṣṭavastudarśanamāha bhittveti ||

devadārudrumāṇāṃ kisalayapuṭānpallavapuṭānsadyo bhittvā
tatkṣīrasrutisurabhayasteṣāṃ devadārudrumāṇāṃ 
kṣīrasrutibhiḥ kṣīraniṣyandaiḥ surabhayaḥ sugandhayaḥ|
tuṣārādrijātatve liṅgamidam | ye vātā dakṣiṇena
dakṣiṇamārgeṇa | tṛtīyāvidhāne prakṛtyādibhyaḥ 
upasaṅkhyānāttrṭīyā samena yātītivat | tatrāpi
karaṇatvasya pratīyamānatvātkartṛkaraṇayoreva tṛtīyeti
bhāṣyakāraḥ|

pravṛttāścalitāḥ| he guṇavati
sauśīlyasaukumāryādiguṇasampanne te tuṣārādrivātāḥ pūrvaṃ 
prāgebhirvātaistavāṅgaṃ spṛṣṭaṃ bhavedyadi kileti
sambhāvitametaditi buddhyetyarthaḥ| vārtāsambhāvyayoḥ 
kiletyamaraḥ| mayāliṅgyanta āśliṣyante |

atra vāyūnāṃ spṛśyatve 'pyamūrtatvenāliṅganāyogāt
āliṅgyanta ityabhidhānaṃ yakṣasyonmattatvātpralapitamiti
adoṣa iti vadanniruktakāraḥ svayamevonmattapralāpīti
upekṣaṇīyas || 47 || -104-

saṅkṣipyerankṣaṇa iva kathaṃ dīrghayāmāstriyāmāḥ 

sarvāvasthāsvaharapi kathaṃ mandamandātapaṃ syāt |

itthaṃ cetaścaṭulanayane durlabhaprārthanaṃ me  41 Da;

gāḍhoṣmābhiḥ kṛtamaśaraṇaṃ tvadviyogavyathābhiḥ|| 105 ||  48
Ma; 115 Su;

saṅkṣipyeta Da,Ma; saṅkṣipyante Su;  kṣaṇam Su; °yāmā triyāmā
Da,Ma;

VALL

he cañcalalocane gāḍhoṣmābhistīvrasantāpābhiḥ 
tvadvirahacintābhirmama mana itthaṃ durlabhaprārthanaṃ 
[aśaraṇam] kṛtam | yadyadduṣprāpaṃ tattadabhilaṣāmīti
arthaḥ|

tathā hi dīrghapraharāstriyāmā niśā nimeṣa iva katham
nāma saṅkṣipyerangaccheyuḥ|

tathā grīṣmamadhyāhnyādiṣvapi sakalāsu daśāsu dinaṃ 
atimṛduravibhramaṃ kathaṃ syāditi | etacca durlabham | na hi
nikhilā kṣaṇadā kṣaṇavatkṣīyate | na ca dinaṃ sarvadā
mandātapaṃ bhavati | gāḍhoṣmābhiriti ḍābubhāyāṃ 
anyatarasyām |

saṅkṣipyeranniti karmakartari || 105 || ?aśaraṇam?

\daksināvarta

saṅkṣipyeteti ||

prārthanāyām liṅ | sarvāvasthāsu grīṣmamadhyanindanāvasthāsu |
mandamandātapaṃ prakāre guṇavacanasyeti dvirvacanam {p8.1.12} |

aharapi mandātapameva syādityarthaḥ|

durlabhaprārthanaṃ durlabhatriyāmāsaṅkṣepādiprārthanam |
gāḍhoṣṇābhiranena divasasya mandātapasya vighāto vivakṣitaḥ|
aśaraṇamarakṣakaṃ |

tvadviyogavyathābhiranenatriyāmāsaṅkṣepapratibandhaḥ 
vivakṣitaḥ|| 41 || -105-

\mallinātha

saṅkṣipyeteti ||

dīrghā yāmāḥ praharās yasyāṃ sā dīrghayāmā | virahavedanayā
tathā pratīyamānetyarthaḥ|

triyāmā rātrirādyantayāradhayāmaryādinavyavahārāstriyāmāḥ 
iti kṣīrasvāmī |?

kṣaṇa iva kathaṃ kena prakāreṇa saṅkṣipyeta laghūkriyeta |

aharapi sarvāvasthāsu | sarvakāleṣvityarthaḥ|

mandamando mandaprakāraḥ| prakāre guṇavacanasyeti dviruktiḥ 
{p8.1.12} | karmadhārayavaduttareṣviti karmadhārayavadbhāvāt
supo luk | mandamandātapamatyalpasantāpaṃ kathaṃ syāt | na syāt
eva |

he caṭulanayane cañcalākṣītthamanena prakāreṇa
durlabhaprārthanamaprāpyamanorathaṃ me mama ceto gāḍhoṣmābhiḥ 
atitīvrābhistvadviyogavyathābhiraśaraṇamanāthaṃ kṛtam || 48
|| -105-

nanvātmānam bahu vigaṇayannātmanā nāvalambe

tatkalyāṇi tvamapi sutarāṃ mā gamaḥ kātaratvam |

kasyātyantaṃ sukhamupanataṃ duḥkhamekāntato vā

nīcairgacchatyupari ca daśāścakranemikrameṇa || 106 ||  42 Da;
49 Ma; 116 Su;

na tu Da,(Ma);  iti Su; ātmanaiva Ma; nitarām Da,Ma; daśā Da,Ma,Su;

VALL

ātmāvasthāṃ pratipādya samprati kartavyatāmāha ||

he kalyāṇi bhadre tatrāpi nanvātmānaṃ bahuvidhaṃ vigaṇayan
jānansvayameva nāvalambe na | api tu avalamba eva | pāmīti
arthaḥ|

tattvamapi priye kātaratvamadhairyaṃ sutarāmatyarthaṃ mā
gamo mā yāsīḥ|

yasmātkasya saṃsāriṇo nityaṃ sukhamupanataṃ ghaṭitaṃ 
ekāntato niyamena duḥkhaṃ vā |

yata etāḥ sukhāsukharūpā daśā avasthāścakranemivat
kadācinnīcairgacchantyadho yānti kadāciccopari pṛṣṭhe
| rathāṅgadhārāhi bhramantī krameṇādha upari ca yāti | tat
uktaṃ 

sukhaṃ ca duḥkhaṃ ca bhavābhavau  ca lābhālābhau maraṇaṃ 
jīvitaṃ ca | paryāyaśaḥ sarvamiha spṛśanti tasmādvīro na
prahṛṣyenna śocet {Ind.Sprüche7068} ||

nanvabhimukhīkaraṇe | mā gama iti ḷtittvādaṅ {comp:p3.1.55} ||
106 || ?daśā-daśās?

\daksināvarta

idānīṃ svaśokāvasthākarṇanena sā duḥkhitā bhaviṣyatīti
āśaṅkya tāmaśvāsayati neti ||

tuśabdo 'vadhāraṇe |

bahu vigaṇayanbahu bhadrakaṃ bhaviṣyatīti vijānannityarthaḥ|

ātmanā svayameva | avalamba dhārayāmi | bahu vigaṇayannātmānaṃ 
svadehaṃ svayameva dhārayāmītyarthaḥ| asya mūlam

duṣkaraṃ kurute rāmo hīno yadanayā prabhuḥ|

dhārayatyātmano dehaṃ na śokenāvasīdati || iti
śrīrāmāyaṇavacanam |

tattasmāt | kalyāṇi kalyāṇārthini |

tvamapi kalyāṇaśaṃsinī bhūtvā kātaratvam mā gaccheriti
arthaḥ| madviśiṣṭasyāpi sarvasya janasya sukhaduḥkhe paryāyeṇa
bhavata ityāha kasyeti | atyantamatikrāntāvasānaṃ nityaṃ 
iti yāvat |

ekāntata ekāntam | prathamārthe tasil || 42 || -106-

\mallinātha

nanviti ||

natvityekaṃ vākyam | tu śabdo bhedakas kiṃ tu na bhetavyamiti
arthaḥ| atha vā na  tvitipāṭhaḥ|

nanvityāmantraṇe | praśnanāvadhāraṇānujñānunayāmantraṇe
nanvityamaraḥ| nanu priye bahu vigaṇayañchāpānte satyevaṃ 
kariṣyāmītyāvartayan | ātmānamātmanaiva svenaiva |
prakṛtyādibhya upasaṅkhyānamiti tṛtīyā | avalambe dhārayāmi |
yathākathañcijjīvāmītyarthaḥ|

tattasmātkāraṇāddhe kalyāṇi subhage | tvatsāubhāgyenaiva
jīvāmīti bhāvaḥ| bahvādibhyaśceti nīṣ | tvamapi
nitarāmatyantaṃ kātaratvaṃ bhīrutvaṃ mā gamo mā gaccha |
gamermāṅi luṅ na māṅyoga ityamābhāvaḥ|? [aṅabhāvas?]

tādṛksukhinorāvayorīdṛśi duḥkhe kathaṃ na bibhemīti
āśaṅkyāha kasyeti | kasya janasyātyantaṃ niyataṃ sukhaṃ 
upanataṃ prāptamekāntato niyamena duḥkhaṃ vopanatam | kiṃ tu
daśā avasthā cakrasya rathāṅgasya nemistadantaḥ [anto nemiḥ ] |
cakraṃ rathāṅgaṃ tasyānte nemiḥ strī syāt pradhiḥ pumāniti
amaraḥ| tasyāḥ krameṇa paripāṭyā | kramaḥ parīpāṭyāmiti
viśvaḥ| nīcairadha upari ca gacchati pravartate | evaṃ jantos |
sukhaduḥkhe paryāvarta ityarthaḥ|| 49 || -106- ?natu-nanu reading?
?nemistadantas?

śāpānto me bhujagaśayanādutthite śārṅgapāṇau

māsānanyāngamaya caturo locane mīlayitvā |

paścādāvāṃ virahaguṇitaṃ taṃ tamātmabhilāṣaṃ 

nirvekṣyāvaḥ pariṇataśaraccandrikāsu kṣapāsu || 107 ||  43 Da; 50
Ma; 117 Su;

śeṣānmāsān Ma,Su; °gaṇitam Da; dvau tām Su;

VALL

kārttikaśukladvādaśyāṃ bhujagaśayanāccheṣatalpādutthite
śārṅgapāṇau harau mama śāpānto bhaviṣyati |

ataścādyārambhas?māsacatuṣṭayaṃ locane mīlayitvā
yathākathañcidgamayātivāhaya | tataḥ paścātsaṃyoge sati
cirakālaguṇitaṃ [virahakāla°?] tīkṣṇaṃ taṃ taṃ nānāvidhaṃ 
ātmano 'bhilāṣaṃ kāmaṃ paripakvaśāradajyotsnāsu niśāsu
āvāṃ nirvekṣyāva upabhuñjāvahe | locananimīlanenātra
yathātathātvam lakṣyate || 107 || ?tatas-paścāt? ?dvādaśa?

\daksināvarta

kadā kalyāṇamavayorbhaviṣyatītyapekṣāyāmāha
śāpānta iti ||

bhujaśayanādutthite śārṅgapāṇāviti anena yasmiñcharatkāle
paramapuruṣaḥ prabudhyate tasminkāle mama śāpānta ityuktam |

tathā kaurme purāṇe

kṣīrābdhau śeṣaparyaṅka āṣāḍhyāṃ saṃviśeddhariḥ|

nidrām tyajati kārttikyāṃ tayoḥ sampūjayeddharim || iti |

māsānanyāngamaya catura ityāṣāḍhamāsādikān
āśvayujamāsāntānityarthaḥ|

nanvāṣāḍhasya prathamadivasa ityuktam {2} | āṣāḍhaśrāvaṇau
prāvṛṭtataḥ paraṃ śaraditi prasiddham | tasmātkathaṃ 
āṣāḍhātprabhṛti māsacatuṣṭayātparaḥ śaratkāla iti
uktam | ucyate | ṛtūnāṃ kalpanā dvidhā | kecit ṣaḍṛtava iti
vadantyapare traya iti | atra tāvadṛtutrayapakṣāśrayeṇoktam
| tathā śrīrāmāyaṇa catvāro vārṣikāḥ proktā gatāḥ 
varṣaśatopamā iti |

locane mīlayitveti vacanaṃ lokokticchāyayoktam |

virahagaṇitamiti pāṭhaḥ| virahakāle •••••••••• iti ••••
saṅkalpitam | ātmābhilāṣaṃ gaṇayitvā? hṛdaye nihitamiti
arthaḥ|

nirvekṣyāvo 'nubhaviṣyāvaḥ|| 43 || -107-

\mallinātha

na ca niravadhikametadduḥkhamityāha śāpānta iti ||

śārṅgaṃ pāṇau yasya sa tasmin śārṅgapāṇau viṣṇoḥ|
saptamīviśeṣeṇetyādinā bahuvrīhiḥ| praharaṇārthebhyaḥ pare
niṣṭhāsaptamyau bhavata iti vaktavyātpāṇiśabdasya
uttaranipātaḥ|

bhujagaḥ śeṣa eva śayanaṃ tasmādutthite sati me śāpāntaḥ 
śāpāvasānāṃ bhaviṣyatīti śeṣaḥ|

śeṣānavaśiṣṭāṃścaturo māsān | meghadarśanaprabhṛti
haribodhanadināntamityarthaḥ| daśadivasādhikyaṃ tvatra na
vivakṣitamityuktameva | locane mīlayitvā nimīlya gamaya |
dhairyeṇātivāhayedityarthaḥ|

paścādanantaraṃ tvaṃ cāhaṃ cāvām | tyadādīni sarvaiḥ 
nityam ityekaśeṣaḥ| tyadādīnāṃ mithas dvandve yatparaṃ tat
śiṣyata ityasmadaḥ śeṣaḥ|

virahe guṇitamevaṃ kariṣyāmīti manasyāvartitaṃ taṃ tam |
vīpsāyām dviruktiḥ| ātmanorāvayorabhilāsaṃ manorathaṃ 
pariṇatāḥ śaraccandrikā yāsāṃ tāsu kṣapāsu rārtriṣu
nirvekṣyāvo bhokṣyāvahe | viśaterlṛṭ | nirveśas
bhṛtibhogaya ityamaraḥ|

atra kaiścit nabhonabhasyayoreva vārṣikatvātkathaṃ 
āṣāḍhādicatuṣṭayasya vārṣikatvamiti codayitva
ṛtutrayapakṣāśrayaṇādavirodha iti paryahāri | tatsarvaṃ 
asaṅgatam | atra gataśeṣāścaturo māsā ityuktam kavinā na tu
te varṣikā iti | tasmādanuktopālambha eva | yacca nāthena
uktam kathamāṣāḍhādicatuṣṭyātparaṃ śarakāla iti tatra
api ākārtikasamāpteḥ śaratkālānuvṛtteḥ 
pariṇataśaraccandrikāsvityuktam | na tu tadaiva
śaratprādurbhāva ukta ityavirodha eva || 50 || -107-

bhūyaścāha tvamapi śayane kaṇṭhalagnā purā me

nirdrāṃ gatvā kimapi rudatī sasvanaṃ viprabuddhā |

sāntarhāsaṃ kathitamasakṛtpṛcchataśca tvayā me  44 Da;

dṛṣṭaḥ svapne kitava  ramayankāmapi tvaṃ mayeti || 108 ||
51 Ma; 118

asi Da;  sasvaram Ma; satvaram Su;

VALL

idānīṃ suspaṣṭamabhijñānamāha ||

sa tvatpriya etaduktvā punarapi tvāmidamāha |

yathā pūrvaṃ bhavatī talpe māmāliṅgya suptā kenāpi nimittena
saśabdaṃ rudatī viprabuddhā vinidrā jātā | tato rodanahetuṃ 
