** This verse is given as 35 of the Pūrvamegha by Mallinātha, but put at
this place by Kāle, because other commentators do so, and because it
refers to the battle with Rāvana, that took place in Alakā and not in
Ujjajinī.

- The last five verses are held to be spurious by almost all commentators.

